<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Onobasulu Translation</book>
  <para style="h">Yone</para>
  <para style="toc1">Awalu Sulu Nafulu Yonehe Selelu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yone</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yon</para>
  <para style="rem">first drafted in 2012 and 2013 by the Onobasulu translation team (Wabele Fuga, Joseph Hambowali, Yobe Maibi and Jack Wasele). Draft was partly monitored by Beverly Mosley</para>
  <para style="rem">Advisor check by Anne Stoppels in 2014 with Wabele and Jack.</para>
  <para style="rem">Consultant Check in November 2019 with Beata Wozna, Beverly Mosley, Diksen Wadaga, Jonathan Hauwo, Juledy Jonathan, &amp; Mamele Fred.</para>
  <para style="rem">Corrections and improvements after CC were done by Wabele and Jack and Anne in Feb 2020</para>
  <para style="rem">We put in evidentials on all the verbs to indicate that John is actually giving an eyewitness report. march 2020</para>
  <para style="mt2">Awalu Sulu Nafulu</para>
  <para style="mt">Yonehe Selelu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Inolo bugo eweda selelumo, ehe ene wi bugo usu iwi seleba ufuluale. Aulugulu, abe selelubiba, nini fadaba asigibuale. Dawalolo inolo hilisesia, walelu faibe Yone ehe, ewe selelububa hilisefe. Maumo, lalolu 21.24 ami selesia, inolo bugo eweda selelumo, Yesune walelu faibe Ene hameselu amohe, bugo ewe seleluba solu. Walelu faibe Yesune hameselumo, Yone amo e. Ehe sulu ewe awasiamo, ene meleba, na auba mololuba soluale. Aubale. Ehe ene meleba muguba ofelesia, ene meleba saaba awasia, Yesune hameselu faibeba wi solu. Aufia, ehe ene meleba awasiamo, e selesia, Yesune hameselu faibehe auba molosoba awalu. Ehe sulu ewe sunia awasiamo, Yesuhe molosi, ene si abulu amone, awalabia daalu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yone awalu sulu nafulu iwi seleba ofelesiamo, sulu kiwi noolo eweguba waleyo hamefe. Kiwi uleno ewe. Godene sulumo, inolo domala alefasia, holobagafia, nini idele inolo aleba miliyo mulu. Amo E Yesu. Aufia, Yone hilisesia, idele inolo ilihe Godene Faibe Yesufea asigi ule homesi hamefe. Aufia, ilihe eweguba fadaba asigimesi hamefe. Mesaeamo, Godehe oloba huliale sulu saaba ofelesia, idele inoloda gasiba dafelagoba diyoba saaba ufulumo, Yesu amo E. Yone selesia, idele inolo Yesufea asigi ule waalefe ili amo, miliyolu miliyo diyobafeba solu. Idele inolohe miliyolu miliyo auba dimesifia, ehe bugo ewe seleba ufulu. (Yone 20.31 ami bamale.)</para>
  <para style="ip">Maugaba, Yonehe ninifea selesia, Yesu E-mo, Sulu labe. Amakele maugaiya amifia, Godedai alolumo, E. Aufia, Yonehe momolelu kegele Yesu mololu amone awalu. Auba awasimo, ninihe Yesu E Godene Faibe labeba fadaba bamesi aulu. Ninihe bugo ewe alegasiamo, nini bisigia, Yesu Ehe Yuda ili aselabia ano, amone kegele dedeba solu amone bosolu. E auba dedeba selesiamo, fufuloda, hanoda, naiyoda, yaneda, waini efoloda, aufia dofene sibi uluba adoda, kegele amo difasia, hebenene kegele amofea iminiba solu. Bugo ewe nini alegasiamo, Yuda idele inolo noolo Yesufea asigi ule ofelesia, noolo Yesufea asigi ule ufulualeba alegasu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Gisa inolohe Yesu aso seba sugaeyo labi, nigili amoyamo mololu amone awalumo, nini lalolu 13 abia lalolu 17 ami alegasu. Nigiliba amoyamo, Yesu Ene walelu faibilidai yoba sigia, sulu nafulu wedinale noolo ilifea saaba meba alolu. Aufia, nigiliba amoyamo, gisa inolohe Yesu sefasia, godosia, fadaayodoluale alolu. (Lalolu 18 ami bamale.) Godofasia, ilihe E imolane uluba ofelesi, E olalu. (Lalolu 19 ami bamale.) Aufia, Yesu E haiba degelu. E haiba degefia labi, Ene walelu faibili ilihe E abulu. (Lalolu 20-dai, 21-dai, ami bamale.)</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="rem">z1col-s</para>
  <para style="s">Sulu miliyoluda E inolo domalada alolu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 17:5">Yon 17.5</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 1:1-2">1Yon 1.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:13">MUU 19.13</ref></char>
    </note>Amakele maugaiya ami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:1">Sulu E alolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:1">Sulu E Godedai alolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:1">Sulu E Gode alolu.<verse eid="JHN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Amakele maugaiya ami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:2">Sulu E Godedai alolu.<verse eid="JHN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 8:6">1Kld 8.6</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:16-17">Kol 1.16-17</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:2">Hib 1.2</ref></char>
    </note>Efea alefasiasu, kegele sunia moloba holobagalu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:3">Kegele sunia mololu dobu ewe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:3">nolobalofia holobagaluale. Aubale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:3">Kegele sunia mololu dobu ewe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:3">Sulufea alefasiasu moloba holobagalu dobu.<verse eid="JHN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:26">Yon 5.26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>E-mo, miliyolune modo labe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:4">Miliyolu amo, idele inolone yane koleba labe.<verse eid="JHN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:19">Yon 3.19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yane ewe nigiligagalu aleba neeba dowebuso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:5">nigili gagaluhe amo seba sugaluale.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:1">Mad 3.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:13-17">Lug 1.13-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 1:76">76</ref></char>
    </note>Inolo uleno Gode alefasia hilibaisi mulu, ene wi <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yone</char>. Hano Gelo Yone amo e. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />E Godene sulu amone ulufaba saaba dafelagoyone mulu. E yane amone saaba sulu selesiamo, idele inolo suniahe sulu amo dofasia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule homesi</char> solu. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Ene e-mo, yane amoale. Aubale. E mulumo, yane amone ulufaba saaba dafelagoyone mulu.<verse eid="JHN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yon 8.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yane seale kolebamo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:9">idele inolo suniafea neeba dowefe amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:9">helefealu iwi suga miliba alolu.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />E helefealu iwi alolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:10">E alefasia, helefealu amo moloba holobagalu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:10">Auluso, helefealuhe E eloba abuluale.<verse eid="JHN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />E Ene mosomu moloa muluso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:11">Ene mosomuhe E luba duluale.<verse eid="JHN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Auluso, idele inolo Ene wifea asigi ule ofelesia, E-da luba dulumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:12">Ehe ili amofea Godene faibe alebaimesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:12">wi meba yaalu.<verse eid="JHN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:3-6">Yon 3.3-6</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:11">2.11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:23">1Fid 1.23</ref></char>
    </note>Ili Godene faibe alebaimesimo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:13">helefealu iwi faibe seba dilo eno amoguba holobagaluale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:13">Domalane hame amo alefasia, seba duluale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:13">Me, inolone hame mololo amo alefasia, seba duluale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:13">Aubale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:13">Gode Ene hame alefasia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:13">ili Ene seba dulu faibe alebaibu.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 2:7">Fil 2.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sulu E inolo domalada alefasia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">E nini aleba misiyo mulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">Ninihe Ene wabialelo <char style="w">elalelu</char> abulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">Wabialelo amo, Enaone Faibe ulelumone wabialelobiyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">E-mo Enaofea alefasia mulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">
    <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">Kanululone</char> modo, E labe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">Seale Sulu Sodo amone modo, E labe.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Inolo amone iminisia, Hano Gelo Yone wuaaba ulufaba saaba dafelagoba selesia, “Bama. Samini, nahe inolo amone saaba sulu eweguba solu. ‘Na faisalo saabe amo, na saminiba aafe. Mau enebamo, na aso male labi, Edale alolu.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kanululo Efea wasigaalu amo alefasia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:16">nini suniafea ediliba ofolabasu ado.<verse eid="JHN 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:28">Kis 34.28</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 6:14">Lom 6.14</ref></char>
    </note>Seale koleba, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesefea</char> alefasia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:17">Godehe sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> ninifea melu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:17">Aufia, Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisofea</char> alefasia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:17">Ehe Kanululodai, Seale Sulu Sododai, ninifea melu.<verse eid="JHN 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 33:20">Kis 33.20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:46">Yon 6.46</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:16">1Dim 6.16</ref></char>
    </note>Inolo ulenohe Gode bolale koleba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:18">Auluso, Godene Faibe ulelu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:18">Ene E Gode ligia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:18">E Enaone hamesa ligia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:18">ule E-su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:18">Ehe ninifea walesia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:18">Gode amobuba walelu.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-e</para>
  <para style="s">Hano Gelo Yonehe sulu ulufaba saaba melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Madiyu 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7-8">Maga 1.7-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:15-17">Lugu 3.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> guni inolo ilihe <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> nooloda, Lifai inolo nooloda, Yelusalame afasia, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yone</char> labea hilibaisalu. Ausi, ili milibaifasia, efea doba bisigia, “Ga abe koleba?” Auba selesi, Yonehe sulu ulufaba saaba meso. <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Ehe sulu muguba ofelesiale, e eweguba ulufaba saaba dafelagoso. “Na-mo Kelisoale.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Lo 18.15</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mad 11.14</ref></char>
    </note>E auba selesi, ilihe efea saabia doba bisigia, “Ga amoalenaga, amo ga abe? Ga Elaiyala?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">E selesia, “Amo naale.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Ga Godene <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo nola?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">E obegeba selesia, “Amoda naale.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Ausi, ili saabia doba bisigia, “Amo, ga koleba abe? Inolo ninida hilibaisalu amofea saaba meyone, ninifea obegeba saama. Ga gene melebamo abeba selese?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Ais 40.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, Yonehe eweguba seleso. “Saminimo saaba ofolo <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaia</char> selesia, <char style="qt">‘Hele falaiya inoloda maleiya ami, inolone mofe goo eweguba wuaaba saeyobafe. <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> eno isoba felaba madenema!’</char> Aisaia auba saaba ufulu. Mofe goo amo, na lolu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24-25" />Yone auba selesi, <char style="w">Falisi</char> alefasia hilibaisalu inolo ili amohe, efea eweguba doba besabeo. “Ga Kelisoalenaga, aufia ga Elaiyalenaga, saaba ofolo no amoda galenaga, amo enesi, gahe idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> waalese?”<verse eid="JHN 1:24-25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Ausi, Yonehe ine sulu eweguba obegeba seleso. “Nahe ili hano geba waalelo. Auluso, inolo uleno gilihe dawalobualemo, gili aleba iwi yoba labe. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:15">Yon 1.15</ref></char></note>Inolo amo, dufia na faisa saabeba solu amo, E. E-mo wi bule labe, na widale lolu. Na-mo balu inolo ligia, Ene balu dabalu moloyone, na lilibuale lolu. Ene samaga husia, efolo fisigaeyo amoneda, na lilibuale.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Kegele amo mololumo, hano Yodene egewi nooloba, Bedani mosomu ami moloso. Hele amimo, Yonehe idele inolo hano geba waaleba adeso.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E Godene Dofene Sibi Edo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:6-7">Ais 53.6-7</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:18-19">1Fid 1.18-19</ref></char>
    </note>Adigi no, Hano Gelo Yonehe, Yesu e labea migagaba saabemo baafia, selesia, “Bama. Anogo Godene <char style="w">Dofene Sibi Edo</char>. Ehe helefealu idele inolo suniane <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> diba dafiyone saabe. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:15">Yon 1.15</ref></char></note>Inolo amo, samini nahe E saaba eweguba sulu solu. ‘Inolo na faisada saabemo, na saminiba aafe. Mau enebamo, na aso male labi, Edale alolu.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Nene na-mo, E amoba fadaba asigiluale. Auluso, nahe idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> waaleyo mulumone, maumo ewe. Na mulumo, inolo anogomo <char style="w">Isolaele</char> idele inolo ilifea ulufaba ufiyone mulu.” Yone auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mad 3.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yone</char> ulufaba saaba dafelagosia selesia, “Na bisigia, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane Noekene</char> haga maliabugulu <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> huga inigia, E saabia misiyo saabi abulu. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Nene na-mo, E amoba aso fadaba asigiluale. Auluso, Gode nada hano geba waalemesi hilibailumo, E nafea eweguba seleso. ‘Gahe <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> huga inigia, inolo ulenofea aselesi besenaga, amo ga eweguba asigima. Inolo amohe idele inolo Asubane Noekenehe geba waaleyobafe.’ Godehe nafea auba seleso. <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mad 3.17</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, nahe inolo anogofea auba molofe amo bafasia, ewe Godene Faibebuba ulufaba dafelagoba selesu.” Hano gelo Yone auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo osoloa Yesune walelu faibili alolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Adigi no, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yone</char> edai, ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> noolo amone aida amodai, ami haiba adeso. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:29">Yon 1.29</ref></char></note>Yonehe Yesu suniaba aafe amo baafia, e selesia, “Bama, anogo Godene <char style="w">dofene sibi edo</char>.” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Walelu faibili aida amohe sulu selefe dofasia, aaluhe Yesu kuliba aaso. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu E nolofia, aalu E kuliba saabi baafia, selesia, “Aali ene isase?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Ausi, aaluhe Efea doba bisigia, “<char style="it">Labai</char>, ga molo wagi ese?” Wi <char style="it">Labai</char>ba selefe ewene sulu mau sisamo, “Walelo.”<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Ausi, Yesuhe aalufea eweguba seleso. “Aali aine babiyo mila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:39">Ausi, aalu E galiba daafia, molo Eda saabea amo bafasia, hilia amo Edai adeso. Halosi binibo geidesi, auso. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:18-20">Mad 4.18-20</ref></char></note>Yone selefe dofasia, Yesuda kuliba daalu inolo aida amone ulenomo, <char style="w" lemma="Adulu">Adulubiyo</char>. <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char> <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidane</char> elewo amo e.<verse eid="JHN 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Yesudai alolu alefasia, kegele Adulu maugaba mololumo, ewe. Ehe ene elewo Saimono isafasia, efea selesia, “Anihe <char style="it">Mesaea</char>mo abulu.” (Hibulu sulu <char style="it">Mesaea</char> amo, no Giligi sulubamo <char style="it">Keliso</char>ba sodo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mesaea </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo Keliso, amo Gode alefasia iminiba ufulu inolo E.</char></note>) <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:18">Mad 16.18</ref></char></note>Aufia, Aduluhe e lubia, Yesu labea aaso. Aalu E saabea goasi, Ehe e bisigia selesia, “Yonene faibe, Saimono, ga labe. Aga iwifiamo, ge wimo, <char style="it"><char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Sifase</char></char>ba saeyobafe.” Amone besilumo, <char style="it">Fida</char>. <char style="it">Fida</char>ba selefe amone sulu kiwimo, abane baliamaba sodo. <figure style="fig" alt="Andrew calls Peter" file="43_Jn_01_07_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="1.35-42">Adulu ene elewo Saimonofea selesia, Yesu babiyo milafe.</figure><verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Filibidai Nadanieledai E kuliba milalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Adigi no ami, Yesu E Galili helea maiyo daiyaso. Aufia, Yesu Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Filibi[[1]], Yesune walelu faibe">Filibi</char> wakalifia, efea selesia, “Na kuliba mila.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filibi, eda Besaida dauno amone inolo. <char style="w" lemma="Adulu">Aduluda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidada</char>, aine mosomuda amo. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:18">Lo 18.18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 7:14">Ais 7.14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:6">9.6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:5">Jer 23.5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:23">Ese 34.23</ref></char></note>Aufia, Filibihe Nadaniele isaeyo daafia, efea selesia, “Inolo amone saaba <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesehe</char> <char style="w">muguli</char> bugo usu sulu selelu amo, ninihe wakalilu. Inolo amone saaba, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> ilida sulu selelu. Amo, Nasalede inolo, <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[2]], Malia, Yesune enae amone aino e">Yosebene</char> faibe, Yesu E.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Ausi, Nadanielehe efea doba bisigia selesia, “Nasalede ugi, kegele nafulu uleno holobagaeyobafebuba, ga hilisefe dagulo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Ausi, Filibi efea obegeba selesia, “Gene babiyone mila.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesuhe Nadaniele E labea migagaba saabi bisigia, selesia, “Inolo saabe ogo, seale <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaele mosomu</char> inolo. Efeamo, masega mana male koleba.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nadanielehe Yesufea doba bisigia, selesia, “Gahe na halaguba dawaloba abulu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, “Fogo Filibihe ga aso webale labi, ga <char style="w" lemma="Olono i - Olono sebe">olono i</char> mau sisa ami yoba saabi, Na abulu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.49 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:33">Mad 14.33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:16">16.16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:11">Mag 3.11</ref></char>
    </note>Nadanielehe ulufaba dafa selesia, “<char style="it">Labai</char>, Ga Godene faibe. <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaelene</char> kinimo, Ga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu selesia, “Nahe ga-mo olono i mau sisa yoba saabi abuluba solumone, ga <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulula</char>? Dufiamo, gahe wasolu kegele, abulu amoguluale babiyobafe.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Stt 28.12</ref></char></note>Aufia, Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Na seale gilifea selesu, dufiamo, gilihe <char style="w">hebene</char> eno sogoba ofelesi babiyobafe. Aufia, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> ilimo <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.51 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Inololene Faibe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo Yesu iminife. </char></note> labea felaeyo sugaeyoba alebaiyobafe. Gilihe auba babiyobafe.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe hanomo waini dedegeba ofeleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Hilia osolo adesi, Galili helea mosomu Kana ami, ido ifosi, Yesune enae ami alolubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Ausi, Yesuda, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilida</char>, ilida ido ifofea ami milesi saaba sigisi, milibaiso. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" /><char style="w">Waini</char> hano samodosi, Yesu ene enaehe Efea selesia, “Ili ewe waini samodolubu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 7:30">Yon 7.30</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:20">8.20</ref></char>
    </note>Yesu obegeba selesia, “Nae, amone anihe eneba moloyobi? Ne fogo aso holobagaluale dobu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Auba selesi, ene enaehe dabalu mololo inolofea selesia, “E alefasia, gilifea kegele uleno molomaba selefeguba, molomaleba” seleso.<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Fogo amo, <char style="w">Yuda</char> idele inolo ilihe Godene si saabia amimo galagololu miliyone, hano mudo manamo elo ufulumo wedinale ufulubiyo. Molo sunia hano muliyone gofo waalelubiyo. Ido ifofea amimo, molo usu ami, abane mololu gofo kaabeba waalelubiyo. Gofo ule ulebamo, hano wasulu 100 lida amoguba wasigaaba waalelubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Ausi, Yesuhe dabalu mololo inolo ili amofea selesia, “Gofo amo hano wasigaaba waalema.” Ausi, ilihe gofo amo hano wasiga sauuba waaleso.<verse eid="JHN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Auba wasigaaba waalesi, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Gilihe hano noolo wasiba difasia, naiyoda luba labe namenesi, efea meyo mala.” Auba selesi, dabalu mololo ilihe hano noolo wasiba difasia, naiyoda luba labe efea meyo aaso. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Ausi, naiyoda luba adohe hano amo naasi, e waini hano nenalebalu besabeo. Auluso, ehe waini amo amifia muluba fadaba asigisale. Dabalu mololo, hanoda wasiba waalelu ili amosu, fadaba asigiso. Hano ili wasigaaba waalelumo, waini dedegelubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />Ausi, inolo naiyoda luba ado amohe, inolo idoda diyo amofea selesia, “Inolo suniahe, weba sigilu idele inolo namenesimo, waini nenalebalu amodale osolalo. Aufia, ili waini bule nafasia kagoafia labimo, ehe ilifea waini nenalebalualemo osolalo. Auluso, gahe waini nenalebalumo diba ofasia alolune, aga yaagi dibia saabe.” <figure style="fig" alt="Water into wine" file="43_Jn_02_06_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="2.3-11">Yesuhe hanomo waini dedegeba ofelefe.</figure><verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />
    <char style="w">Momolelu kegele</char> ewemo, Yesuhe momolelu kegele mololu amone agelemo, ewebiyo. Ehe Kana mosomu disiligi Galili ami moloso. Momolelu kegele ewemo, Ene wabialelo <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elalelumodai</char>, Ene kiwigagaludai, eloba bamesi imini walesia auso. Ausi, Ene walelu faibili ilihe amo bafasia, Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofeleso</char>.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:13">Mad 4.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba molofasia, E Kafanima suga maiyo abiamo, E Ene enaeda, Ene elewodalida, aufia Ene walelu faibilida ili ua dedaleso. Amimo, ili hilia noolo adeso.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo sebele moloa bisinesi dabaluda molosia waalelu ili amo, Yesuhe aiba gasaba dafaliso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Madiyu 21.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maga 11.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Lugu 19.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kis 12.1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> <char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> Hilia hagoale adesi, Yesu E Yelusalame fela aaso. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Yesu E <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usu faseba sugafia, Ehe ami inolo noolo <char style="w" lemma="Dofene keao">dofene keaoda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Dofene sibi">dofene sibida</char>, haga maliabuda, elegesia waalesi, noolomo ailalu saabia ami mole bedosia, waaleba labi besabeo. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Aufia, Yesuhe efolo sabofia, fegoyone moloso. Aufia, Ehe amo sefia, inolo suniada, ine dofene sibida, ine dofene keaoda, aiba gasaba yaasi, ili sebele molo gadefia dedaleba yaaso. Ausi, Ehe inolo moleda bedosia waalefemone mole guguba dafelesia, ine ailalumoda besigaba dafaliso. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Aufia, Ehe inolo haga maliabuda elegesia waalelu ili amofea selesia, “Gine kegele ogo dibia dedaleba yaama! Gilihe Naone molo ewe elegeba adagulu molomabu!”<verse eid="JHN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:9">Sng 69.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilihe</char> mana E molofe amo bafasia, ilihe Godene bugohe selelu dobumo hiliseba obegeso. Sulu amo eweguba, <char style="qt">“molo amo nafulu melesi, na hamesia, ne libo usu de waiyasia na naafe.”</char><verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Auluso, Yudane guni inolo ilihe, mana Yesu molofe amo baafia, Efea doba bisigia selesia, “Kegele ewe ga aga mololumo, ga auba moloyone wida labela? Ninihe ga wida labebuba eloba bamesine, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> uleno moloma. Eloba bamesi kegele hala, ga ninifea walese?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mad 26.61</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27.40</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Gilihe <char style="w">sebele molo</char> ewe bidiba dafelesi, Nahe hilia osoloa alefasia, amo diba obegeyo.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Ausi, guni inolo ilihe obegeba selesia, “Wae, ilihe hamu daabuluba binibafia kaabebahe (46) sebele molo ogo dulubiyo. Aufia, Gahe hilia osoloadenohe molo ogo diba obegeyodolububa hilisefe dagulo?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:19">1Kld 6.19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, sebele molo E solu amomo, Ene domalafea iminiba seleso. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:6-8">Lug 24.6-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:16">Yon 12.16</ref></char></note>Dufia, Godehe Yesu dana balia ami degeba ifofia labimo, Ene walelu faibilihe sulu solu amone hiliseba obegeso. Aufia, ilihe Godene bugohe selelu dobu amofea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesia</char>, Yesu sulu solu amofeada asigi ule ofeleso.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolo suniane mana asigiba samodobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 7:31">Yon 7.31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> Hilia ami, Yesu aso Yelusalame labi, idele inolo wedinale ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Momolelu kegele">eloba bamesine momolelu kegele</char> E molofe amo baafia, ilihe Ene wifea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule waaleso</char>. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Auluso, Yesu Ehe ili amofea asigi ule ofelesale. Mau enebamo, Ehe idele inolo suniane mana asigiba samodobu. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Inolo ulenohe inolo none manamo Efea ulufaba saaba dafelagoyone dabalu malebiyo. Aubale. Idele inolo suniane asigimo, E baaba samodolubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Nikodimasedai sulu seleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 7:50">Yon 7.50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:39">19.39</ref></char>
    </note>Fogo amohe <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo uleno, ene wi Nikodimase, ami alolu. <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> galisolo amone inolo ulenomo, e-biyo.<verse eid="JHN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />E nigiliba Yesu labea milifasia, selesia, “<char style="it">Labai</char>, Ga walelo uleno, Godefea alefasia mulu labebuba, nini hilisebu. Enebamo, Gode E-su inolo ulenodai ligialebiaga, amo ehe <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char>, ga molofe amoguba, molobaiyale. Aulugulu, Gode Gadai labebuba hilisesu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mad 18.3</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:23">1Fid 1.23</ref></char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, “Na seale koleba gafea selesu. Inolo uleno saabia haiba no galinosalenaga, amo ehe Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo adamo babiyobafale.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Yesu auba selesi, Nikodimasehe obegeba selesia, “Inolo asidalu alolu labe ewe, saabia no hili halaguba galinoyobi? E enaene ela molo usu obegeba suga daafia, haiba galinofia seba diyobafebile?” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus and Nicodemus" file="C063.JPG" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention. Used with permission." ref="3.1-17">Yesuhe Nikodimasedai sulu selefe.</figure><verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 36:25-27">Ese 36.25-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe obegeba selesia, “Na seale gafea selesu. Uleno hanodai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ewe, asigi ule ofelesi, hano gefe amone selefe. </char></note> <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> amodaifeafia galinosalenaga, Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo ada ami sugaeyobafale. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:13">Yon 1.13</ref></char></note>Domalahe galinofemo, domala seba dilo. Asubanehe galinofemo, asubane seba dilo. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Gili koleba haiba saabia hili no galinoyo dobu. Na auba selefe ewe dofasia hidigimabu. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Fufulo fuusiamo, ene hamefeguba fuulo. Gahe ene galamo doboloso, e amifia saabe, me e ami aafeba eloba bolale. Amogubasu, Asubanehe idele inolo hili galinofemo, e halaguba molofe, ninihe amoda eloba bolale.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Auba selesi, Nikodimasehe Efea doba bisigia selesia, “Kegele ga selefe ogomo, halaguba holobagaeyobafebi?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Ausi, Yesuhe ene sulu obegeba selesia, “Ga <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaelene</char> walelo inolo uleno ligia, kegele ewene ga aso babeafela? Enesi ause? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Na seale gafea selesu, nini sulu sodomo, kegele nini asigibu amone sodo. Aufia, nini sulu ulufaba saaba dafelagolomo, kegele nini abulu amone saaba dafelagolo. Auluso, sulu nini ulufaba saaba dafelagosu ewe, gili difale. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Nahe helefealune kegele ewene gilifea selesimo, gili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesale</char>. Aulugulu, Nahe <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenene</char> kegele gilifea selesenaga, amo gili asigi ule eneba ufiyobafebi? Amo kolelu koleba.<verse eid="JHN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Inolo uleno <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi daaluda male. Aubale. <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> hebenefia huga mulu amo, E-su lagi alolu.<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:4-9">Nam 21.4-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:28">Yon 8.28</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12.32</ref></char>
    </note>Saminimo, hele falaiya ami, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesehe</char> soiye i baaba dofafia, digiba lagoluguba, aubasu ilihe Inololene Faibe Eda i baaba dofafia, digiba lagoyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:31">Yon 20.31</ref></char></note>Ausi, idele inolohe Efea asigi ule waalefemo, <char style="w" lemma="Miliyolu miliyo">miliyolu miliyobafe</char>.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:36">Yon 3.36</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:28">10.28</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 5:8">Lom 5.8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:32">8.32</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 4:9-10">1Yon 4.9-10</ref></char>
    </note>Godehe helefealu idele inolo sunia bule koleba hamesefia, Ene Faibe ele ule alolumo melu. E auba mololumo, idele inolo sunia Efeada asigi ule waalefemo, woba dafelesiale, miliyolu miliyo sefia, melesi aulu. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:10">Lug 19.10</ref></char></note>Godehe Ene Faibe helefealu iwi hilibailumo, Ehe idele inolo osolaba dafalimesi hilibailuale. Aubale. Godehe E hilibailumo, idele inolo sunia E alefasia <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diyone</char> aulu.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:24">Yon 5.24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele inolo abehe Efea asigi ule waalefemo, ili sefia osolaba dafaliluale alebaibu. Auluso, abehe Efea asigi ule waalefale, ili amo ama sefia osolaba dafulu alebaibu. Mau enebamo, ilihe Godene Faibe ulelumone wifea asigi ule ufulualene aubu.<verse eid="JHN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:5">Yon 1.5</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">8.12</ref></char>
    </note>Sefia osolaba dafulu dobu amone maumo, eweguba. Yane helefealu iwi suga mulu. Auluso, idele inolohe yane hamebale ligia, nigiligagalu bule hamelo. Maumo, ine mana wolu amo alefasia, aulu. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Idele inolo suniahe mana wolu moloba yaalomo, ili amo yanefea gogoloba ado. Ine wolu molofemo ulufaba bolosisia, ili yanefea miliyo dedalelale.<verse eid="JHN 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Auluso, idele inolo mana seale moloba yaalomo, ili yanefea miliyo dedalelo. Ilihe ine mana Godefea alefasia molofemo ulufaba bamesifia aulo.” Yesuhe Nikodimasefea auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hano Gelo Yonehe Yesu E amobuba ulufaba seleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:1-2">Yon 4.1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Yesuda, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilida</char>, ili abia, Yudia hele maiyo aaso. E hele ami fogo noolo ligia, idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> waaleba adeso. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Hano Gelo Yone</char> eda, hele Aenono ami, Salimi hagoaleba ami, idele inolo hano geba waaleba alolubiyo. Enebamo, hele ami hano wedinale waalelubiyo. Ausi, idele inolo ili hano geyone ami milibaiba adeso. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Fogo ewemo Yone e aso dibolo dafogobale alolubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Yonene walelu faibilidai, Yudane guni inolo ulenodai, hegeyone sulu uleno maugalubiyo. Ilihe sulu solumo, Godene si saabia galagololu holobagaeyone, nuguma heeyone mana halaguba kuliba maiyobiba, sulu saeyone kowesia hegelubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Aufia, ili Yone labea milibaifia, efea selesia, “Walelo, doma. Inolo ewe, samini gadai hano Yodene segeba nolobalo anogolo alolu amo, ga asigima. Gahe E saaba ulufaba dafelagoba solumo, inolo ogohe aga idele inolo hano geba waalesi, sunia E labea dedaleso.” Hano Gelo Yonene walelu faibili efea auba solubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Amomo Yonehe obegeba selesia, “Gode <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> kegele uleno inolo ulenofea mesalenaga, amo e diyobafale. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yon 1.20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:10">Mad 11.10</ref></char></note>Samini, na eweguba solu. ‘Na-mo <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisoale</char>. Aubale. Na-mo, E milesine, Godehe nadale saminiba hilibailu.’ Na auba solumo, gine dubuluguba, gili sulu amo gine ulufaba saaba dafelagoyo dobu.<verse eid="JHN 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Ido ifosiamo, inolo abefea ido aafe amo, e idoda dilo adefe. Ausi, idoda dife amone samamo, e koneni kifia ligia, idoda dife amone sulu selefemo dubiyone henefia ado. Amogubasu, agamo na henelo wasigaafe. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Ene wi kolebamo bulemesi. Ne wi kolebamo wedinoyoba.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 8:23">Yon 8.23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo anafia suga mulu E-mo, suniane ana labe. Helefealu ewene inolomo, e helefealu ewene mana sunia moloba ligia, ehe helefealu kegele ewenesu sulu sodo. Auluso, inolo hebenefia suga mulu amo, E-mo suniane ana labe. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:11">Yon 3.11</ref></char></note>Kegele E abulu amoneda, dubulu amoneda, E ulufaba saaba dafelagoba selefe. Auluso, sulu E auba selefe amo dofasia, inolo uleno diba difale.<verse eid="JHN 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Auluso, inolo abehe Ene ulufaba saaba dafelagolu sulu amo dofasia, koleba diba dife amo, e eloba bamesine walesia, Gode E seale sulu sodoba walefe. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Inolo Gode alefasia hilibaisi mulu amo, Ehe Godene sulusu sodo. Mau enebamo, Godehe Ene Asubane mesiamo, haisi haisiba melale.<verse eid="JHN 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mad 11.27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:20">Yon 5.20</ref></char>
    </note>Enaohe Ene faibe koleba hamesefia, kegele sunia Ene sone saabia ufulu. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16-18">Yon 3.16-18</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 5:12">1Yon 5.12</ref></char></note>Inolo abehe Ene Faibefea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufia</char> labe e-mo, <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> sefia labe. Auluso, inolo abehe Faibefea faiso mefe amo, miliyolu miliyo amo babiyobafale. Aubale. Godene gadilomo efea ufiasu labe.” Hano Gelo Yone auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu E Samalia idodai sulu seleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:22">Yon 3.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu Ehe idele inolo wedinale <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> waalesi, Ene kuliba sibaisalu faibili wedinale adesia, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yonene</char> <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> waseleso. Noolohe Yesu galiba sibaisalo ili amo auba waselefeba selaba yaasi, <char style="w">Falisi</char> ili dubulubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Auluso, seale koleba, Yesu Ene Ehe, idele inolo amo hano geba waalesale. Ene walelu faibili ili amohe, idele inolo hano geba waaleso. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Yesuhe Falisi ili sulu auba dubuluba asigisia, E Yudia afasia, haiba Galili helea obegeba aaso.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Aufia, eno Eda kuliba daalumo, Samalia disiligi aleba ami daalubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Stt 33.19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Jos 24.32</ref></char></note>Aufia, E daafia, dauno uleno Samalia ami, Sikaba soda ami goaso. Dauno Sika amo, hele <char style="w" lemma="Yekobo">Yekobohe</char> ene faibe <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[1]], Yekobone faibe hugulubamone ulenomo, e">Yosebefea</char> meiya aniba ami ufulubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Yekobone hano walulu sugulomo ami ufulubiyo. Halo dogo adesi, Yesu E miliba labeofia bonesi, hano walulu aniba ami yoba aseleso.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />E ami yoba saabi, Samalia ido uleno hano wasiyo saabeo. Yesuhe efea selesia, “Ga Nafea hano naiyoba wasiba memaleyobile?” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Ene walelu faibili ili dauno ami naiyo elegeyo dedaleba yaafia labi, Yesu elebi ami asulubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 4:1-5">Esr 4.1-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Samalia ido amohe Efea selesia, “Ga <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo, na Samalia ido. Enebane Gahe nafea hano naiyoba wasiba memase?” Ido amohe sulu amo solu, maumo, Yuda ilimo, Samaliadai sesamaba adalene solu.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 7:37-38">Yon 7.37-38</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:6">MUU 21.6</ref></char>
    </note>E auba selesi, Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, “Gahe inolo gafea hano memafe ogoda fadaba dawalolu ligiabiaga, amo gahe Efea koleba, hano nafea wasiba memaba sabaiyo. Aufia, gahe Godene ulu melo kegele amone asigilu ligiabiaga, amo ga Efea koleba selesia, nafea hano wasiba memaba sabaiyo. Ga auba selesiabiaga, Ehe gafea miliyolu miliyo hano wasiba mebaiyo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Yesu auba selesi, ido amohe Efea selesia, “Inolo, ga gofo malebu. Hano walulu sugulo ewe, gogolu kolebabu. Aulugulu, ga miliyolu miliyo hano ogo, wagi wasiyo? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:53">Yon 8.53</ref></char></note>Nine nauwa Yekobo ehe hano walulu ewemo nine nauwadalifea melubiyo. Ene eda waluiya sugulo amifia hano mololubiyo. Aufia, ene faibili ilida, ene dofene keaoda, dofene sibida, hano ewe nabaiba adobiyo. Aulune, ga Yekobo wasolububa hilisefe dagulo?” Ido amo Yesufea auba doba abulu.<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Ausi, Yesu efea obegeba selesia, “Idele inolo suniahe hano ewe naafemo, saabia no hano nabaiyeba miliyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:35">Yon 6.35</ref></char></note>Auluso, idele inolo hano Na wasiba meyobasu ewe naafe ili amo, saabia no hano nabaiyeba miliyobafale. Aubale. Hano Na ilifea meyobasu ewe, hano sugulo dugulesia, ilifea udiaba miliyobafe. Hano ewe ilifea auba sugulo dugulesia udiaba ligia, <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> nafulu ilifea meba miliyobafe.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Ausi, ido amohe selesia, “Inolo, Gahe hano ogo nafea mema. Na hano saabia no nabaiyemesiale. Aufia, na hano iwi saabia no wasiyo bobolaba miliyalene, hano ogo nafea mema!” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus and the woman at the well" file="BA03029.tif" size="col" copy="(SIL) used with permission of Louise Bass." ref="4.4-26">Yesu E Samalia idodai sulu selefe.</figure><verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Auba selesi, Yesu efea selesia, “Ga ge gaino weyo mala. Aalifaba iwi obegeba milale.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Idohe Efea obegeba selesia, “Na inolodale.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesuhe efea selesia, “Ga inolodaleba selefe ogo, amo ga seale selefe. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Enebamo, ga samini inolo bia amofea daalubiyo. Aufia, inolo aga gadai saabe ogomo, ge gaino sealealebu. Sulu ga selefe ogomo seale koleba.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Yesu auba selesi, idohe Efea selesia, “Inolo, aga na bisigia, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> ulenomo, Ga-buba bosolu. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:5-14">Lo 12.5-14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 122:1-5">Sng 122.1-5</ref></char></note>Nine nauwadalimo hele gale iwi guluguluba meba ado. Auluso, Yuda gili selesia, ‘Hele nini Godefea guluguluba meyo dobu amo, Yelusalame ami labeba’ sodo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Ido auba selesi, Yesu efea obegeba selesia, “Ga Ne sulu ewe sigiba doma. Hilia uleno holobagasimo, gilihe hele gale iwi Naofea guluguluyobafale. Aufia, gilihe Efea Yelusalame amida guluguluyobafale. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:29-41">2Kin 17.29-41</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:3">Ais 2.3</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:4-5">Lom 9.4-5</ref></char></note>Samalia gilihe, gulugululomo, kegele gili asigibuale amofea gulugululo. Auluso, Yuda ninihe, gulugululomo, kegele nini asigibu amofea gulugululo. Mau enebamo, Gode alefasia, idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> diyonemo, Ehe nini Yudadale molobebelelu. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Auluso, seale gulugululo idele inolomo asubanefea alefasia, Naofea sealeba guluguluyobafe hilia amo holobagaeyobafe. Ee, hilia amo, aga ama holobagafia labe. Enebamo, Naohe amoguba gulugululo idele inolo amone koleba hamefe. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 3:17">2Kld 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:1">Lom 12.1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:3">Fil 3.3</ref></char></note>Gode E Asubane. Aufia, idele inolo Efea gulugulusiamo, asubanefea alefasia, seale koleba guluguluyo dobu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:41">Yon 1.41</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu auba selesi, idohe Efea selesia, “Na hilisesia, <char style="it">Mesaea</char>, Ene wi <char style="w">Keliso</char>, miyobafeba hilisebu. E inigiamo, kegele sunia ninifea fadaba saaba meyobafe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 14:61-62">Mag 14.61-62</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ido auba selesi, Yesu efea selesia, “Nene Na, aga gadai sulu selaba lolu ewe, Na amo E.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Yesu auba selaba labi, Ene walelu faibili obegeba milibaiso. Ili bisigia, E ido ulenodai sulu selaba labi, ili hidigiba hiliseso. Auluso, Ga amene hamefe, me Ga ido ogodai enesi sulu selaba eleba, auba inolo uleno Efea doba besabeale.<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Ausi, ido amohe ene gofomo gadefia, daunone yalalu usu obegeba aaso. Aufia, ehe idele inolofea selesia, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Gilihe inolo ewe bea mila. Kegele sunia na samini mololumo, Ehe nafea saaba samodoso. Amo E Kelisobile?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Ido amo auba selesi, ilihe dauno amo gadefia, Yesu labea milibaiso.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Amo fogomo, Ene walelu faibili Yesufea eweguba seleso, “<char style="it">Labai</char>, Ga naiyo namena.” <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Auluso, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Naiyo gilida asigibuale amone na nolo dobu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Ausi, Ene walelu faibili ine geleba nenesia selesia, “Uleno alefasia, naiyo Efea dia mulubile?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:38">Yon 6.38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ili auba selesi, Yesu ilifea selesia, “Ne naiyo nolomo, E Nada malalu amone hame kuliba abia, Ene dabalu moloba samodoyo amo. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:2">Lug 10.2</ref></char></note>Gili eweguba sodalela? ‘Sebe suiyo hilia holobagaeyobafemo, aube biniba aso dobu.’ Auluso, na gilifea selesu. Gili koleba si fisigama. Edo gelu ogo nafuluba bama. Ogo sumesine gegeneba yaabu. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Sebeda sufe amo, aga ene elebe disiamo, miliyolu miliyo sebe amone gagaiyoba ofolaba labe. Edoda gefe amodai, sebeda sufe amodai, aalifaba henemesine aufe. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Sulu ewe sealeba selaba adefe. ‘Nomo edo gelo, nomo sebe sulo.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Na alefasia gili hilibaisasiamo, samini gili dabalu mololuale amolo sebe sumesine hilibaisasu. Inolo noolo edo hogoloba gelubiyo. Aufia, gilihe ine dabalu amone sebe sufe.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samalia idele inolo wedinale asigi ule waaleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Samalia ido amo obegeba daafia, eweguba ulufaba saaba dafelagolubiyo. “Kegele sunia na samini mololumo Ehe nafea saaba meso.” Ausi, dauno Sika ami, Samalia idele inolo wedinalemo Yesufea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule waaleso</char>.<verse eid="JHN 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Aufia, ili Yesu labea milibaifia, Efea selesia, “Ga nini galiba aso melaba” susiba seleso. Ausi, E hilia aida ami adeso. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />E ami labi, Ene sulu selefemo alefasia, Samalia idele inolo wedinale nooloda asigi ule ofolaba yaaso.<verse eid="JHN 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 4:14">1Yon 4.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, ilihe ido amofea selesia, “Ninihe Efea asigi ule ufulumo, ge sulu amosu alefasiale. Aubale. Aga nine ninihe Ene sulu dofasia, nini hilisesia, helefealu idele inolo suniada <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba dilomo</char>, seale E-buba hilisesu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe gamane yasilone faibe waiba ofeleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Hilia aida amo alefasia, E hele amo gadefia, Galili hele ami aaso. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mad 13.57</ref></char></note>Yesu Ene selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Saaba ofolo">Saaba ofolomo</char> ene mosomule heleamo e wida male adobiyo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.45 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:23">Yon 2.23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>E Galili ami goasimo, ili Efea heneba luba diso. Mau enebamo, ilida Yelusalame daafia, Henesia Sigilo Hilia ami alolune, fogo amo kegele sunia E mololumo ine si abulubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">Yon 2.1-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Samini, Yesuhe Galili helea Kana mosomu ami, hanomo <char style="w">waini</char> dedegeba ufulubiyo. Aga E abia, Kana ami haiba saabia goaso. Ami goasi, fogo amohe Kafanima dauno hagoaleba ami, gamane yasilo ulenone inolo faibe walefa ufulubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:5-6">Mad 8.5-6</ref></char></note>Yesu E Yudia afasia, Galili goaluba solumo dofasia, gamane inolo amo Yesu labea fela aaso. E Yesufea susiba selesia, “Ne faibe olaeyo hagoale adefe. Amone waiba ufiyone, ga Kafanima ami suga milaba” seleso.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.48 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:18">Yon 2.18</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:22">1Kld 1.22</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesu efea selesia, “Gili <char style="w" lemma="Momolelu kegele">eloba bamesine momolelu kegele</char> nokene nokeneba moloba yaalumo besalenaga, gili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufiyobafale</char>.” <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />E auba selesi, gamanene yasilo amo Efea selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, ne faibe aso olabale labe yaga, Ga alebale mila!”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:13">Mad 8.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Yesu efea selesia, “Ga moloa obegeba mala. Ge faibe ogo bebea labe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Auba selesi, yasilo e Yesu sulu solumo asigi ule ofasia, ene moloa obegeba aaso. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />E aso Kafanima goayone suga daaba labi, ene <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu mololo faibilimo</char> e ena wakalisia, ilihe efea selesia, “Ge faibe wailu bebea saabe-eee!”<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Ausi, ehe ilifea doba bisigia selesia, “Halosi hala koleba e waiso?” Ausi, ilihe efea selesia, Aide halosi agele adesi, walefa halo amo gelesoba seleso. <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Ili auba selesi, faibe enao eweguba hiliseso. Aide halosi hamaga Yesu selesia, “Ge faibe bebea labeba” solumo, fogo hamaga aulububa hiliseso. Aulugulu, e asigi ule ofeleso. Ausi, idele inolo ene moloa kakainalu amoda, sunia asigi ule ofolaba yaaso.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.54 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:11">Yon 2.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Momolelu kegele ewe Yesu E Yudia afasia, Galili obegeba mulu ligia, moloso. Amo eloba babiyo kegele aganebo.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolo uleno Bedeseda hano walulu ami waiba ofeleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Fogo noolo alefasia, <char style="w">Yuda</char> ine gulugululo sigilo hilia no holobagasi, Yesu E Yelusalame fela aaso. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Yelusalame sidine yalalu amone eno saliba uleno, <char style="it">Dofene Sibine Eno</char>ba soda amimo, hano walulu ule dobiyo. <char style="w">Hibulu</char> sulubamo, hano walulu amo, <char style="it">Bedeseda</char>ba sodo. Hano walulu amone aniba ami, hisu molo bia amaleba dulu dobiyo. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3-4" />Aufia, hisu moloa amimo, walefalu inolo wedinaleda, si kalaba yaaluda, emo woluda, kiwi kakalosia, kiwi olaba yaaluda, ami kakainaba yaalubiyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.3-4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dawalolo inolo noolo hilisesia, lalolu ewe haisi noolo aso dobu. Sulu amo eweguba: “Ili hano amo fufulemesi yasiba alolu. Enebamo, hilia noolomo Saminilone sulu dia ano uleno huga inigia waiyo hano amo fufuleba ofolo. Hano amo fufuleba samodosi, inolo maugaba hano hugafe amo, e walefa amenegulu dulu waiba ofolo.” </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Inolo uleno ami asulumo, e walefa ufia ligia, hamu daabuluba osoloafia aaiyoba (38) ufulubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesuhe inolo amo ami hanefia labi bisigia, E hilisesia, e walefa samini ufiya alolububa hilisebiyo. Aufia, Yesu efea dobelesia, “Ga ge domala ogo waiyo hamefela?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Ausi, walefalu inolo amohe Ene sulu obegeba selesia, “Inolo, doma. Hano fufulesi, inolo uleno na fafuba dibia, hano walulu usu dafogoyo male adobiyo. Nene na-mo maiyo weiyaaloso, inolo noolo ilidale suga adaaba yaasiamo, ilihe na suniaba waselo.” E auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:6">Mad 9.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe efea eweguba seleso. “Degema! Ge dafu adolu difasia, daaba mela!” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Auba selesi, alebale hamagi koleba, inolo amone domala waisi, ehe ene dafu adolumo difasia, daaba adeso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Hilia amoda moloiya amo, <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char>. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:21-22">Jer 17.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:19">Neh 13.19</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yudane guni inolo ilihe wailu inolo amo baafia, efea selesia, “Agamo Sabada hiliagulu, gahe ge dafu adolu ogo dibia aafe ogohe, dabalu molomabiyolu muguli sulu gelefe.” Ili auba seleso. <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Auluso, e obegeba selesia, “Inolo nada waiba ufulu amo Ehe, nafea selesia, ge dafu adolu ewe difasia, daaba melaba seleso.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />E auba selesi, ilihe efea doba bisigia selesia, “Inolo gafea ge dafu adolu difasia degefia malaba solu ogo, abe?” Ili auba waneso. <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Auluso, wailu inolo amohe, inolo efea solu amo, abebiba asigiluale. Maumo, Yesu Ehe efea auba safasia, idele inolo wamili aleba hamagi asigilelubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Dufia, Yesu E <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usu huga daafia, inolo amo ami wakaliso. Aufia, Yesu efea selesia, “Doma, aga ga wailubu. Wolu saabia no molomabiyo. Kegele higinilu bule no gafea holobagalosi.” Yesu efea auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Ausi, inolo amo abia, Yudane guni inolo ilifea selesia, “Nada waiba ufulu amo, Yesubiyoba” seleso.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Yesuhe kegele ewegulu Sabada hilia ami moloba yaafemone, Yudane guni inolo ilihe Efea habosia, Efea higinilu meso.<verse eid="JHN 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Auluso, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Ne Naomo dabalu mololabia daaba ligiasu, agada E molobasu labe. Ausi, Nada dabalu molobasu lolu.” Yesu auba seleso. <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:4">Mad 26.4</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:1">Yon 7.1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:30">10.30</ref></char></note>Sulu amo selefe dofasia, Yudane guni inolo ilihe Yesu dufaiyeba bule koleba hameso. Mau eneba Ehe Sabadane muguli gelelu amosuale. Mau bule nomo, ewe. Ehe Godemo Ene enao kolebaba solumohe, Ene E Gode waagulu iminilune, ilihe E dufaiyeba hiliseso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudane muguli selesia, inolo uleno ene e Gode waagulu loluba selesenaga, inolo amo dufa olaeyo dobuba sodobiyo. (Kis 20.2-3; Wkp 24.16) Aulune, Yesu Godene Faibeba fadaba eloba bisigiale, ilihe dufa olamaba solu kuliba aasusia, E dufiyo hiliselu.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godene Faibe dabalu moloyone wida labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:30">Yon 5.30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesuhe Yudane guni inolo ine sulu obegeba selesia, “Seale koleba, Na gilifea selesu, Faibehe kegele uleno Ene asigifeguba moloyodoluale. Aubale. Enaohe molosi besabe amonesu, E moloyodolu. Enebamo, kegele sunia, Enao molofemo, Faibeda aubasu molofe. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Enaohe Ene Faibe bule hamesefia, kegele sunia E molofemo, Efea walefe. Aufia, gili momoleba hidigiba bamesine, Enaohe kegele bule nooloda Ene Faibefea waleyobafe. Kegele bule amohe, dabalu E ama mololu ewe, waseba waaleyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Enebamo, Enaohe idele inolo daneba yaalu dobumo, degeba ifoba yaasia, bebea melesi moloba yaafe. Amogubasu, Faibe Eda, idele inolo E molobebelelu amo, bebea melesi moloba yaafe.<verse eid="JHN 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:27">Yon 5.27</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:42">HD 10.42</ref></char>
    </note>Enao alefasia, inolo uleno osolalale. Osolaeyone dabalu suniamo, Ehe Ene Faibefea melu. <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:10-11">Fil 2.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 2:23">1Yon 2.23</ref></char></note>Idele inolo sunia Enaone wi digiba sodoguba, Faibene wi aubasu digimesine aulu. Inolo abehe Faibene wi digiba sodalemohe, Enao Eda hilibailu amone wi amoda, digilale.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:15-18">Yon 3.15-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Seale koleba, na gilifea selesu, inolo abehe, Ne sulu dofasia, Nada hilibailu amofea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesenaga</char>, amo e <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> sefia labe. Amo e-mo osolaeyobafale. Aubale. E olalofealo segeba daafia, miliyolu miliyofealo labe.<verse eid="JHN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Seale koleba, Na gilifea selesu, daneba yaalu ilimo, Godene Faibene mofeyo dubiyobafemone hilia holobagaeyobafe. Wae, seale, hilia amo aga holobagalu dobu. Dobelefe ili amo, ine miliyolu bebea miliyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Miliyolu miliyone maumo, Nao Enefea dobu. Aufia, Ehe Ene Faibefea kiwi mesimo, Eda aubasu, miliyolu miliyo Enefea dobu. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />E <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> labene, Enaohe Efea idele inolo osolamesine wida solu kiwida melu.<verse eid="JHN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Gilihe Ne sulu ewe dobelesia, hidigiba hilisemabiyo. Enebamo, aga dana usu alebaibu ili suniahe, Faibene mofeyo dubiyobafemone, hilia holobagaeyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12.2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mad 16.27</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 24:15">HD 24.15</ref></char></note>Ausi, ili dana afasia, egeisa milibaiyobafe. Mana nafulu moloba yaalumo, ili bebea miliyone degeba yaeyobafe. Aufia, mana wolu moloba yaalumo, ili osolaba dafaliyone degeyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:19">Yon 5.19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:38">6.38</ref></char></note>Nahe kegele uleno Nene asigifeguba mololale. Nahe sulu Nao selefeguba dofasia, kuliba abia, idele inolo ine mana osolalo. Na isoba osolalo. Mau enebamo, Na Nene hamefeguba mololale. Aubale. Nahe, Nada hilibailu E hamefeguba, mololo.” Yesuhe Ene Enao amone saaba auba sulu seleso.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E amobuba ulufaba saaba dafelagoba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Yesuhe Yudane guni inolofea saabia selesia, “Na Nene meleba ulufaba saaba dafelagosiabiaga, sulu amo eleda male dobu. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Auluso, nohe Na amobuba ulufaba saaba dafelagofe. Sulu Ehe auba saaba dafelagofemo, seale eleda dobuba, Na asigisu.<verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Gilihe Na fadaba dubiyone, olea inolo noolomo <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Hano Gelo Yone</char> labea hilibaisalubiyo. Ausi, ehe ilifea Na amobuba seale ulufaba saaba dafelagolubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Helefealu inolohe olofa ligia, Na amobuba ulufaba saaba dafelagomesi, Na yasilale. Aubale. Auluso, gili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba dimesine</char> Na eweguba selesu. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yone e-mo, naafa waiyalugulu ligia, ene suluhe idele inolofea neeba doweba alolubiyo. Ausi, gilihe fogo abobo ene yane amofea heneyo hameba alolubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:2">Yon 3.2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:11">14.11</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, kegele noda Na amobuba ulufaba saaba dafelagofe. Dabalu Naohe nafea moloba samodomesi melu amohe, Nao Na hilibaisi muluba ulufaba walefe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudane sulu muguli amomo eweguba selefe. Godofe hilia amomo, inolo uleno ene meleba olofa adale. Aubale. Inolo no olofa ado. Auluso, inolo ulesu olofa labenaga, amoda ililibuale. Aubale. Inolo aida me nooloda olofa ligia, sulu ule aiba selesenaga, godo amo isoba saeyobafe. (Lo 17.6 ami bamale.) Aulugulu, Yesuhe iwi selesia, Na Nene meleba olofa adesenaga, sulu amo eleale. Auluso, aidamo Ne olofa ado labe. Agelemo, Hano Gelo Yone. Aganebomo, dabalu Na molosu ewe. E auba solu.</char></note> Dabalu na molosu ewemo, olofa adogulu, idele inolofea ulufaba saaba dafelagofe. Dabalu amohe, sulu Yone Na amone saaba solu amo, wasolu koleba. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mad 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:32">Yon 5.32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:18">8.18</ref></char></note>Aufia, Nao Nada hilibailumo, Ene Ehe, Na amobuba ulufaba saaba dafelagolu. Auluso, Ene mofe gili dobolale. Aufia, Ene misida gili bolale. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Aufia, Ene suluda gine libo usu adale. Mau enebamo, Inolo E hilibaisi mulu amofea, gili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesale</char>. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:27">Lug 24.27</ref></char></note>Gili Godene bugo alefasia, <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> diyo hilisesiane, bugo amo nafuluba alegafia osolaba adobiyo. Godene bugo amohe, Na amobuba ulufaba saaba dafelagofe. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Auluso, gilihe Na labea miliyolu miliyo diyone miyo hamesale.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Inolofea alefasia Na wabialelo diyo hamelale. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Auluso, Na gili hilisebu. Godene hameselomo gine libo usu male. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Inolo uleno ene wi koleba alefasia esenaga, gili e diba diyobafe. Auluso, Na Naone wi alefasia suga muluso, gili Na koleba diba disale. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Gilihe wabialelo gine gelebafea dilo. Auluso, wabialelo Gode ule E-su melomo, gili diyo hamelale. Aulugulu, gili mana auba molosenaga, gili halaguba asigi ule ufiyobafebi?<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Nahe gilimo Naone si saabia godoyobafebuba hilisemabiyo. Gilida godofe inolo amo, <char style="w">Mosese</char>. Muguli sulu e seleba ufulu amohe, gilihe nini sagoba homesifia, amofea gine hame diba ofogoso. Auluso, muguli sulu amohe, gili fadaasia godofe. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:22">HD 3.22</ref></char></note>Enebamo, gilihe Mosesene sulu sigi dubulubiaga, amo gili Ne suluda sigi dobaiyo. Mau enebamo, sulu e selelumo, Na amobuba selelu. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Auluso, gilihe sulu Mosese seleba ufulumo sigi dobolale alebaibiyo. Aulune, gili Ne suluda sigi dobelefale.” Yesuhe Yudane guni inolofea auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe idele inolo wamili wedinalefea naiyo meso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Madiyu 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maga 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lugu 9.10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Fogo noolo alefasia, Yesu E Galili waiyo nolobalo anogolo segeba aaso. Waiyo amone wi nomo, Daibeliase waiyo. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Ausi, idele inolo wamili ili amo Yesuhe <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> molosia, walefalu idele inolo waiba waalelu bafasia, ilihe E kuliba abia, ilida nolobalo anogolo segeba dedaleso. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Aufia, Yesuda, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilida</char>, waiyo segefasia, nolobalo goafia, hele galefealo fela dedaleso. Fela dedalefia, ili ami ua yoba kakainaso. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Fogo amomo, <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> <char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> Hilia amo holobagaeyo hagoale alolubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesuhe idele inolo wamili wedinale E labea milibaife baafia, Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Filibi[[1]], Yesune walelu faibe">Filibifea</char> selesia, “Idele inolo ili ewe naiyo namenesi, <char style="w">boledi</char> wagi elegeyobase?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Ehe Filibi dedeba babiyone, efea auba doba besabeo. Maumo, kegele E moloyobafemo, Ene E ama asigifia alolubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filibi obegeba selesia, “Ninihe silifa mole fula aida (200)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fogo amohe hilia ule dabalu mololomone elebemo, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">silifa mole</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ule. Aulugulu, silifa mole fula aidamohe, aube aaiyoba mole dabalu molofasia dilo amone ilililu.</char></note> amohe, boledi elegesiabiaga, idele inolo ule uleba haisi haisiba naasimo, aso ililibaiyalebu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Ausi, Yesune walelu faibili aleba ami uleno, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char> <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidane</char> elewo, <char style="w" lemma="Adulu">Adulu</char> amo, ehe Yesufea selesia, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Faibe uleno iwi labemohe, boledi biadai, hani aidadai, sebu. Auluso, idele inolo wamili wedinale amofea namenesi mesimo, liliyodolualebu.” <figure style="fig" alt="Boy with 2 fish and 5 loaves" file="IB04127.tif" size="col" ref="6.1-15">Faibe uleno boledi biadai, hani aidadai, Yesufea mefe.</figure><verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Auba selesi, Yesu selesia, “Idele inolo ili ogo yoba kakainamaba” saamaso. Hele amimo gisi wedinale sobolune, idele inolo ami yoba kakainaso. Inolosu alegalu amo, saii bia amogulubiyo (5,000). <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Ili ami yoba kakainafia labi, Yesuhe boledi amo difasia, Godefea henelu sulu saafia, idele inolofea osolaba sagaba yaaso. Ehe hani aidamoda aubasu osolaba sagaba yaaso. Auba sagasi, idele inolo ilihe ine hamefeguba difasia nabaiso.<verse eid="JHN 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ili isoba kubaleba nabaifia alebaibi, Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea selesia, “Naiyo haisi afolu dobu ogo balu weaselosi, gilihe molaba yaama.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Auba selesi, ilihe molaba yaafia, boledi bia amone nabaisia, haisi gogolelu afolu amone, alu huguluba wasigaaba seba waaleso.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Lo 18.15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18">18</ref></char>
    </note> Idele inolo eloba bamesi momolelu kegele Yesu mololumo bafasia, ili selesia, “<char style="w">Saaba ofolo</char> inolo Gode alefasia, helefealu iwi hilibaiyoba solumo, amo seale E-bu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:36">Yon 18.36</ref></char></note>Aufia, ilihe E ine kini melesi gadefaeyone, E ilidai kiwigagaba lubia maiyo hameso. Ili auba moloyo hamesi baafia, Yesu E ili amo gadefia, E elebisu hele gale ami asogolo fela aaso.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E hano galulu saabia saabeo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Madiyu 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maga 6.45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16-17" />Geidelabia saabi, Yesu aso Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> labea obegeba sugasale. Ausi, ili waiyo galulu dobia hano saiya suga dedaleso. Ili hano kasu amo aleba lagofia, ili waiyo galulu segeba, Kafanima ami, obegeba maiyo dedaleso. Ili auba dedaleba labi, nigiliso. <verse eid="JHN 6:16-17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Ausi, fufulo kiwida inigia, waiyo galulumo fufuleba ofeleso. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Ili hano kasu olabolabia abia, fogo iminilu bia, me kaabeba amogulu, daaba labeofia, ilihe Yesu hano galulu saabia emelalabia saabi besabeo. E hano kasuda aafea ami inigia, E ilifealo miliba adeso. E auba hano saabia saabi bisigia, ili sagilisia, kiwi bibiliba yaaso. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Auluso, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Ewe, Nene Na,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nini </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nene Na</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selelu dobi besenaga, amo nini eweguba hilisemale. Amo Godene wi. </char><char style="it">Nene Na lolu</char>. (Kisim Bek 3.14 ami bamale.)</note> gili sagilimabu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Ausi, ilihe E-mo hano kasu misiyo huga milesi heneba uluba diso. Aufia, alebale hamagi, hano kasumo hele ilida maiyo hiliseiya ami, segeba abia goaso. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus walks on water" file="IB04126.tif" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="6.16-21">Yesu E hano galulu saabia saabe.</figure><verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo ilihe Yesu isaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Adigi keafa, idele inolo wamili amo aso waiyo galulu nolobalo alolubiyo. Ili hilisesia, aidemo, hano kasu noda ufulualesoba hiliseso. Hano kasu ule amosu ufulumohe, Yesu E Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilidai aleba lagofia daalualebuba hiliselu. Ene walelu faibili ilibisu hano kasu amo aleba lagofia, dedalelububa hiliseso. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Auba hiliseba labi, hano kasu noolo Daibeliase daunofia segeba milibaisia, hele <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminiloda</char> <char style="w">boledi</char> difasia, henelu sulu safasia, ili naiyo nabaiba aloiya ami hagoaleba goaso. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ausi, idele inolo ilihe Yesuda, Ene walelu faibilida, ili ami male bafasia, ili hano kasu amo aleba lagoba yaafia, Yesu isaeyone Kafanima ami obegeba segeba dedaleba yaaso.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E Hebenene miliyolune naiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Idele inolo ili waiyo galulu segeba nolobalo anogolo goafia, Yesu isafasia, baafia, Efea selesia, “Walelo, Ga iwi asiga mulu?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Ausi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Seale koleba, na gilifea selesu, Gili na isafemo, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> abulu amoneale. Aubale. <char style="w">Boledi</char> nafasia, kubaleba yaabu amone hilisesia, gili na isafe. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:48-58">Yon 6.48-58</ref></char></note>Auluso, naiyo ufiasu adalemo diyone, dabalu molomabiyo. Aubale. <char style="w">Miliyolu miliyo</char> naiyo ufiasu adomone diyone, dabalu amone molomale. Naiyo amo, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibehe</char> gilifea meyobafe. Enebamo, Ene Enao, Godehe, E auba molomesi eesia, Efea enaoba ofeleso.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Yesu auba selesi, ili Efea selesia, “Nini koleba eneba molosi, ninihe Gode henemesi dabalu moloba yaeyobi?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:23">1Yon 3.23</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Godehe gili molomesi hamefemo ewe. Inolo E hilibailu amofea koleba <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule homa</char>.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30-31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.30-31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 16:14-15">Kis 16.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 11:7-9">Nam 11.7-9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Sng 78.24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">Mad 16.1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:18">Yon 2.18</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, ilihe Efea doba bisigia, selesia, “Nini Gafea asigi ule homesine, Gahe momolelu kegele uleno molomale. Nine nauwadalimo isale hele falaiya ami, naiyo <char style="sls"><char style="w">mena</char></char>mo mololubiyo. Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">‘Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> naiyo ilifea namenesi melubiyo.’</char> Auluso Ga-mo, Ga aga eloba bamesine kegele hala moloyobase?”<verse eid="JHN 6:30-31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Ili auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Seale koleba, Na gilifea selesu, hebenefia gilifea naiyoda melu amo, <char style="w">Mosese</char> e-ale. Aubale. Ne Nao amo Ehe, hebenene naiyo sealemo gilifea melo. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Naiyo sealemo ewe, Gode alefasia mefe amo, hebenefia suga mulu. Amohe helefealu idele inolofea miliyolu melo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Yesu auba selesi, ilihe Efea selesia, “Saminilo, Ga aga iwifia, naiyo amo ninifea mebasu mela.” <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:14">Yon 4.14</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Nene Na, miliyolu melone naiyo lolu. Inolo Na labea saabemo, saabia no mamiayobafale. Aufia, inolo Nafea asigi ule ofelefemo, e hano saabia no nabaiyobafale. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Auluso, Nahe gilifea ama eweguba solu. Gili Na selefemo dobelesia, mana na molofemo abuluso, gili aso Nafea asigi ule ofelesale. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Idele inolo sunia Naohe Nafea mefe amo, ili Na labea milibaiyobafe. Aufia, ili abehe Na labea saabe amo, Nahe aisaba dafiyale. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Enebamo, Na hebene afasia, suga mulumo, nene hame moloyone muluale. Aubale. Na suga mulumo, Nada hilibailu amone hame moloyone mulu.<verse eid="JHN 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 10:28-29">Yon 10.28-29</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:12">17.12</ref></char>
    </note>Nada hilibailumone hamemo ewe. Idele inolo Ehe nafea melu amone, Nahe uleno daba dafalimesiale hamefe. Aufia, aleba eloyo hilia adesi, Nahe ili suniamo olalu dana dobia amifia degeba ifoyo hamefe. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Enebamo, Ne Naone hamefemo, ewe. Idele inolo sunia Faibe baafia, Efea asigi ule ofelefemo, ili miliyolu miliyo dimesi hamefe. Ausi, aleba eloyo hilia adesimo, Nahe ili amo degeba ifoba yaeyobasu.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Aufia, Yesuhe Naiyo hebenefia mulu amo, Nene Na-ba solu dofasia, <char style="w">Yuda</char> noolo ili gadisia, Yesu saaba gogomoba saeyo maugaso. <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mad 13.55</ref></char></note>Ili selesia, “Inolo ogo, Yesu, E <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[2]], Malia, Yesune enae amone aino e">Yosebene</char> faibebiyo, ninihe ene enaedai enaodaimo hilisebu. Ausi, agamo, enesi E selesia, ‘Na hebenefia suga muluba selefebi?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Ili ine meleba auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Gili gine geleba gogomomabu. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:65">Yon 6.65</ref></char></note>Nao Nada hilibailu amo, E koleba, inolo uleno ene asigi degeba ofelesalenaga, inolo amo e ene hame alefasia Na labea miyobafale. Naohe ine asigi degeba ofelefe ili amosu, Na labea miyobafe. Aufia, aleba eloyo hilia adesi, Nahe ili amo olalu dana dobia amifia degeba ifoyobasu. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Ais 54.13</ref></char></note><char style="w">Saaba ofolo</char> bugohe eweguba seleba dobumo. <char style="qt">‘Godehe idele inolo sunia waleyobafe.’</char> Auba selelu dobu. Ausi, idele inolo sunia Nao selefe dofasia, dawalofe ili amo, Na labea milibailo. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:18">Yon 1.18</ref></char></note>Inolo uleno Nao abuluale. Aubale. Inolo ewe Godedai labeofia mulu amo, E-su Nao abulu.<verse eid="JHN 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:15-16">Yon 3.15-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Seale koleba, Na gilifea selesu, inolo Nafea asigi ule ofelefemo, e miliyolu miliyo sefia labe. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:32">Yon 6.32</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 6:58">58</ref></char></note>Nene Na, miliyolu miliyone naiyo lolu. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Gine gauwadalimo isale hele falaiya ami, <char style="sls">mena</char> nabailuso, ili daneba yaalubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Auluso, hebenefia huga mulu naiyo seale amo, nokene labe. Idele inolo naiyo amo naasi, ili olaeyobafale. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Naiyo miliyoluda hebenefia huga mulu ewe, Nene Na lolu. Aulugulu, inolo uleno abehe naiyo ewe naasenaga, e miliyolu miliyobafe. Naiyo Na meyobasu ewemo, Ne huu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu auba selefemo, ene domalane huu sealemone selefale. Aubale. E asubanefealo amone besiba selefe.</char></note> Maumo, Na olaeyobasumo, helefealu idele inolo miliyolu dimesine, ne domala weaseyobasu.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Yuda noolo ilihe sulu ewe dofasia, ine geleba sulu hegeba yaaso. Ili selesia, “Inolo ogohe, Ene huumo ninifea namenesiba selefe ewe, eneba meyobafebi?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Seale koleba, Na gilifea selesu, gilihe Inololene Faibene huu naasalenaga, aufia gilihe ene ibida naasalenaga, gine miliyolu bebea adefale. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Idele inolo abehe, Ne huuda, Ne ibida, naasenaga, ili amo miliyolu miliyo sefia labe. Aleba eloyo hilia adesimo, Nahe ili degeba ifoba yaeyobasu. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Mau enebamo, Ne huumo, naiyo seale koleba. Aufia, Ne ibimo, hano naiyo seale koleba. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Inolo Ne huuda, Ne ibida, naafe amo, Nafea labe. Ausi, Nada efea lolu. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:24">1Yon 3.24</ref></char></note>Nao miliyoluda labe amo, Ehe Na hilibaisi, Na mulu. Efea alefasia, Na miliyolu bebea lolu. Aubasu, inolo Nada naafemo, Nafea alefasia, miliyolu bebea miliyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Hebene afasia, huga mulu naiyo amo, ewe koleba. Nauwadali samini nabailu naiyo amoguluale. Ili <char style="sls">mena</char> nabailuso, ili daneba yaalubiyo. Naiyo hebenefia huga mulu ewe, nokene. Sunia abe ehe naiyo ewe naasenaga, amo miliyolu bebea alefalu miliyobafe.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Kafanima dauno <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> usu ami yoba sigia, idele inolofea mana saaba walesiamo, Yesuhe sulu sunia auba waleso.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuda kuliba dedalelo idele inolo wedinale E gadefia dedaleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Yesuda kuliba dedalelo aleba ami, idele inolo wedinale ilihe, Yesune sulu ewe selefe dofasia, selesia, “Sulu ewe kolelu koleba walefe. Sulu ewe, abe koleba diba diyobi?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Ene kuliba dedalelo auba gogomosia waalefebuba asigisia, Yesu ilifea doba bisigia, eweguba seleso. “Sulu Na walesu ewehe, gili Nafea habomesi selefela? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Ausenaga, gilihe <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> Eda samini aloiya ami, obegeba felasi besenaga, gili eneba moloyobafebi? Gili fogo ami Nafea asigi ule ufiyobafela? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Godene Asubanehe idele inolofea miliyolu melo. Inolone domalahe, idele inolofea miliyolu meyone wedinoda sagoba ofolale. Aubale. Sulu Na gilifea solu amofea alefasia, gili Asubane difasia, miliyolu diyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:11">Yon 13.11</ref></char></note>Auluso, gili aleba ugi, idele inolo noolo <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule waalefale</char>.” Yesu auba seleso. Samini waagifia, idele inolo asigi ule ufiyobafalemo, E asigiba samodofia alolubiyo. Aufia, Ehe Eda holonoyobafemo amobuba asigifia alolubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 6:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.65 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:44">Yon 6.44</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, E gegoaba selesia, “Na gilifea ama eweguba solu. Naohe inolo ulenone asigi degeba ofelesalenaga, amo inolo ewe Na labea miyodoluale adefe.” Yesu auba seleso. <verse eid="JHN 6:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Fogo E sulu auba soiya amifia, ene kuliba dedalelo aleba ami, idele inolo wedinale ili E gadefia, obegeba dedalesia, saabia no E kuliba dedalesale.<verse eid="JHN 6:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Ausi, Yesuhe Ene walelu faibili huguluba amofea doba bisigia selesia, “Gilida Na gadefia dedaleyo hamesela?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.68 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:16">Mad 16.16</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char> <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> obegeba selesia, “Saminilo, nini abe labea dedaleyobi? <char style="w">Miliyolu miliyo</char> melone sulu sodo amo, Ga-su labe. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Aufia, ninihe asigi ule ofasia, nafuluba eweguba asigisu. Gode alefasia, muulu isolu inolo <char style="w">Noekene</char> amo Ga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Auba selesi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Nene Nahe, gili hugulubamo molobebelelu. Auluso, gili aleba ugimo, ulenomo <char style="w">henane</char> labe.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesuhe auba solumo, <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasa</char>, Saimono Isakaliodone faibe amone seleso. Yesune walelu faibili huguluba amone ulenomo, e aloluso, dufia ehe Yesu holonoyobafe.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Seele Molo Amone Henesia Sigilo Hilia adesi, Yesu E gagaiyofea ami aaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:18">Yon 5.18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufasia, fogo dufia, Yesu E Galili helea amisu siba adeso. E Yudia helea ami maiyo hamesale. Maumo, <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> guni inolo ilihe, E dufa olaeyo weiyaasi aulubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2-3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Wkp 23.34</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yudane Seele Molo Amone Henesia Sigilo Hilia holobagaeyo hagoale adesi, Ene elewodali Efea selesia, “Ga koleba, hele ewe afasia, Yudia malale. Ge kuliba sibaisalo idele inolo ilihe, momolelu kegele Ga molofe amo bamesi. <verse eid="JHN 7:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Enebamo, inolo ulenohe idele inolo e bamesi hamesenaga, e muguba dabalu mololale. Aubale. Aulugulu, Ga kegele amogulu moloyo hamesenaga, amo, Ga idele inolo suniane si saabia ulufa kalugaafia miliyo dobu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:14">HD 1.14</ref></char></note>Ene elewodali koleba ilida Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofale</char> ligia, ili sulu ewe auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Ausi, Yesuhe ine sulu amone obegeba selesia, “Ne fogomo aso adefale. Auluso, fogo suniamo, gine fogo dobu. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Helefealu idele inolo ilimo, gilidai gisa adesia gogoloba babiyone mau male. Auluso, ilihe Nadai gisa adesia gogoloba besabe. Mau enebamo, mana ili molofemo, Nahe woluba ulufaba saaba dafelagoba selesi aufe. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Gili Yelusalame gagaiyosia sigilo adefea ami malale. Na gilidai maiyale. Mau enebamo, ne fogo aso adefale.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />E auba saafia, E Galili ami adabasu adeso.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Auluso, Ene elewodali ili gagaiyosia sigilo adefea ami dedalefia labi, dufia Yesu Eda aaso. Auluso, idele inolo E bamesialefia, E muguba aaso. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Sigilo hilia adesimo, Yudane guni inolo ilihe E isasiamo, selesia, “E wagi labebi?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Ausi, idele inolo wamilihe, E saaba sulu wedinale gogomoba selaba yaaso. Noolo selesia, “E inolo nafulu.” Auluso, noolo selesia, “E idele inolo masega gegeba ofolo.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Auluso, ili Yudane guni inolo baaba sagilisia, inolo ulenohe Yesune mana amone saaba ulufaba selesale.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ausi, sigilo hilia alegalu amone fogo dogolea ami, Yesu E <char style="w">sebele molo</char> amone yala usu suga daafia, idele inolofea waleyo maugaso. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:54">Mad 13.54</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:47">Lug 2.47</ref></char></note>Yuda ilihe Ene sulu amo dofasia, momoleba hilisefia, ili selesia, “Inolo ogo, nine gulugululone sugulu daalualeso, Ehe Gode manane dawalolo bule koleba difasia walefemo, enesi aufebi?” Ili auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 12:49">Yon 12.49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:10">14.10</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesuhe ine sulu amone obegeba selesia, “Sulu Na walesu ewe, Ne-ale. Aubale. Sulu amo, Nada hilibailu amone sulu. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Aulugulu, inolo ulenohe, Godene hame koleba kuliba abia, migagaba aasenaga, amo e sulu Na walesu ewene mau eloba babiyobafe. Na Godefea alefasia walesula, me Nene asigifea alefasia walesula, e eloba babiyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:50">Yon 8.50</ref></char></note>Inolohe ene asigifea alefasia sulu selefemo, ehe ene meleba wi digiyo hamesia selefe. Auluso, inolo eda hilibailu amone wi digiyo hamefemo, amo e isolu inolo labe. Inolo amo ehe, masega sulu sodale. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:53">HD 7.53</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:21-24">Lom 2.21-24</ref></char></note>Samini <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesehe</char> <char style="w">muguli</char> mana gilifea melualela? Aa, gilifea melu. Auluso, gili aleba ugi, uleno muguli mana ewe kuliba anale. Enesi, gili Na dufa olaeyo weiyaase?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 8:48">Yon 8.48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:20">10.20</ref></char>
    </note>Yesu auba selesi, idele inolo wamili amohe selesia, “<char style="w">Gamodo</char> uleno gafea labebu. Ulenohe ga dufiyo weiyaafela? Enesi, ga auba hilisese? Ga kagoafebu.”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesuhe saabia ilifea selesia, “Nahe momolelu kegele uleno molosi, gili sunia momoleba hiliseso. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Wkp 12.3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:9-13">Stt 17.9-13</ref></char></note>Mosesehe Isolaelefea muguli sulu saaba mesiamo, inolo faibe subobo seba duluiya amifia, hilia aaiyo ami <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba geleloba</char> solu. Mana amo Mosesehe maugaluale. Aubale. Abalahama alolu fogo ami maugalu. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:8-10">Yon 5.8-10</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 5:16">16</ref></char></note>Gilihe Mosesene sulu muguli gelemesialesia, inolo faibe sunia hilia aaiyo amohe bado geleba ado. Hilia aaiyo amo, Sabada halemane hilia ami adesenagada, gili bado amaleba gelelo mana kaalale. Aubale. <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> amida, gilihe faibe bado gelelo. Aulune, Nahe Sabada hilia ami, inolo uleno domala waiba ufulumone, gilihe Nafea gadilu amo, enesi ause?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sabada hilia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo, Yuda ilimo halemane ado. Mosese sulu muguli ofelesia, selesia, “Sabada hiliahe dabalu ulenoda mololale. Halemane ado.” (Kis 20.8-11) Falisi ilida, Yudane guni inolo ilida, Yesufea gadilumo, maumo Sabada hiliahe walefalu inolo waiba ofelesi, aulu. Ili selesia, inolo ulenohe walefalu inoloda waiba ofelefe amo, dabalu molofe. Aulugulu, ili hilisesia, Yesuhe Sabada hilia ami walefalu inolo waiba ufulu amone, dabalu mololaleba sulu muguli ufulumo geleluba hiliselu. Aulune, ilihe Efea gadilu. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Gilihe si balu baafia, osolamabiyo. Gilihe osolasiamo, mana isolusu kuliba abia osolamale.” Yesu ilifea auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolohe Yesumo abelaba babiyo hameso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Fogo ami, Yelusalame idele inolo noolohe, Yesu molofe amo baafia, selesia, “Guni inolo ilihe dufa olaeyo weiyaafemo, inolo ewebu. <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Bama. E aga idele inolo si saabia ulufa ligia, sulu selefebu. Ausi, guni inolo ilihe Efea sulu uleno kaaba soluale. Ilihe E-mo <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisobuba</char> eloba besabe dagulo? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:41">Yon 7.41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:29">9.29</ref></char></note>Auluso, nini hilisesia, inolo ogo Kelisoalebu. Enebamo, Keliso E saabimo, ulenohe E amifia saabebamo fadaba asigiyobafale. Auluso, inolo ogomo, e mosomu amifia mulubamo, nini asigibu. Aulune, ogo Kelisoalebuba hilisebu.” Ili auba neneba adeso.<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mad 11.27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:55">Yon 8.55</ref></char>
    </note>Auba neneba labi, Yesu E aso <char style="w">sebele molo</char> amone yala usu Godene sulu mana waleba ligia, eweguba wuaaba seleso. “Gilihe Na seale dawalobula? Aufia, Na amifia muluba amoda, gili seale hilisebula? Auluso, Na Nene asigifea alefasia, iwi muluale. Aubale. Seale Sodomone Mau, Ehe Na hilibaisi, Na mulu. Auluso, gilihe E dawalobuale. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Auluso, Nahe E dawalobu. Maumo, Na Edai labi, Ehe Na hilibaisi, Na mulu.” Yesu auba seleso. <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:44">Yon 7.44</ref></char></note>Ilihe sulu amone dofasia, E seyo weiyaaso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudane guni inolo ilihe Yesu seyo hilisefemo, mau ewe: Yesu selesia, E Gode waaguluba solu. Yudane muguli selesia, inolo ulenohe e Gode waagulu loluba selesenaga, amo dufa olalo. (Wok Pris 24.16 ami bamale.) Yudane guni inolo ilihe, Yesumo Godene Faibe labeba fadaba eloba abuluale. Aulune, ilihe auba ausia, E dufiyo hiliselu.</char></note> Auluso, Ene fogo asone, inolo ulenone sonehe E seba sugasale.<verse eid="JHN 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Auluso, wamili aleba ami, idele inolo wedinalehe selesia, “Inolo iwi labehe, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> wedinale molofene, seale Keliso miyobafeba solu amo, E-bu.” Ili auba hiliseba yaalugulu, ilihe Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule waaleba</char> yaaso.<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Guni inolo ilihe Yesu seba sugamesi ibolo selu inolo hilibaisaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Idele inolo ilihe, ili aleba Yesu mololumone saaba sulu auba nenesia waalefemo, <char style="w">Falisi</char> ilihe dobeleso. Ausi, Falisida, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, ilihe Yesu seba sugamesisia, ine ibolo selu inolo E labea hilibaisaso. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Ausi, Yesu selesia, “Fogo wedino Na gilidai alefasia, Nada hilibailu amo labea obegeba maiyobasu. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:21">Yon 8.21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36">13.36</ref></char></note>Ausi, gilihe Na isaeyobafeso, gili Na babiyobafale. Aufia, gili hele Nada labea ami miyodoluale.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Yesu auba selesi, <char style="w">Yudane</char> guni inolo ilihe ine geleba eweguba neneso. “E wagi aasi, nini E babiyalemone selefebi? E nine helea afasia, Giligi helea ami, nine mosomu noolo labea ami, Giligi idele inolo ilifea waleyone maiyobafeba selefe dagulo? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Ene sulu ewe, ‘Gili Na isaeyobafeso, babiyobafale. Aufia, hele Nada labea ami, gili miyodoluale.’ Sulu ewene sisa eneba selesia, selefebi?” Yuda ilihe ine geleba auba neneso.<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe miliyolu miliyo hano amone seleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:36">Wkp 23.36</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:1">Ais 55.1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:14">Yon 4.14</ref></char>
    </note>Sigilo Hilia alegalu amo elosia, henelo hilia olaibo bule adesi, Yesu degefasia, wuaaba selesia, “Inolo uleno abehe, hano nabaisenaga, e Na labea milifasia, hano naiyo mila. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 58:11">Ais 58.11</ref></char></note>Amo Godene bugohe sulu selelu dobuguba, inolo uleno Nafea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesenaga</char>, miliyolu miliyone hano sugulo ene libo dugulesia, udiafia, hanobuu soaba daaba miliyobafe.” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:7">Yon 16.7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:22">20.22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:4">HD 2.4</ref></char></note>Yesu sulu auba solumo, Ehe idele inolo Efea asigi ule waalesi, <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> diyobafe amone iminiba seleso. Fogo amimo, Yesu E wi wabialelo bule aso dibale labine, Asubane Noekenemo aso milibale alolu.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo mosomu osolaba dafaliso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:14">Yon 6.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele inolo wamili aleba ami, noolohe Yesu selefemone dofasia, selesia, “Seale koleba, inolo ewe <char style="w">Saaba Ofolo</char>, miyobafeba yasilu amo, E-bu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:46">Yon 1.46</ref></char></note>Ausi, noolo selesia, “E Kelisobu.” Auluso, noolo selesia, “Aubale. Inolo ogo Galilifia mulubu. Aulugulu, E Kelisoalebu. <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:3-4">Sng 89.3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mai 5.2</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Godene bugo selesia, Kelisomo, <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> mosomufia, Bedeleheme dauno, samini Deibidida asuluiya amifia, miyobafeba seleba ufulu dobu.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesumo </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bedeleheme </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ami seba dulu amo, ili hiliseluale. Aulugulu, ilihe E Galilifia mulububa hiliselu.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Auba nenesia, idele inolohe Yesu amone saaba sulu selesia, mosomu osolaba dafaliso. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Inolo noolohe E seba sugaeyo hameluso, inolo uleno sonehe E sesale.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Guni inolo ilihe Yesufea asigi ule ofelesale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Ausi, ibolo selu inolo ili obegeba abia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolodai</char>, <char style="w">Falisi</char> ilidai, alebaibia goalu. Ausi, ilihe ibolo selu inolofea doba bisigia, selesia, “Mau enesi, gilihe E sefia lubia huga muluale?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:22">Mag 1.22</ref></char></note>Guni inolo auba selesi, ilihe obegeba selesia, “Samini, inolo ulenohe sulu ogo selefeguba selaba adale.” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Ausi, Falisi ilihe obegeba selesia, “Ehe gilida gegelu dagulo? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:42">Yon 12.42</ref></char></note>Guni inolo ninida, Falisi ninida, nini aleba iwi, gilihe inolo uleno Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesi</char> besabela? Uleno aubadale. <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Auluso, wamili idele inolo Efea asigi ule ufulu ili amohe, sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> asigibualegulu, Godehe ili amo woba dafiyobafe.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Falisi ili hilisesia, Yesu E Gode waaguluba solumone, Godene muguli gelelububa hiliselu. Aulugulu, ilihe E dufa olaeyo hiliselu. Amosuale, ili hilisesia, Godehe idele inolo Yesufea asigi ule waalefe ili amofea naga meyobafeba hiliselu. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:1-2">Yon 3.1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Falisi ilihe auba selesi, ili aleba ugi inolo uleno, Nikodimase, samini Yesu labea mulu amo, ehe ilifea eweguba doba abulu. <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Nine muguli sulu eweguba selelu dobula? Ninihe inolo ene sulu dobale, e mololumo fadaabale ligia, e-mo balu osolaba dafelesenaga, amo nafulula? Aa. Amo nafuluale.” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:41-42">Yon 7.41-42</ref></char></note>E auba selesi, ilihe efea dufa dafogoba selesia, “Gada Galili inolola? Ga Godene bugo selelu dobumo nafuluba alegama! <char style="w">Saaba ofolo</char> uleno Galilifia holobagalaleba asigimale.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yelusalame sidi idele inolo ilihe hilisesia, Galili hele amo ilosisa inolone hele. Aulugulu, kegele uleno nafulu amifia holobagaeyobafaleba sodo. Auluso, seale, Yesu E ilosisa hele Galili ami bulefia mulu.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Aufia, ili amo sunia ine moloa moloaba dedaleba yaalu.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Ido inolo fa dulumo, ilihe sefasia Yesu labea lubia saabeo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Ili ine moloa moloaba dedaleba yaasi, Yesu E Olifi galea fela aaso.<verse eid="JHN 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Keafale koleba, E huga milifasia, saabia <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usu aaso. Ausi, idele inolo wedinale E labea milibaiso. Ausi, E ami yoba sigia, ilifea waleba adeso. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawaloloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Falisi">Falisida</char>, ilihe ido uleno, inolo no fa diaba labeoba solu dofasia, ilihe e sefia, lubia inigia, idele inolo si saabia kalugamaso. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Aufia, ilihe Yesufea selesia, “Walelo, ido ewe inolo fa diaba labi, noolo abuluso. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Wkp 20.10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Lo 22.22-24</ref></char></note><char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesene</char> sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> eweguba selelu dobu. Ido amogulumo abane odesia, dufa olamaleba selelu dobu. Ausi, aga, Ga-mo eneba selese?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Ilihe sulu ewe E dedeba babiyone seleso. Maumo, Ehe sulu halane obegeba selefelaba baafia, sulu amo alefasia, E sefia, fadaayosia auso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudane guni inolohe, Yesu semesi kani eweguba helelu: Yesu selesia, abane odesia, ido amo dufa olamasenaga, amo ilihe Efea selesia, Gada ninidai eefe. Ausenaga, hilia sunia Ga wolu mololo idele inolo alebaibia, enesi bobolaba adese? Ga Gene wolubu. Auluso, Yesu selesia, ido amo dufa olamabiyoba selesenaga, amo ili selesia, Ga Mosesene sulu muguli kuliba anale. Aulune, ninihe Ga seyo dobu.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:6">Auluso, Yesu E waaba ilogofia, yoba sigia, ene sone binibohe hele saabia seleba adeso. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:7">Lo 17.7</ref></char></note>Ilihe Efea saabia saabiaba wanebasu labi, E isoba lagofia, ilifea selesia, “Gili aleba ugi, wolu mololale amohe, abane maugaba ido ewe oloma.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Auba safasia, E saabia waabagafia, hele saabia seleba adeso.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Yesu sulu selefe amo dofasia, ili sunia ule uleba, aleba gogoba yaaso. Asidalu ilidale maugaba dedaleba yaasi, inolo noolomo dufia aleba gogoba yaaso. Ausi, Yesu elebisu gadefia dedaleba yaasi, idomo Yesune olegia aso kalugaafia adeso. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Ausi, Yesu haiba isoba lagofia, ido amofea doba bisigia, selesia, “Ido, ili amo hala dedaleso? Inolo ulenohe ga godosia osolaba dafelesola?” <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:14">Yon 5.14</ref></char></note>Ausi, ido selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, uleno male.” Ausi, Yesu selesia, “Nada ga osolaba dafiyale, aga ga mala. Aulugulu, ga aga iwifia wolu saabia no molomabiyo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E helefealu idele inolone yane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:6">Ais 49.6</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:4-9">Yon 1.4-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">9.5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:46">12.46</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe idele inolofea saabia selesia, “Nene Na, helefealune yane lolu. Abehe Na kuliba saabe amo, e nigiligagalu aleba daaba miliyobafale. Aubale. E miliyolune yane sefia daaba miliyobafe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />
    <char style="w">Falisi</char> ilihe Yesu sulu auba selesi dofasia, ilihe Efea eweguba solu. “Ga Gene meleba saeyone olofa ligia, Gene sulu saaba ulufaba saaba dafelagofene, sulu amo, eleda malebu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:31-32">Yon 5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:28">7.28</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe ine sulu obegeba selesia, “Seale, Na Nene meleba sulu saaba ulufaba selesu. Auluso, Ne sulu ewe eleda dobu. Mau enebamo, Nada muluiya amoda, Nada maiyo aafea amoda, Nene hilisebu. Auluso, Nada muluiya amoda, Nada maiyo aafea amoda, gili asigibuale. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:47">Yon 12.47</ref></char></note>Gilihe idele inolo fadaaba osolasiamo, inolone manahe osolalo. Nahe inolo uleno fadaaba osolalale. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:30">Yon 5.30</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:29">8.29</ref></char></note>Auluso, Na fadaaba osolasenaga, osolaeyo sulu, Na selesu amo, isolu eleda dobu. Maumo, Na nelebisu loluale. Aubale. Ne Nao Nada hilibailumo, E Na galiba lolu. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Lo 19.15</ref></char></note>Gine sulu <char style="w" lemma="Muguli">mugulihe</char> eweguba selelu dobu. ‘Inolo aidahe, sulu ule aiba ulufaba saaba dafelagosenaga, amo aine ulufaba saaba dafelagolu sulu amo, eleda dobu.’ <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:9">1Yon 5.9</ref></char></note>Aulune, Na Nene meleba ulufaba saaba dafelagosumo, inolo ulenomo, Na. Aufia nomo, Ne Nao Nada hilibailumo, E. Eda olofa ligia, Na saaba ulufaba saaba dafelagoba labe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Yesu auba selesi, Falisi ili Efea selesia, “Ge Gao Ga selefe ogomo, E wagi labe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Ausi, Yesu ilifea selesia, “Gilihe Nada, Ne Naoda, dawalobuale. Gili Na dawalosiabiaga, Naoda dawalobaiye.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 7:30">Yon 7.30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu sulu amo waleba alolumo, <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usu, moleda dafogoba ada bogose aniba ami ligia, waleso. Inolo ulenohe E seba sugaluale maumo, Ene fogomo aso holobagalualene auso.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Falisidai saabia no sulu selaba adeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 7:34">Yon 7.34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:33">13.33</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe ilifea saabia selesia, “Na afa maiyobasu. Ausi, gili na isaeyobafe. Gine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> usu ugi, gili aso alebaifia ligiasu, gili daneba yaeyobafe. Nada maiyo aafea amimo, gili milibaiyodoluale miliyobafe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" /><char style="w">Yudane</char> guni inolo ilihe, Yesune sulu selefe amo dofasia, ine geleba selesia, “Gili Nada aafea ami, milibaiyodolualeba selefe amo, mau enebane selefebi? Ehe Ene meleba haloaeyone selefe dagulo?” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:31">Yon 3.31</ref></char></note>Ili auba selesi, Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Gilimo salu iligi aselo alebaibu, Na-mo ana lagi aselo lolu. Gilimo helefealu ewene inolo. Auluso, Na-mo helefealu ewene inoloale. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ausi, Nahe gilifea ama eweguba saaba melu. Gine wolu usu ugi, gili aso alebaifia ligiasu, gili daneba yaeyobafe. Enebamo, Nene Na loluba selesu ewefea, gili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesalenaga</char>, amo seale gine wolu usu ugi, gili aso alebaifia ligiasu, gili daneba yaeyobafe.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Auba selesi, ilihe Efea doba bisigia, “Ga abe?” Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Na amo lolubamo, gilifea maugaiyafia ama saaba melu. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Na gili fadaba osolaeyone sulu wedinale dobu. Nada hilibailumo, Ene sulu seale sodo. Sulu Na Efea dubulumo, Na helefealu idele inolofea saaba mebasu ado.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Yesu auba selesi, Ehe Enao amone saaba sulu selefemo, ili fadaba asigiba disale.<verse eid="JHN 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:14">Yon 3.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, Ehe ilifea eweguba solu. “Gilihe <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> digifia labe fogo amimo, gilihe Nene Na-mo amobuba eloba babiyobafe. Aufia, Na Nene asigifeguba kegele uleno molobale ligia, Ne Nao Nafea walelu amogubasu sodomo, fogo ami, gili amoda eloba babiyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Nada hilibailumo, E Nadai labe. Na hilia sunia E hamefeguba molobasu adomone, Ehe Na nelebi hafiniba melesi afelesale.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Yesu sulu auba selaba labi, idele inolo wedinale ilihe, Efea asigi ule ofolaba yaaso.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sulu seale sodohe idele inolo sububa dafelagoyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Ausi, Yesuhe <char style="w">Yuda</char> ili Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule waalebu</char> amofea selesia, “Gilihe ne sulu fedoba sefiasu adesenaga, amo seale koleba, gili ne <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> alebaibu. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Ausia, gilihe seale sulu sodo amo fadaba asigiba diyobafe. Ausi, seale sulu sodo amohe, gili sububa dafelagoyobafe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mad 3.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu auba selesi, ili obegeba selesia, “Nini <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamane</char> saladegelu ligia, inolo none dibolo inolo adale lolu. Aulugulu, Gahe nini sububa dafelagolu miliyobafeba selese ogo, enesi selese?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 6:16">Lom 6.16</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 6:20">20</ref></char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe obegeba selesia, “Na seale gilifea selesu, idele inolo sunia <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> molofemo, ili amo Wolune dibolo inolo alebaibu. Aulune, Woluhe ilifea wolu molomasi, ili ene <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu moloba ofolo</char> alebaibu. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Balu dabalu moloba ofolo inolo ilimo, ine bisone mosomule amone seale damene adale. Aubale. Bisone faibe seale amosu, e ene enaone mosomule amone damene alefalu ado. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Aulugulu, Faibehe gili sububa dafelagoba yaasenaga, amo gili sububa dafelagolu koleba ligia, saabia no balu dabalu moloba ofolo miliyobafale. Aubale, gili beega koleba miliyobafe.<verse eid="JHN 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Gili Abalahamane saladegelu alebaibu amo, Na hilisebu. Auluso, Ne sulumo gine libo usu miliyo fogo male adefene, gilihe Na dufa olaeyo hamefe. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Na-mo, Nao labea ligia abulu amone, Na gilifea saaba melo. Auluso gilimo, gine gaofea dubulu amone mana moloba ado.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mad 3.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu auba selesi, Yuda ilihe Yesu sulu selefe amone dofasia, obegeba selesia, “Nine naomo, Abalahama.” Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Gili seale koleba Abalahamane faibilibiaga, amo gilihe Abalahamane mana mololuguba molobaiyo. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Seale sulu sodo Nahe Godefea dubulu amone, Na gilifea sodo. Auluso, agamo gilihe Na dufa olaeyo weiyaafe. Mana amogulumo, Abalahamane manale. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:16">Ais 63.16</ref></char></note>Gilihe gine gao molologuba mana molobasu ado.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Auba selesi, ilihe Efea selesia, “Ninimo susugu faibe koleba alebaibuale. Aubale. Nine nao ule labe, amo Gode E labe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Ausi, Yesuhe obegeba selesia, “Amo, Godemo seale gine gaole ligiabiaga, amo gili Na hamesebaiyo. Mau enebamo, Na Godedai alefasia mulu. Na Nene asigifeguba muluale. Aubale. Gode Na hilibaisi, Na mulu. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Auluso, enesi, gilihe Na selefe ewemo fadaba disale? Maumo, gilihe Ne sulu ewemo nafuluba dubiyodoluale adefe. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:8">1Yon 3.8</ref></char></note>Gine gaolemo, <char style="w">henane</char>. Gili ene faibe alebaisia, gine gaone hame molobaiyelo mana moloyo hamefe. Maugaiya waagifia, e idele inolo dufa danelo alolu. Aufia, e seale sodofealomo adale. Maumo, seale sodo efea male. Masega sulu e sodomo, ene sulu amo koleba. E masega sulune enao ligia, e masega sulu sodo labe.<verse eid="JHN 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Aulugulu, Nahe seale sulu sodo amone selesi, gilihe Nafea asigi ule ofelefale. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:21">2Kld 5.21</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:22">1Fid 2.22</ref></char></note>Auluso, Na wolu uleno mololula? Gili aleba ugi, Na wolu molosoba ulufaba saeyone, olofa uleno labela? Nahe sulu eleda selesenaga, amo enesi, gilihe Nafea asigi ule ofelesale? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:6">1Yon 4.6</ref></char></note>Godene alebaibu ili amohe, Ene sulu sunia dobolo. Gili Godene sulu dobelefale amone maumo, ewe. Gili Ene alebaibuale.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu selesia, Abalahama aso male labi, Nene Na alolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.48 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 3:21-22">Mag 3.21-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> guni inolo ilihe Yesune sulu eweguba obegeba seleso. “Ninihe Ga saaba eweguba selesiamo, Ga Samalia inolo, <char style="w">gamodo</char> uleno gafea labeba solu amo, nini seale solu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Ili auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Gamodo uleno Nafea labale. Aubale. Na Ne Naone wisu digisu. Auluso, gilihe Ne wi dufa dafogofe. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Nahe Ne wi koleba digimesi, inolo no isasuale. Ne wida digiyone Uleno labe, E-mo isoba osolalo. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:24">Yon 5.24</ref></char></note>Na gilifea seale koleba selesu, inolo abehe Ne sulu kuliba aasenaga, amo e olaeyobafale koleba.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Auba selesi, Yudane guni inolo ilihe Efea selesia, “Gafea gamodo labebu. Aga nini amo fadaba bosolu. <char style="w">Abalahama</char> eda, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> ilida, ili daneba yaalubiyo. Auluso, Ga selesia, inolo uleno Ne sulu kuliba aasenaga, e olaeyobafaleba selese ogo, enesi selese? <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Nine nauwa Abalahama olalugulu, Ga E wasolububa hilisefe dagulo? Saaba ofolo ilida daneba yaalu. Aulugulu, ga gene meleba hilisesia, Ga abebuba hilisese?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Ili auba selesi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Na Nene alefasia, Ne wi digisiabiaga, Ne wi amo eleda male babaiyo. Auluso, Ne Naomo, gili Eda gine Gode labeba solu amomo, Ehe Ne wi digife. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Gilihe E dawalobuale. Auluso, Nahe E dawalobu. Na E dawalobualeba selesiabiaga, amo Na giligulu masega sulu sodo alebaiyo. Nahe Ene sulu nafuluba kuliba daaba ligia, Na E dawalobu. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Gine gauwa Abalahamahe, ne hilia amo babiyone yasiba ligia, e henelu adeso. Aufia, ehe ne hilia amo bisigia, ene libo koleba nafulu adeso.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Yudane guni inolo ilihe Yesu sulu selefe amo dofasia, Efea selesia, “Ga seba dulu hamu daabuluba bia (50) aso goabale ligia, ga Abalahama abuluba selesela?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:1">Yon 1.1</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesu ilifea selesia, “Seale koleba na gilifea selesu, Abalahama aso seba dibale labi, Nene Na alolu lolu.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.58 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nene Na alolu lolu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selesiamo, Yesu E Gode labeba solu. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nene Na alolu lolu, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo Godene wi. (Kis 3.14-15) Yesu sulu auba selefe amo dofasia, Yudane guni inolo nokene gadilu. Enebamo, Yudane muguli selesia, inolo ulenohe e Gode waaguluba selesenaga, amo dufa olamaba sodo. (Kis 20.2-3; Wkp 24.16) Aulune, Yesu Godene Faibeba fadaba eloba bisigiale, ilihe dufa olamaba solu kuliba aasusia, E dufiyo hiliselu. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Yesu auba selesi, ilihe E uliyone abane molaso. Auluso, E Ene meleba muguba aaso. Aufia, E <char style="w">sebele molo</char> amone yala gadefia afa aaso.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolo si kalalu waiba ofeleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu E daaba ligia, bosolufalumo, si kalalu inolo uleno yoba saabi besabeo. Inolo amo, enae e seba duluiya amifia, si kalalu waagulu alolubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:20">Ese 18.20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:2">Lug 13.2</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 13:4">4</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesune <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilihe Efea doba bisigia selesia, “Walelo, ewe abehe wolu mololune, inolo amo si kalalu seba dulu? Ene ehe wolu mololune, aulubile? Me enaedai, enaodai, aine wolu mololune, aulubile?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:4">Yon 11.4</ref></char></note>Ili auba selesi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “E si kalalu labemo, ene wolu amo alefasiale. Aufia, enaedai, enaodai, aine wolu amo alefasiale. Aubale. Auluso, Godene kiwigagalu efea ulufaba moloba dafelagomesine aulu. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Aga aso yaida yagi, ninihe Nada hilibailu amone dabalu moloyo dobu. Enebamo, nigili holobagaeyobafe. Auba nigili gagasimo, uleno dabalu moloyodoluale miliyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mad 5.14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yon 8.12</ref></char></note>Na helefealu iwi aso ligiamo, Na helefealu ewene yane lolu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 8:23">Mag 8.23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu auba safasia, Ehe hele saabia gau dowefia, gaudai saodai dadafia, galu amo inolo amone sifea dolaso. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Aufia, Ehe efea selesia, “Ga hano galulu Siloama ami heeyo malaba” seleso. Siloama amone wi sisamo, <char style="it">Hilibailu</char>. Ausi, inolo amo hano heeyo aaso. E obegeba inigiamo, isoba bebeleyodolu adeso.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Ausi, idele inolo noolohe e samini mole haaliba labi bolo amo ilida, ene mosomu ilida, selesia, “Eneba labe? Inolo ewe yoba sigia moleda haaliba ado, amobile?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Noolo selesia, “Seale, inolo amo ogo.” Ausi, noolo selesia, “Ogo amoale. Ogo e waagulu besabe.” Ausi, inolo amo ene selesia, “Inolo amo na.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Ausi, ilihe efea selesia, “Ga si ogo eneba fisigaso?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />E obegeba selesia, “Inolo Yesuba sodo amohe, galu molofasia, amohe ne sifea dolaso. Aufia, E nafea selesia, Ga hano Siloama ami muda malaso. Ausi, na ami daafia, hano mulufasia, na bebeleyodolu alolu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />E auba selesi, ilihe efea wanesia selesia, “Inolo ogo wagi labe?” Ausi, e selesia, “Na babeafe.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Falisi ilihe inolo si kalalu waiba ufulu amone mau waneso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13-14" />Hilia Yesuhe galu molofia, inolo amone si fisigaba ufuluiya amomo, <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> adeso. Noolohe inolo samini si kalalu alolumo <char style="w">Falisi</char> alebaibia lubia aaso. <verse eid="JHN 9:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Ami goafia labi, Falisi ilihe inolo amofea doba bisigia, “Ge si ogo, eneba bebelemesi moloso?” Auba doba besabi, ehe ilifea selesia, “Ehe galu dadafia, ne si ofelesi, na hano heefia, na bebeleyodolu adesu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Auba selesi, Falisi noolo selesia, “Inolo ogo Gode alefasia mulualebu, maumo, ehe Sabada hiliane elo ufulune mugulimo kuliba anale.” Auluso, noolo selesia, “Wolu inolohe <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> auba eneba moloyobi?” Ausi, ili mosomu osolaba dafaliso. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:19">Yon 4.19</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, ilihe inolo samini si kalalu asulu amofea saabia doba bisigia, selesia, “Inolo ge sida fisigaba ufulu ogo, ga ogone saaba sulu eneba selese? E inolo halagulubiyo?” Ausi, inolo amohe sulu ewe obegeba selesia, “E <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> uleno labeba” seleso.<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> guni inolo ilihe, inolo amo samini si kalalu alolumo sealebuba hilisesale. Aulune, ilihe inolo amone si seale fisigaluba <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufiyo</char> hamesale. Auba ausiane, ilihe sida fisigalu inolo amone enaedai, enaodai, ili labea milesi weso. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Aalu saabi, ilihe aalufea doba bisigia, “Ewe aine faibela? E seale si kalalu seba dulula? Aali auba selesela? Ausenaga, eneba mololune, e aga si bebelefe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Falisi ili auba doba besabi, enaedai, enaodai, obegeba selesia, “Ewe anine faibe, ani hilisebu. Enae e seba disiamo, e si kalalu seba duluba amoda, ani auba hilisebu. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Auluso, aga e eneba si bebelefebi, me abehe ene si fisigalubi, ani babeafe. Gili koleba enefea doma. E ama asidalu labebasi. Sulu ene fadaba saeyobafe.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Ene enaedai, enaodai, aaluhe Yudane guni inolo baaba sagilisia, sulu auba seleso. Enebamo, Yudane guni inolo ilihe eweguba sulu ule ufulubiyo. Inolo ulenohe Yesu E <char style="w">Keliso</char> labeba selesenaga, ilihe amo ili galiba guluguluyo milabuba elo ofelesia, mosomu baea melaeyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Guni inolo auba molomalune sagilisia, ene enaedai, enaodai, selesia, “E ama asidalu labegulu, gili koleba enefea doba bamaba” seleso.<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Ausi, ilihe inolo samini si kalalu alolumo saabia aganebo weso. Ilihe efea selesia, “Ga sulu seale saeyoba selesiamo, Godene si saabiamo aiiba koleba saama. Inolo amone saaba ga sulu selefe ogo, e <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> inolo. Nini auba asigibu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Ili auba selesi, ehe obegeba selesia, “E wolu mololo inolonagada, me wolu mololale inolonagada, na babeafe. Kegele ule na asigibu. Samini na si kalalu aloluso, aga na si bebelesu!”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Auba selesi, ilihe saabia efea doba bisigia, “Ehe gafea eneba moloso? Ehe ge si ogo eneba fisigaba ofeleso?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Ausi, ehe ine sulu obegeba selesia, “Nahe gilifea ama saaba melu. Auluso, gili dobelesale. Enesi, gili saabia dubiyo hamese? Gilida Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> miliyo hamefela?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Auba selesi, Falisi ilihe inolo amofea gaidaboba selesia, “Ga-mo, ogone walelu faibe labebu. Ninimo, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesene</char> walelu faibili lolu. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Nini hilisebu, Godehe Mosesefea sulu solu. Auluso, inolo ogo wagifia mulubi, amoda nini asigibuale.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Auba selesi, inolo amo eweguba obegeba seleso. “Gilihe auba selefe ogohe, na momoleba dobelesu. Enebamo, inolo ogo E wagifia mulubi, gili asigibualeba selefeso, Ehe ne si fisigaba ofeleso. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:15">Sng 34.15</ref></char></note>Nini hilisebu, Godehe wolu mololo inolone sulu dobolale. Auluso, inolo abehe gulugulusia, Ene hame kuliba aafe amo, Godehe ene sulu dobolo. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Si kalalu seba dulu inolo ulenone si fisigaba ufulu. Kegele amogulu amakele adabia mulufealofia inigia, agada holobagalale koleba. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Inolo ewe Godefea alefasia mulualebiaga, amo Ehe kegele uleno amogulu molobaiyale.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 51:5">Sng 51.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Si fisigalu inolo auba selesi, Falisi ilihe obegeba selesia, “Eneba labe? Ge gaehe ga seba duluiyafia inigia, aga labea ogo <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> mana gafea koleba wasigaabubu. Gahe ninifea mana waleyo hilisefe dagulo?” Auba safasia, ilihe e sigifia, aiba gasaba dafeleso.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asigi ule ufuluale idele inolo amo si kalalu alebaibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Si fisigalu inolo amo aiba gasaba dafuluba solumo dofasia, Yesuhe e isaeyo aaso. Aufia, Ehe e baafia, efea selesia, “Ga <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibefea</char> <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulula</char>?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Ausi, inolo amo selesia, “Ga Inololene Faibeba selese ogo, abe? Ga nafea saaba mesi, na Efea asigi ule ufiyoba.”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Aga gahe E bisigia, gadai sulu selefe ogo.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Ausi, inolo amohe emo hugulumo sagafia, Yesufea gulugulusia selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, na Gafea asigi ule ofelesu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Ausi, Yesuhe selesia, “Na helefealu iwi mulumo, osolaeyone mulu. Aulune, idele inolo si kalalu alebaibu ili amo, si bebeleyobafe. Aufia, idele inolo si bebelefe ili amo, si kalaba yaeyobafe.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mad 15.14</ref></char></note><char style="w">Falisi</char> noolo Yesu aniba alolu ilihe sulu E selefe amo dobeleso. Aufia, ilihe Efea doba bisigia, “Ga selesia, ninida si kalaluba selefe dagulo?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Gine si ogo kalalubiaga, amo gilihe <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">woluda</char> heleba daalu male alebaiyo. Auluso, gili aga si bebelesuba selefemo alefasia, gine wolumo aso ufiyasu labe.” Yesu Falisifea auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu E-mo dofene sibi uluba ado nafulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Na gilifea seale koleba selesu, inolo <char style="w">dofene sibi</char> nigiliba haneba ada amone eno saliba sugasialeso, yala nolobalo afogaifasia, suga saabe amo, e fadilo inolo ligia, woba dafelaba ado labe. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Auluso, eno saliba sugafe inolo amo, ene <char style="w">dofene sibi uluba ado</char> labe. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Dofene sibida luba ado saabimo, eno salibada yasiba adohe, efea eno sogoba ofolo. Ausi, dofene sibi ilimo ine luba adone mofe dobolaba yaalo. Ehe ene dofene sibi koleba ine wi weba yaafia, ehe ili naiyo isamesi baea lubia dedalelo. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Ehe ene dofene sibi sunia baea lubia dedalefia, ene e-mo ili saminiba ano. Aufia, ene dofene sibi ilihe ene sulu mofe dobolaba yaasiane, e kuliba dedaleba ado. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Auluso, ilihe inolo no baafia, amo kuliba dedalelale. Aubale. Dofene sibihe, inolo none sulu mofe eloba dobolalene, ilihe e baafia, fisaba dedaleyobafe.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesuhe besi sulu auba idele inolofea soluso, ilihe E saaba mefemo fadaba asigiba disale.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea saabia selesia, “Na gilifea seale koleba selesu. Dofene sibine Eno Salibamo Nene Na lolu. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:1-2">Jer 23.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:2-3">Ese 34.2-3</ref></char></note>Auluso, inolo sunia ilidale milibailu ogo, fadilo ligia, woba dafolo inolo alebailu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fadilo inoloba selefe amo, masega walelo inolo amone iminife.</char></note> Auluso, dofene sibihe ine sulu mofemo dobolaba yaaluale. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Eno Saliba Nene Na lolu. Inolo uleno abehe Na labea milifasia, yala usu suga esenaga, amo Gode alefasia, e <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba obegeba diyobafe</char>. Aufia, e-mo aeaba maiyo miyoba ligia, naiyo naba miliyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Fadilo inigiamo, dofene sibi fa difasia, dufa dafalifia, ili woba dafaliyone ano. Kegele no moloyone e anale. Auluso, Na mulumo, ili miliyolu dimesi mulu. Ausi, miliyolumo ili auba disi, ine libo wasigaaba yaeyobafe.” <figure style="fig" alt="Shepherd fights off wolf" file="BA03030.tif" size="col" loc="10.11" copy="(SIL) used with permission of Louise Bass." ref="10.11-15">Dofene sibida luba ado nafulu amohe sibi sagoba ofelesia, selibo geso aiba gasaba dafalife.</figure><verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 23:1">Sng 23.1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:17">MUU 7.17</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Dofene Sibida Uluba Ado Nafulu kolebamo, Nene Na lolu. Luba Ado nafuluhe, Ene dofene sibi sagoba waalesia, Ene miliyolu weaselo. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:29">HD 20.29</ref></char></note>Auluso, inolohe mole dabalusu molofe amo, e-mo dofene sibine enao sealeale ligia, selibo geso saabi besenaga, ehe dofene sibi gadefia, fisaba maiyobafe. Ausi, selibo gesohe dofene sibi noolo yasoba nabia, noolo aiba gasaba dedaleyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Enebamo, inolo amo elebe diyonesu dabalu moloba ligia, dofene sibi asigilalene, fisaba maiyobafe.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14-15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.14-15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mad 11.27</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:16">1Yon 3.16</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, Dofene Sibida Uluba Ado Nafulu kolebamo, Nene Na lolu. Ne Naohe Na asigifiasu labi, Nahe Nao asigifiasu lolu. Amogubasu, Nahe Ne dofene sibi asigifiasu labi, ilihe Na asigifiasu alebaibu. Aufia, Nahe dofene sibi sagoba waalesia, Ne miliyolu weasesu. <verse eid="JHN 10:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:8">Ais 56.8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:23">Ese 34.23</ref></char></note>Nahe Ne dofene sibi nooloda alebaibu. Ili yala usu iwi alebaibuale. Nahe ili amoda lubia milibaiyodolu dobu. Ausi, ilida Ne mofe dobolaba yaeyobafe. Ausi, dofene sibi ili sunia ua gagaiyo sogolugaba ule adesi, dofene sibida uluba ado ulesu ili uluba miliyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:8-9">Fil 2.8-9</ref></char></note>Ne Naohe Na hamesebumone mau, ewe. Nahe Ne miliyolu weaseyo. Aufia, Nahe ne miliyolu haiba obegeba diyo. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Inolo ulenohe Ne miliyolu diba dafiyobafale. Aubale. Nene hame koleba alefasia, Nahe Ne miliyolu weaseyo. Nahe Ne miliyolu weaseyone wida solu kiwida lolu. Aufia, Nahe amo haiba obegeba diyone wida solu kiwida lolu. Ne Naohe Nafea auba molomaleba seleso.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Yesune sulu amohe alefasia, <char style="w">Yuda</char> ili haiba osolaba dafaliso. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Inolo wedinale selesia, “Efea <char style="w">gamodo</char> ligia, E kagoafebu. Mau eneyone, sulu E selefemo dobelese?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Auluso, noolo selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Gamodo">Gamododa</char> inolohe sulu E selefeguba sodale. Aufia, gamododa ulenohe si kalalu inolo si fisigaba ofolale.”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudane guni inolohe Yesudai gisa alebailu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Fogo amoyamo, Yelusalame ami guluguluyone sigilo hilia adesi, idele inolo gagaiyoso. Sigilo hilia ewe, ilihe samini sebele molo Godeneba saaba ufuluiya amone, obegeba hilisesia gagaiyolo. Sigilo hilia amo kene gia adeso. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Ausi, Yesu E <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usu ami, <char style="w" lemma="Solomono">Solomonone</char> saloaiyaba soda ami, daaba adeso. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Auba labi, <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> guni inolo ili milibaifia, E amaleba galifia ligia, Efea selesia, “Ga amo kolebaba ninifea asiga ulufaba saeyobase? Ga <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisonaga</char>, amo Gahe ninifea ulufaba saama. Nini dubiyo yasiba lolu. Saabia no yasimalemabu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Ili auba selesi, Yesuhe ine sulumone obegeba selesia, “Na gilifea ama saaba meluso, gili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesale</char>. Momolelu kegele Nahe Ne Naone wi alefasia mololumohe gilifea walesia, Na amoba walefe. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Auluso, gili Ne <char style="w">dofene sibi</char> alebaibualene, gili asigi ule ofelefale. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ne dofene sibi ilimo, Ne sulu mofe dobelesia, milibaiba labi, Nahe ili fadaba asigifia lolu. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16">Yon 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:39">6.39</ref></char></note>Nahe ilifea <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> mesimo, ili woba dafaliyobafale. Aubale koleba. Ausi, inolo ulenohe Ne sone sebu ili amo diba dafaliyobafale. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Ne Nao ili Nafea melu amo E, noolo sunia wasolu labe. Inolo ulenohe, Ne Naone sone sebu ili amo diba dafaliyobafale. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Naodai, Nadaimo, ani ule lolu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Yuda ilihe sulu amo dofasia, Yesu uliyone saabia abane molaso. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Nahe Naofeafia momolelu kegele wedinale gilifea walelu. Gilihe momolelu kegele ewene aleba halane hilisesia, Na abane uliyo weiyaase?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Wkp 24.16</ref></char></note>Yuda ilihe obegeba selesia, “Dabalu nafulu ga mololu amone alefasia, ninihe Ga abane uliyo weiyaasuale. Aubale. Auluso, Ga inolo balu waagahe, Gene Ga Gode loluba selefe ogo, mau amone alefasia, nini Ga abane uliyo hamesu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Ausi, Yesuhe ine sulumone obegeba selesia, “Godene bugo usu eweguba selelu dobu. ‘Godehe inolo noolofea selesia, “<char style="qt">Gilimo gode alebaibuba</char>”’ solu. Seale auba selelu dobu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sulu “gode” iwi leda wedino “g” amohe selelumo, “masega godeba” selesia iminifeba hilisemabiyo. Fogo nolobalomo, ee, sulu “gode” leda “g” wedinoda selelu amohe “masega godeba” selesia iminife. Auluso, iwi “godeba” selefe amohe, “Godene faibiliba” iminife. Iwimo, Yesuhe Buk Song 82.6 amofeafia sulu difasia solu. Buk Song 82.6 amimo, Godehe inolo noolofea selesia, “Gili gode alebaibu. Amo seale, gilimo, Godene faibili alebaibu.” Nini sulu selelumo nolosenaga, sulu sisa kiwi diyone koleluale. Eweguba: “Gili Godene faibili alebaibune, gili gode alebaibu” Asigima: Kelebulune faibemo, amo kelebulu. Inololene faibemo, amo inolo. Aulune, eweda: Godene faibeba selefe amo, amo gode. Buk Song 82 usu ami, Godehe inololefea selesia, “Gilimo Godene faibili labenaga, gilihe Gode waagulu ligia, isolu mana amoda molomale.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35-36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35-36" />Nini hilisebu, Godene bugo selelu dobumo, waaselaba bolale dobu. Aulugulu, gili asigima. Naohe Na <char style="w" lemma="Noekene">noekeneba</char> gadefafasia, helefealu iwi malaso. Aulune, Nahe Nene meleba Ene Faibe loluba solumone, gili enesi gadise? Gili Nafea selesia, ‘Ga Godene hele dulusia, samabiyolu muguli gelefeba’ solu amo, enesi Nafea auba fadaasia, oloba koweba selese? Gili amone mau male adefe. Enebamo, Gode Ene Ehe inolo noolofea, ‘Gili gode alebaibuba’ solubiyo. Amo asigima. <verse eid="JHN 10:35-36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Nahe Ne Naone dabalu molosalenaga, amo gili Nafea asigi ule homabiyo. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:10-11">Yon 14.10-11</ref></char></note>Auluso, Na Naone dabalu molosenaga, aufia, gilihe aso Nafea asigi ule ufiyo hamesalenagada, amo gilihe momolelu kegele Na molosu ewefea alefasia, asigi ule homale. Ausi, gilihe auba asigi ule ofelesenaga, amo gilihe asigisia, Nao Nafea labi, Na Naofea loluba, auba fadaba asigiba diyobafe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Yesu auba selesi, ilihe E saabia seyo weiyaaluso, Ehe ili suniafia siba daafia aaso.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:28">Yon 1.28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesu E obegeba abia, hano Yodene segefia abia, hele samini <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yonehe</char> inolo <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> waaleba aloiya ami goafia, E hele ami adeso. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Ausi, idele inolo wedinale E labea milibaifia, ili selesia, “Seale, Yone <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> uleno mololualeso, sulu sunia e inolo ewene saaba solumo, seale solu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Aufia, hele amimo idele inolo wedinalehe Yesufea asigi ule waaleso.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Lasalusu olalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:38-39">Lug 10.38-39</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hilia uleno, inolo uleno ene wi <char style="w">Lasalusu</char>, e walefa ufulubiyo. Ene mosomumo, Bedani. Ene enano <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[3]], Lasalusune enano ligia">Maliada</char>, Madada, aaludai ami asulubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:3">Yon 12.3</ref></char></note>Malia ewehe dufia <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> emo saabia hano kasineda sagafia, ene guni aluhe dolalubiyo. Lasalusu walefa ufulu amomo, Maliadai, Madadai, aine enanobiyo. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Lasalusu walefa ufia labi, enano aidahe sulu Saminilofea sabaisia, selesia, “Inolo Ge hameselu ewe kolebamo, walefa dobu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 9:3">Yon 9.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesuhe sulu amo dofasia, selesia, “Walefa ewe, inolo olamesi walefafale. Aubale. Idele inolo ilihe Godene kiwigagalu amo baafia, wi bule Efea memesifia aulubiyo. Ausiane, Godene Faibeda wi bule diyobafe.” Yesu auba seleso. <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesuhe Madada, Maliada, aine enano Lasalusuda, bule koleba hameselubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Aufia, Ehe Lasalusu walefa dobuba solu dofasia, E mosomu Eda aloiya waagi hilia aida aso adeso. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Hilia aida amo alefasia, Ehe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> selesia, “Nini Yudia obegeba aasuba seleso.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Auluso, walelu faibili ili selesia, “Walelo, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo noolohe abane difasia, ga uliyo weiyaasomo, aso fogo bule daabale labegulu, enesi Ga haiba Yudia ami maiyo hamese?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe ine sulumone obegeba selesia, “Hilia ule amone, halosi fogo aoa huguluba yaida ado. Aulugulu, inolo yaida daaba adesenaga, e halo nee abia, kegele sunia bisigia, siginaba gelebaiyobafale. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Aubale. Auluso, inolo nigili gagaba abiamo, yane efea malene, siginaba gelebailo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Auba safasia, Yesuhe ilifea saaba mesia selesia, “Nine damene Lasalusumo hanelu dobu. Auluso, Na e gilaeyone aasu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Auba selesi, walelu faibili ili selesia, “Saminilo, doma, e hanefia labenaga, amo ene walefa geleyobafeba” seleso. <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Auluso, Yesuhe Lasalusu hanelu dobuba selefemo, e olalu dobu amone besi sulu soluso, Ene walelu faibili ili hilisesiamo, e seale hanelu dobuba selefeba hiliseso. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Ausi, aga Yesuhe ulufaba dafa ilifea selesia, “Lasalusu olalu dobu. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Auluso, e olafe fogomo Na ami alolualene, Nahe gili hilisesia, henesu. Enebamo, Na moloyobafe amohe, gili Nafea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule homesi</char> aufe. Ausia, aga nini e labea aasu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 14:31">Mag 14.31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu auba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Domase">Domase</char> Didimusuba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wi </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Didimusu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, aidaba seba duluba selesia sodo.</char></note> sodo amohe, walelu faibili noolomofea selesia, “E aasi, guni inolo ilihe E dufa olaeyobafe. Ninida E galiba olaeyone aasu.” Domase auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E-mo, Degeba Ifoyo ligia, miliyolu miliyo melo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Ausi, Yesuda, Ene walelu faibilida, ili abia, Bedani mosomu aniba goafia, Yesu dobelesia, Lasalusu olalu dana ufulumo, hilia biniba adefeba selesi dobeleso. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Bedani mosomu amo, Yelusalame sidi aniba iminimo, kilomida osoloa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kilomida osoloa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aafe fogo amo, Walagu mosomu amifia abia, Yose moloa goalo amoguba dobu. </char></note> amogulu dobiyo. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Ausi, <char style="w">Yuda</char> idele inolo wedinalemo Yelusalamefia milibaifasia, Madadai, <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[3]], Lasalusune enano ligia">Maliadai</char> aine enano olasi, aine libo heneba ofa miliyofia, aalu labea milibailubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Madahe Yesu saabeba solu dofasia, e Yesu eno kia wakaliyone aaso. Auluso, Malia moloa waagi yoba aseleso.<verse eid="JHN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Mada Yesu labea goafia, Efea selesia, “Saminilo, Ga iwi alolubiaga, ne nano olabaiyale. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Auluso, agada na hilisebu, kegele sunia Ga Godefea haalife ogomo, Ehe Gafea meyobafe.” Mada auba seleso. <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesuhe efea selesia, “Ge gano ogo haiba degeyobafe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:40">Yon 6.40</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Madahe Efea selesia, “Na hilisebu, aleba eloyo hilia adesi, idele inolo sunia <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba</char> yaeyobafe. Hilia ami e degeyobafe.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Mada auba selesi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Idele Inolo Degeba Ifoyomo, Nene Na lolu. Miliyolu Miliyone Maumo, Nene Na lolu. Abehe Nafea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelefemo</char>, olasenagada, e miliyolu bebea miliyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Aufia, abehe bebea sigia, Nafea asigi ule ofelefemo, ene miliyolu alefalu ligia, olasia, olaeyobafale. Ga sulu amofea asigi ule ofelefela?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:69">Yon 6.69</ref></char></note>Yesu auba selesi, Madahe Efea selesia, “Ee, Saminilo, Ga <char style="w">Keliso</char>, Godene Faibe, helefealu iwi miyobafeba saaba ufulumo E, amo Ga labe. Na auba hilisesia, Gafea asigi ule ufulu lolu.” Mada auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E Lasalusu yagunagafia yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Madahe auba saafia, obegeba abia, ehe ene inalo <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[3]], Lasalusune enano ligia">Malia</char> weyo aaso. Aufia, ehe esebaloba Maliafea koneniasia selesia, “Walelo mulu labe. Ehe ga milafe.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Maliahe sulu amo dofasia, e alebale degedafia, Yesu labea aaso. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu aso mosomia goabale ligia, E aso Madada wakaliya hamagi alolubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" /><char style="w">Yuda</char> ilihe Malia ene libo heneba ofa moloa ami sigia, e galiba yegiliba asulu, ili amohe Malia alebale degefia aafemo besabeo. E-mo dana dobia ami kuanoba misiyo aafebuba hilisesia, ilihe e kuliba dedaleso.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Malia e abia, Yesuda labea ami goafia, E baafia, Ene emo aniba sauba hanefia selesia, “Saminilo, Ga iwi alolubiaga, ne nano olabaiyale.” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesuhe Malia yeefemo baafia, aufia Yuda idele inolo Malia galiba milibailu ili amoda yegiliba yaasi baafia, Eda yagunagasia, ene libo higinifia adeso. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Ausi, E selesia, “Gilihe ene dana wagi dobuba” seleso. Ausi, ilihe Efea selesia, “Saminilo, ga babiyo mila.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Ausi, Yesu E si hano aaso. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Yuda ili amo baafia, selesia, “Bama. Ehe inolo ewe bule hameselubu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:6-7">Yon 9.6-7</ref></char></note>Auluso, noolo selesia, “Ehe si kalalu inolo amone si fisigalubiyo. Aulugulu, inolo eweda olamesiale sagoba ufiyalebile?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Lasalusu degeba ifoso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Ausi, Yesu abia, Ene libo higinifia, dana dobia ami goaso. Dana amo abane molo ufulubiyo. Amone eno salibamo, ilihe abane bule uleno kaaba dafulubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Ausi, Yesu selesia, “Gili abane ewe diba damaba” seleso. Auluso, olalu inolo amone enano Madahe, Yesufea selesia, “Saminilo, sesenelu wolu dubiyobafe! E dana ufia ligia, aga hilia binibo adefe.” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Mada auba selesi, Yesu efea selesia, “Ga <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesenaga</char>, amo ga Godene kiwigagalu <char style="w">elalelu</char> babiyobafe. Nahe gafea auba ama saaba mesalela?”<verse eid="JHN 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Ausi, ilihe abane diba dafeleso. Ausi, Yesu E ana baaba lagofia selesia, “Nao, Gahe sulu Na Gadai solumo dubulumone, Na Gafea henesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Hilia sunia, Na sulu selesi, Ga doboloba Na asigibu. Auluso, idele inolo wamili iwi alebaibu ewehe, Ga Na hilibailuba hilisesia, asigi ule waalemesine Na auba selesu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />E auba saafia, Ehe koleba wuuasia selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Lasalusu">Lasalusu-ooo</char>! Ga degefia baea fela mila!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Yesu auba selesi, olalu inolo amone emoda, soneda, mida, fagulo dofalu ligia, degefia baea fela saabeo. Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “E malesi, dana fagulo dofabu ogo, huba dama.” <figure style="fig" alt="Lazarus comes out of tomb" file="C074.JPG" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention. Used with permission." ref="11.38-44">Yesuhe Lasalusu degeba ifolu.</figure><verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Guni inolo ilihe Yesu dufiyone sulu ule ofeleso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Madiyu 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maga 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lugu 22.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.45 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 7:31">Yon 7.31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w">Yuda</char> ili <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[3]], Lasalusune enano ligia">Maliadai</char> kuanoba misiyo milibaifasia, kegele Yesu molofe amo abulu ili aleba ami, wedinalehe Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule waaleso</char>. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:31">Lug 16.31</ref></char></note>Auluso, noolo ilimo dedalefia, kegele Yesu mololumo <char style="w">Falisi</char> ilifea saaba meso. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ilida, Falisi inoloda, ilihe galisolo inolo weba gagaiyofia selesia, “Nini eneba moloyobi? Inolo ogo, <char style="w" lemma="Momolelu kegele">eloba bamesine momolelu kegele</char> wedinale moloba ado. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Aulugulu, ninihe E auba waagi moloba melesi gadefasenaga, idele inolo sunia Efea asigi ule waaleyobafe. Ausenaga, Lome gamane ilihe, nine dabalu mololo fogomoda, nine mosomu suniada, nine sonefeafia sagoba dilosi.” Galisolo inolo ili auba neneso.<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Fogo ami, ili aleba inolo uleno alolumo, ene wi Kaiafase. Hamu amohe, e soba melone guni inolo alolubiyo. Ehe galisolo inolo ami gagaiyofia selesia, “Kegele ewemo gilihe asigiba difalebu. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Eweguba asigima. Mosomu sunia woba dafolosine, inolo ulenohe idele inolo sunia alibiasia, olasenaga amo nafulu. Auba ausenaga, amohe ninifea sagoba ufiyobafe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Kaiafase auba seleso. E sulu amo ene asigi hilisefeguba selesale. Aubale. E hamu amo, soba melone guni inolo alolune, ehe sulu saaba ofa selesia, Yesuhe mosomu alibiasia olaeyobafeba seleso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.51 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kaiafase</char><char style="ft" closed="false">he sulu auba saeyone asigi e ene duluale koleba. Aubale, e auba samesi Asubane Noekenehe efea asigiba ufulu. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:16">Yon 10.16</ref></char></note>Yesu olasiamo, Ehe Yuda mosomu ilibisu alibiaba olaeyobafale. Aubale. E olasiamo, Godene faibili hele sunia budiba dafaliba yaafia alebaibu ili amo, mosomu ule gagaiyoba waaleyone olalu.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.53 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:18">Yon 5.18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hilia amifia, Yudane guni inolo ilihe Yesu dufa olaeyone eno isasia sulu daiyaba adeso.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Aulune, Yesu E saabia no Yudane si saabia ulufaba siba adesale. E hele amo gadefia abia, hele falaiya ami, dauno uleno Efalimeba soda ami, miliyofia aaso. Aufia, Edai, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilidai</char>, ili dauno ami adeso.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />
    <char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> Hilia hagoale adesi, idele inolo wedinale mosomu ilida kakainabia amifia abia, nuguma heelo mana moloyone Yelusalame sidi ami fela dedaleso. Sigilo hilia adesi, ili Godene si saabia galagololu miliyone auso. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Yelusalame ami goafia, ilihe Yesu isasia waaleso. Ili <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usu ami alebaifia ligia, ine geleba selesia, “Gili eneba hilisefe? Sigilo hilia E iwi miyobafela, me miyobafalela?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Ili auba solu maumo, soba melone guni inolo ilida, Falisida, ilihe idele inolofea eweguba saaba melubiyo. “Inolo ulenohe Yesu E wagi labi besenaga, amo ninifea saaba memaleba” solubiyo. Ilihe E seba sugaeyonefia aulubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Maliahe Yesune emo saabia hano kasineda sagaso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Madiyu 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maga 14.3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:1">Yon 11.1</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 11:43">43</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, <char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> Hiliamo aso hilia kaabeba dobi, fogo amohe Yesu E Bedani ami goaso. Bedani amo, <char style="w" lemma="Lasalusu">Lasalusune</char> mosomubiyo. Inolo amo Yesuhe olaiyafia degeba ifolu amo, e-biyo. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:40">Lug 10.40</ref></char></note>Mosomu ami, ilihe Yesufea heneba ofa naiyo meso. Mada ehe naiyo madeneba waaleba labi, Lasalusu e inolo Yesu galiba naiyo nabaiba alolu ili amodai, yoba saabeo. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Lug 7.37-38</ref></char></note>Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[3]], Lasalusune enano ligia">Maliahe</char> yugulu hanogulu kasineda mole ana dulumo, bodolo ule wasigaalu difasia, Yesune emo saabia sagaso. Aufia, ehe ene guni alu selalehe, Yesune emo dolaba ofeleso. Ausi, yugulu hano amone kasine nafuluhe molo amo sunia gasiaguso.<verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Ausi, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> amone uleno, <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasa Isakaliodo</char>, dufia Yesuda holonoyobafe amohe, eweguba seleso. <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Hano kasineda ewemo, mole ana koleba elegeba dilo. Amo inolo nofea elegesiabiaga, hamu ulene dabalu molosi elebe dilo amogulu difasia, mole amo weagulu ilifea meyone diba ofaiye. Auba aulualemo, mau enesi aufe?” Yudasa auba seleso. <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Auluso, ehe weagulu inolo ili amone yagunagaba hiliseba, auba selesale. Aubale. E fadilo inolobiyo. Yesuda, Ene walelu faibilida, ine mole samolo selo ligia, ehe mole ili ami ofolaba adomo, e fa diaba adobiyo.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yesuhe Yudasa solu amo dofasia, selesia, “Ido ogo molofemo waagima. Ne domala dana usu diba ufiyone madeneyosia, ehe yugulu hano kasineda ewemo diba ufulubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Lo 15.11</ref></char></note>Helefealu iwi, weagulu idele inolo ili amo, hilia sunia gilidai miliyobafe. Auluso, Na gilidai hilia sunia iwi miliyale.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Soba melone guni inolo ilihe, Lasalusu dufiyone sulu ule ofeleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />
    <char style="w">Yuda</char> mosomu wamili ilihe, Yesumo mosomu Bedani labeba solu dofasia, E labea milibaiso. Ilihe Yesu babiyonesu milibaisale. Aubale. <char style="w">Lasalusu</char>, Yesuhe olaiyafia degeba ifolu amoda, babiyone milibaiso. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10-11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:45">Yon 11.45</ref></char></note>Lasalusufea mololu amo alefasia, Yuda idele inolo wedinale elaba dedalesia, Yesufea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule waalesi</char> baafia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ilihe, Lasalusu eda dufa olaeyone sulu neneso.<verse eid="JHN 12:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E kinigulu alefasia, Yelusalame suga aaso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Madiyu 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maga 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lugu 19.28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Adigi no, idele inolo wamili wedinale Sigilo hilia amone Yelusalame gagaiyofia alebailu amo, ili dobelesia, Yesumo Yelusalame suga saabeba solu dobeleso. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Sng 118.25-26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:49">Yon 1.49</ref></char></note>Aufia, ilihe samia walu noolo sesaifia, abia, E eno kia wakaliyo dedaleso. Aufia, ilihe wiaba selesia, <char style="qt">“Hosana!</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hosana</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba sulu sodo amone sisa: “Ene wi wabialemaba selefe”. </char></note> <char style="qt">Ene wi wabialemo-ooo! <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> wi alefasia saabemo, Efea wabialesia, Ene wi digimo-ooo!</char> <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaelene</char> kinifea wabialesia, wi digimo-ooo!” <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Aufia, Yesuhe <char style="w">dofene dogi</char> kalofo uleno difasia, E amo saabia asefia, miliba adeso. Amo Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobuguba moloso.<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Sek 9.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">“Saionone eleweli, </char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12.15 </char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">Saionone eleweli</char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, Yelusalame sidi amone selefe. Seale, Yelusalame ami kakainabu idele inolo amone iminife. Aulugulu, sagilimabuba selefe amo, Yelusalame idele inolo amofea selefe.</char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">ga sagilimabu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">
    <char style="qt">Bama, gine kinimo aga saabego.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">
    <char style="qt">E <char style="w">dofene dogi</char> kalofo saabia asefia saabego.”</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 12:15" />
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:15">Godene bugo auba selelu dobiyo.<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:22">Yon 2.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Saminimo, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> Godene bugo alegasia, ilihe sulu amomo Yesufea iminifeba eloba babale alebailubiyo. Auluso, dufia, Godehe Yesufea wi bule mefia labimo, ilihe Efea mololu ewe obegeba hilisesia, ili Godene bugo sulu ewe alegasia, ilihe asigiba difasia, sulu amo Yesu iminifebuba eloba besabeo.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Yesuhe <char style="w">Lasalusu</char> dana amifia wesia, olaiyafia degeba ifolu hilia ami, idele inolo wedinale ami alebaisia, auba molosi abulubiyo. Aufia, ilihe dedalesia, Yesu auba molofeba awasia, ulufaba saaba dafelagolabia, sibaisaba alolubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Ausi, Yesuhe <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> ewe mololuba solu dubulune, idele inolo wedinalehe E eno kia wakaliyo dedaleso. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" /><char style="w">Falisi</char> ilihe amo baafia, ili ine geleba sulu selesia, “Bama. Aga nini hodobaisafe. Helefealu sunia E kuliba dedalefeba” seleso.<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Giligi inolo noolohe Yesu babiyo hameso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Yuda idele inolo Yelusalame ami Sigilo hilia amone gagaiyolu amone aleba amimo, Giligi inolo nooloda guluguluyone milibaifia, ami alolubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Ili amo <char style="w" lemma="Filibi[[1]], Yesune walelu faibe">Filibi</char> labea milibailuso. Filibi e Galiline Besaida dauno inolo. Aufia, ilihe Filibifea selesia, nini Yesu babiyo hamefeluso. <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Ausi, Filibihe <char style="w" lemma="Adulu">Adulufea</char> saeyo daaluso. Aufia, Aduludai, Filibidai, aaluhe Yesu labea abia, Efea selesia, Giligi inolo noolohe ga babiyo hamefesoba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:31-32">Yon 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:1">17.1</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesu selesia, “<char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> wi bule elalelu dimesimone, fogo aga holobagabu. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:36">1Kld 15.36</ref></char></note>Na gilifea seale koleba selesu, ‘Goali isomo, hele usu sugafia, ene e weasesia, belaba disalenaga, amo iso balu ule elebisu adabasu miliyobafe. Auluso, goali isomo, inolo olaloguba, ene e weasesia, belaba disenaga, amo sobosiamo sebe wedinale heleleyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:25">Mad 16.25</ref></char></note>Amogubasu, uleno abehe, ene e weaseyalesia, amo ene miliyolu fedoba seyo hilisesenaga, ene miliyolu amo daba dafiyobafe. Auluso, uleno abehe, helefealu iwi ene miliyolu weasesenaga, amo ehe ene miliyolumo fedoba sefia alefalu miliyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Aulugulu, inolo abehe Ne dabalu molosenaga, amo e koleba Na kuliba miyo dobu. Aufia, Nada labea ami, ne dabalu mololo eda ami miliyo dobu. Ne dabaluda molofe amo, efeamo Ne Naohe wi bule meyobafe.’ ” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo koleba Inololene Faibe wi digiyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 6:3">Sng 6.3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 42:5">42.5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:38">Mad 26.38</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Aga Ne libo higinifia, bule keleba hilisefe. Aulugulu, Na eneba saeyobi? Na alefasia, Naofea eweguba saeyobile? ‘Nao-ooo! Fogo wolu iwifia Ga koleba Na gasiba dima!’ Na Efea auba saeyobile? Aubale. Na auba saeyobale. Aga fogo ewe Na labea waagi holobagamesi. Mau ewene alefasia, Na mulu. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />‘Nao, Ga koleba, Ge wi bule elalelu waagi holobagaba homa.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Yesuhe sulu auba saafia labi, sulu goo uleno <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> eweguba dobeleso. “Na alefasia, Ne wi bule elalelu ama holobagaba ufulugulu, agada Nahe Ne wi bule elalelu saabia no holobagaba ufiyobasu.” Sulu goo auba dobeleso. <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Ausi, idele inolo E aniba alebailu amohe, sulu amo dofasia, selesia, “Hagana guduso.” Ausi, noolo selesia, “<char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> ulenohe Efea sulu seleso.”<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Idele inolo auba selaba labi, Yesu selesia, “Sulu aga gili dobelesomo Na sagoba ofa selesale. Aubale. Gili sagoba ufiyone seleso. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Helefealu iwi osolaeyone fogo aga holobagabu. Ausi, helefealu eweda yasilo aga diba dafiyobafe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Helefealu eweda yasilo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, henaneba selesia iminife.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Yon 3.14</ref></char></note>Auluso, Na-mo, Na hele amifia digiba lagosimo, Nahe idele inolo sunia Na labea milibaimesi sigiba molaeyo.” Yesu auba seleso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu selesia, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Na hele amifia digiba lago</char><char style="ft" closed="false">yoba selefe amomo, inolo noolohe E imolanefea uluba ofasia, digiba lagoyobafe amone iminisia selefe.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:6">Yon 19.6</ref></char></note>Ehe sulu amo solumo, Ene E olaeyo amone iminiba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:4">Sng 110.4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Ais 9.7</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan 7.14</ref></char>
    </note>Auba selesi, idele inolo wamili ili amohe Efea obegeba selesia, “Ninihe Godene bugo alefasia selesi dubulumo, <char style="w">Keliso</char> amo E miliyolu alefalu adabasu miliyobafeso. Aulune, Gahe <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> helea amifia digiba lagoyobafeba selese ogo, amo Ga enebane selese? Inololene Faibe ogo, abe?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yon 8.12</ref></char></note>Ili auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Fogo bilale, yane aso gilidai miliyobafe. Aga gili aso yane dobu waaga, gili yane daaba melale. Nigili gagaluhe gili gasiagulosi. Enebamo, nigili gagaiya daaba labe amo, e ami aafeba ene asigibuale. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:8">Efe 5.8</ref></char></note>Yane aso gilidai labe yaga, gili yanene faibili melesi, amofea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule waalema</char>.” Sulu auba safasia, Yesu afa abia, ili E bamesialefia muguba aaso.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda wedinalehe Yesufea asigi ule waalesale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Yesuhe <char style="w" lemma="Momolelu kegele">eloba bamesine momolelu kegele</char> wedinale ine si saabia mololuso, ili aso Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule waalesale</char>. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Ais 53.1</ref></char></note>Ewe molosimo, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaiane</char> sulu saaba ufulu ewe wakaliyone moloso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 12:38" />
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“<char style="qt">Saminilo, nini sulu solumoda dofasia sigidubulu amo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">
    <char style="qt">inolo uleno male koleba.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">
    <char style="qt">Saminilone sone kiwigagaluhe dabalu molosi abulumo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">
    <char style="qt">amoda male koleba.”</char><verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Ili asigi ule waaleyodoluale alolu, amone maumo, Aisaiahe iminisia, Godene bugo nolobalo eweguba seleba ufulubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:10">Ais 6.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">“Ine si kegele uleno bamesialefia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">
    <char style="qt">ehe ine si kalaba ufulu.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12.40 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Inolone si kalaba ofolo amo, henane.</char>
    </note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, ili asigi fadaba hilisemesialefia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">
    <char style="qt">ehe ine asigi kaaba dafalilu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">
    <char style="qt">Amo alefasia, ili Nafealo nolomesialene aulu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">
    <char style="qt">Ili Nafealo nolosiabiaga, amo Na ili waiba waalebaiyo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:1">Ais 6.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aisaiahe auba solumone, maumo ehe dufia holobagaeyobafe amone bisigia, e Yesune wabialelodai, kiwigagaludai, ama baafia, Efea iminiba saaba ufulu.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 9:22">Yon 9.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Seale koleba, guni inolo wedinale ilida Yesufea asigi ule ufulubiyo. Auluso, ilihe <char style="w">Falisi</char> baaba sagilisia, ine asigi ule ufulumo ulufaba saaba dafelagosale. Ili sagililumo, Falisihe ili gulugululo gagaiyoiya ami milabuba elo ofelesia, mosomu baea melalelosifia sagiliso. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:44">Yon 5.44</ref></char></note>Aulune, guni inolo Yesufea asigi ule ufulu ilihe, auba ulufaba fadaba selesale. Enebamo, ilihe idele inolomo ine wi digimesi bule hamelo. Auluso, Godehe ine wi digimesi bule hamelale. Aulune, ilihe idele inolo ine wi saabia no digiyaleba sagilisia, Yesu kuliba aasuba ulufaba selesale.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sulu Yesu solumohe idele inolone mana osolaeyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Ausi, Yesuhe koleba kiwigaaba selesia, “Inolohe Nafea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelefemo</char>, Nafeasu asigi ule ofelefale. Nada hilibailu amofeada asigi ule ofelefe. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:9">Yon 14.9</ref></char></note>Inolohe Na besabemo, Nada hilibailu amoda besabe. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Na helefealu iwi suga mulumo, yanegulu mulu. Aulugulu, idele inolo sunia Nafea asigi ule waalefemo, nigili gagaiya ami adabasu miliyobafale.<verse eid="JHN 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:17">Yon 3.17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo ulenohe Ne sulu dofasia, kuliba aasalenaga, amo Nahe e osolaeyale. Enebamo, Na helefealu idele inolo osolaeyone mulu loluale. Aubale. Na mulumo, idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba obegeba diyone</char> mulu.<verse eid="JHN 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Auluso, inolohe Nafea faiso mesia, Ne sulu difalemo, kegele ulenohe e osolaeyobafe. Aleba eloyo hilia adesimo, sulu Na solu amohe inolo amo osolaeyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Sulu Na Nene asigifeguba sodale. Aubale. Nao Nada hilibailu amo, Ene Ehe, sulu sunia Na samesi, Nafea saaba meso. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Aufia, Na hilisebu. Naohe molomalu sulu amohe idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Miliyolu miliyo">miliyolu miliyofealo</char> lubia ano. Aulugulu, sulu Na selesumo, Nao saaba mesisu sodo.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe walelu faibili ine emo nuguma heeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />
    <char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> hilia amo aso holobagaeyo labi, Yesuhe hilisesia, E helefealu ewe afasia, Enao labea maiyomone fogo maugafeba hiliseso. Ehe Ene idele inolo helefealu iwi alebaibumo, bule koleba hameseso. Ehe ili bule koleba hamesefiasu abia, Ene hameselone mana eloyodoluale alolubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:3">Lug 22.3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:27">Yon 13.27</ref></char>
    </note>Geide koleba, ili naiyo naiyone yoba kakainaso. Fogo ami <char style="w" lemma="Henane">henanehe</char> <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasa</char>, Saimono Isakaliodone faibe amo ehe Yesu holonomesifia, ama asigiba ufia alolubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Yon 3.35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 16:28">16.28</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesu hilisesia, Enaohe kegele sunia Ene sone saabia ufuluba asigiso. E Godefeafia muluba hilisesia, E haiba Gode labea obegeba maiyobasuba asigiso. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Auba asigiba ligia, Yesu degefia, E naiyo naba alolumo afasia, E Ene fagulo selale huba ofasia, dauwelo uleno difasia, ene homegia mabuso. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Aufia, Ehe hano disi hogoniaba sefia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibiline</char> emo nugumamo heeyone maugaso. Heefasia, dauwelo Ene homegia mabulumo hamaga ligia, ine emo falamesi heeba yaaso. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus washes feet" file="43_Jn_13_01_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="13.2-11">Yesuhe walelu faibili ine emo nuguma heefe.</figure><verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Aufia, E <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char> <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> labea saabi, Fidahe Efea selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, Ga koleba, ne emo nuguma heeyobase dagulo?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />E auba selesi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Kegele Na molosu ewene maumo, ga aga eloba besabale. Auluso dufia, ga eloba babiyobafe.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesuhe Ene walelu faibiline emo heesiamo, Ehe ilifea eweguba walelu. Ene wi bule dobuso, Ehe helea adesia, nugumalu dabalu moloyone sagililale. Ene kuliba dedalelo ilida, aubasu helea adesia, auba moloyone sagiliyobale. </char></note> Yesu auba seleso. <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Auluso, Fida selesia, “Ga koleba helea adesia, ne emo nuguma heemabu! Heemabu koleba!” Auba selesi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Nahe ga nuguma heesalenaga, amo ga Ne koleba miliyobafale.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Auba selesi, Saimono Fida obegeba selesia, “Saminilo, amo auba auyobai, ne emo heema! Amosuale. Ne sonedai, gunidai, amoda koleba heema.” Fida auba seleso. <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:3">Yon 15.3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:64">6.64</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 6:70-71">70-71</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Inolo hano mulufasia labemo, e nugumadale labegulu, amo e emosu heeyo dobu. Aulugulu, gili nugumadale alebaibu. Auluso, Na gili suniafea selesuale.” Yesu auba seleso. <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Ehe inolo Eda holonoyobafemo Ene asigifia, E selesia, “Gili sunia nugumadaleba selesualeba” seleso.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Yesuhe ine emo nuguma heeba samodofia, Ene fagulo selale haiba saligafia, yoba aseleso. Aufia, Ehe ilifea doba bisigia selesia, “Kegele Nahe gilifea mololu amo, gili fadaba hilisebula? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Gilihe Nafea Waleloba selesiamo, Saminiloba selefe. Auba selesiamo, gili nafulu selefe. Na amo lolu. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:28">Mad 20.28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:27">Lug 22.27</ref></char></note>Aga Na gine Saminilo, gine Walelo ligia, gine emo nugumamo heeba yaalu. Aulugulu, gilida, gine meleba noolo anogone emo nugumamo heeba yaamale. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:5">Fil 2.5</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:13">Kol 3.13</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:21">1Fid 2.21</ref></char></note>Nahe gilifea mana moloba waleluguba, gilida, mana Na aga mololu amogubasu molomale. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mad 10.24</ref></char></note>Na gilifea seale koleba selesu. <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">Dabalu moloba ofolo faibehe</char> ene yasilo waseba sunialale. Aufia, sulu dia malesi <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibailu inolohe</char>, eda hilibailu amo waselale. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Aga, gilihe mana Na mololu amone maumo, fadaba asigifia alebaibugulu, gilihe amo nafuluba kuliba dedalesenaga, amo gine henelo wasigaeyobafe.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Sng 41.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Na gili suniafea selesuale. Aubale. Na molobebelelumo Nene hilisebu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu auba selesiamo, Ehe Yudasafea auba selesualeba solu.</char></note> Auluso, Godene sulu saaba ufulu amone wakaliyone ewe holobagafe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 13:18" />
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 13:18">
    <char style="qt">‘Inolo naiyoda Nadai osolaba naafemo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 13:18">
    <char style="qt">ene emo domo besi dafelesia,</char>
    <note caller="†" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">13.18 </char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">Emo domo besi dafolo</char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, Yudane besi sulu eweguba selefe: Na gadai gisa adesusia sodo.</char>
    </note> <char style="qt">Nadai gisa adefe.’</char><verse eid="JHN 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 14:29">Yon 14.29</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 16:4">16.4</ref></char>
    </note>Amo aso holobagabale labi, Na aga gilifea saaba mesu. Ausi, amo dufia holobagasimo, gilihe Nene Na loluba eloba bisigia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufiyobafe</char>.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nene Na lolu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selesiamo, Yesu E Gode labeba solu. </char><char style="it">Nene Na alolu lolu,</char> amo Godene wi. (Kisim Bek 3.14-15 ami bamale.) </note> <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mad 10.40</ref></char></note>Na gilifea seale koleba selesu, Inolo Nahe hilibaifeda heneba luba dife amo, Na heneba luba dife. Inolo Nada heneba luba difemo, e Nada hilibailu amoda heneba luba dife.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasahe Yesu holonoyo aaso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Madiyu 26.20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maga 14.17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Lugu 22.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesuhe sulu amo saaba samodofia, Ene asigi higinilu koleba adeso. Aufia, E sulu eweguba saaba dafelagoso. “Seale koleba, Na gilifea selesu. Gili ulenohe Na holonoyobafe.” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />E auba selesi, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilihe</char> E abefea iminifia auba selefeba, ili elawanesia, ine geleba bebeleba yaaso. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Fogo ami, walelu faibe Yesu Ene hameselumo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yesu Ene hameselu walelu faibe</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, Yone bugo eweda seleba ufulu, amofea selefe. Yesu walelu faibili noolo hameselualeba selefale. Aubale. Yone ehe bugo ewe seleba ofelesiamo, ehe ene wi selesiale, ene meleba auba muguba ufulu.</char></note> E aniba yoba asulubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char> <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> walelu faibe amofea olegisia selesia, “Ga Efea doma. E selefe ogo, abefea seleseba Efea wanema.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Ausi, e Yesune hamesa anifia, Efea doba bisigia selesia, “Saminilo, ogo abefea selese?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />E auba selesi, Yesu efea obegeba selesia, “Nahe boledi haisi disi usu saguba difasia, inolofea meyobasu amo, e.” Auba safasia, Ehe boledi disi usu sagufasia, Saimonone faibe <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasa Isakaliodofea</char> meso. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:2">Yon 13.2</ref></char></note>Yudasahe boledi amo difasia naasi, <char style="w">Sedene</char> e ene libo sugaso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:27">Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Kegele ga moloyo ufulu ogo, amo ga koleba alebale molomaba” seleso. <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Auluso, naiyo naba kakainalu ili amo sunia Yesuhe Yudasafea auba solumo, mau sisamo fadaba asigiba disale. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Yudasa e mole samolo selo labene, ili hilisesia, Yesuhe Yudasafea auba selefemo, Sigilo hilia amone naiyo elegeyone malafelaba, me kegele weagulu inolofea meyo malafelaba hiliseso. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Ausi, Yudasahe boledi haisi amo nafasia, e baea aasi, nigiliso.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe ilifea molomesi sulu hili meso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 12:23">Yon 12.23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yudasa e baea alebagofia labi, Yesu selesia, “Aga <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> wi bule elalelu dife. Ausi, Godehe Inololene Faibe amofea alefasia, wi bule elalelu dife. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:5">Yon 17.5</ref></char></note>Agamo, Godehe Efea alefasia, wi bule elalelu disenaga, amo Godehe Ene alefasia, Faibe amofea wi bule elalelu meyobafe. Amo E alebale yagi moloyobafe.<verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 7:33-34">Yon 7.33-34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ne faibili, Na fogo wedino aso gilidai miliyobafe. Na daafia labi, gilihe Na isaeyobafe. Na <char style="w">Yuda</char> ilifea ama solu amoguba, aga Na gilifeada sulu hamagane selesu. ‘Na-da maiyo aafea ami, gili maiyodoluale.’<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 15:12">Yon 15.12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1Yon 3.23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2Yon 1.5</ref></char>
    </note>Agamo, Na gilifea molomesi sulu hagaea mesu. Gili gine geleba hamesemale. Na gili hameseluguba, gilida gine geleba aubasu hamesemale. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Gili gine geleba hamesesimo, amofea alefasia, idele inolo suniahe eloba bisigia, gili Ne <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> alebaibuba babiyobafe.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu selesia, Fidahe Efea faiso meyobafeba saaba ofeleso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Madiyu 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maga 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lugu 22.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Yesu auba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char> <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> Yesufea doba bisigia selesia, “Saminilo, ga wagi maiyone aase?” Ausi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Na-da maiyone aafea amimo, ga aga Na kuliba miyodolualebiyo. Auluso, Na-da aafea ami, dufia ga kuliba miyobafeba” seleso.<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Ausi, Fidahe saabia doba bisigia, Efea selesia, “Saminilo, enesi na Ga aga kuliba miyale? Nahe Ga sagoba ofelesia, ne miliyolu weaseyone na sagilifale.” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yon 18.15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></char></note>Fida auba selesi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Ga hilisesia, ga koleba Na sagoba ofelesia, ge miliyolu weaseyone sagilifaleba, ga sealeba hilisesela? Na seale koleba gafea selesu, haga gogono aso galabale labi, ga koleba Na waaselaba bisigia, Na bolaleba, mofeyobu osoloaba saeyobafe.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Nao labea maiyone enomo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Gili libo higinifia, asigi wedinale keleba hilisemabiyo. Gili Godefea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule homale</char>. Aufia, gili Nafeada asigi ule homale koleba. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Ne Naone moloa lagimo, lalolu wedinale dobiyo. Auba malebiaga, Na sulu ewe gilifea saaba mebaiyale. Gilida lagi kakainamesi, Nahe gine fogo madeneyo aasu. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:26">Yon 12.26</ref></char></note>Aufia, Na daafia, gine fogo amo madenefasia, Na obegeba inigia, gili Nadai alebaiyone lubia maiyo. Aufia, Na-da miliyobafea amimo, gilida alebaiyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Aufia, Na-da maiyone aafea enomo, gili fadaba asigibu.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Auba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Domase">Domase</char> Efea selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, gada maiyone aafea ogo, nini hilisebuale. Aulugulu, nini eno amo eneba fadaba asigiyobi?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:25">Yon 11.25</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 5:1-2">Lom 5.1-2</ref></char>
    </note>Domase auba selesi, Yesuhe selesia, “Enomo, Nene Na lolu. Seale Sodone Maumo, Nene Na lolu. Aufia, Miliyolu Miliyone Maumo, Nene Na lolu. Inolo uleno Nao labea miyone, eno no male. Nafeasu koleba. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:19">Yon 8.19</ref></char></note>Gili koleba Na fadaba dawalosenaga, amo Naoda gili fadaba dawaloyobafe. Aga iwifia, gilihe E bafasia ligia, E fadaba dawalofe.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Filibi[[1]], Yesune walelu faibe">Filibihe</char> Yesufea selesia, “Saminilo, Ga Gao ninifea walema. Amohe nine hameda, asigida, liliba ufiyobafe.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 12:45">Yon 12.45</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:15">Kol 1.15</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:3">Hib 1.3</ref></char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Filibi, hilia fogo selale Na gilidai labimo, aga gahe Na aso dawalobualela? Inolo uleno Na besabemo, e Naoda besabe. Enebane gahe Nafea selesia, Ge Gao ninifea walemaba selese? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:49">Yon 12.49</ref></char></note>Na Naofea labi, Naoda Nafea labe. Gahe amofea asigi ule ofelesalela? Sulu Na gilifea selesumo, amo Na Nene hamefeguba selesuale. Aubale. Nao Nafea ligia, Ehe Ene dabalu molofe. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:38">Yon 10.38</ref></char></note>Na Naofea labi, Nao Nafea labe. Gili sulu amofea koleba asigi ule waalemale. Ne sulu amofea asigi ule ofelesalenaga, amo gilihe momolelu kegele Na mololumo hilisemale. Amohe gine asigi ule ufulumone degeba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="JHN 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mag 16.19-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Na gilifea seale koleba selesu. Inolo Nafea asigi ule ofelefemo, ehe kegele Na mololuguba moloyobafe. Aufia, Na mololumo suniaba, ehe kegele bule koleba moloyobafe. Maumo, Na Nao labea maiyone aasu. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:7">Mad 7.7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:16">Yon 15.16</ref></char></note>Aufia, kegele sunia, gilihe Ne wifea alefasia haalifemo, Na moloyobasu. Ausi, Ene Faibe molofe amohe, Enaofea wi bule elalelu meyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Gilihe Ne wifea alefasia, kegele uleno Nafea haalisenaga, amo Na moloyobasu.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Asubane Noekenemo mebaiyoba saaba ofeleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 15:10">Yon 15.10</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 5:3">1Yon 5.3</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Gili koleba Na hamesesenaga, amo gilihe Na molomaleba solu sulu kuliba maiyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:26">Yon 14.26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:26">15.26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 16:7">16.7</ref></char></note>Nahe Naofea doba besabi, Ehe gilifea Sagoba Ofolo no gilidai adabia daabasu melesi meyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:13">Yon 16.13</ref></char></note>Sagoba Ofolo ewemo, Seale Sodone Asubane amo E. Helefealu sigidubuluale idele inolo ilihe, Asubanemo eloba bisigiale, E fadaba dawalobale alebaibune, ilihe E diba diyobafale. Auluso, gilihe E fadaba dawalobu. Enebamo, Ehe gilidai sigia, gine libo usu miliyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Nahe gili kuluba faibegulu melesi gadefia maiyale. Aubale. Na gili labea miyo.<verse eid="JHN 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Hilia fogo wedino alefasia, helefealu sigidubuluale idele inolo ilihe Na saabia no babiyobafale. Auluso, gilimo Na babiyobafe. Maumo, Na bebea lolugulu, gilida bebea miliyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:21-23">Yon 17.21-23</ref></char></note>Hilia amoyamo, gilihe eweguba eloba babiyobafe. Na Ne Naofea labi, gili Nafea labi, Na gilifea lolu. Gilihe auba eloba babiyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Abehe Na molomaba solu sulu amo fedoba sefia, nafuluba kuliba aafemo, ehe Na hamesefe koleba. Aufia, Na-da hamesefe amo, Naohe e hameseyobafe. Aufia, Nahe e hamesefia, Nene Na efea ulufaba waleyo.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yesu auba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[3]], Yemesene faibe">Yudasa</char> Isakaliodo amoale, <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa 3; Yemesene faibe">Yudasa nomohe</char> Yesufea selesia, “Auluso, Saminilo, Gene Ga ninifeasu waleyo adesia, no helefealu idele inolofea waleyo adesalego, enesi ause?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Ausi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Uleno Na hamesesenaga, e koleba, sulu Na walelumo nafuluba kuliba maiyobafe. Ausi, Ne Naohe e hameseyobafe. Aufia, Ani e labea milifasia, e galiba misiyobasu. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:16">Yon 7.16</ref></char></note>Na-da hamesefale amo, e sulu Na walelumo nafuluba kuliba anale. Sulu gili dubulu amo, Ne suluale. Aubale. Amo Nao, Nada hilibailu amone sulu. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Na aso gili galiba ligiamo, kegele amo sunia gilifea saaba melu.<verse eid="JHN 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Auluso, Naohe, Ne wifea alefasia, gili sagoba homesine <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> hilibaiyobafe. Sagoba Ofolo amo Ehe, kegele sunia gilifea waleyobafe. Aufia, sulu sunia Na gilifea solumo, Ehe gili hiliseba obegemesi moloyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Na gili gadefia maiyo ligia, Ne <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealomo</char> gilidai melesi gadefasu. Aealo Na gilifea mesumo, helefealuhe aealo meloguba mesuale. Aubale. Aealo mana na mesumo, gilidai alefalu miliyobafe. Aulugulu, gili libo higinifia, keleba hilisesia sagilimabiyo.<verse eid="JHN 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 20:17">Yon 20.17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sulu na eweguba solumo, gili dubulu. ‘Na gili gadefia maiyobasu. Aufia, Na gili labea obegeba miyobasu.’ Gili auba dubulu. Aulugulu, gilihe Na koleba hamesesenaga, amo gilihe Na ne Nao labea aasumone heneyobafe. Enebamo, Nao E olaibo ligia, Na wasolu koleba labe. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:19">Yon 13.19</ref></char></note>Kegele ewe aso holobagabale labi, Na aga gilifea ama saaba melu. Ausiane, amo dufia holobagasimo, gili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule waaleyobafe</char>.<verse eid="JHN 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Nahe gilidai sulu aso selale saeyalebu. Maumo, helefealu eweda yasilomo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Helefealu eweda yasilo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe ogo, Sedene amone selefe.</char></note> e aga saabe. Ehe Nafea kegele uleno moloyone kiwigagalu male. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Auluso, kegele amo aga moloyobafemo, mau ewene moloyobafe. Helefealu idele inolo ilihe Na Ne Nao hamesebuba hilisemesine, kegele amo aga moloyobafe. Aufia, ilihe Na Nao molomafe sulu kuliba aasuba hilisemesine, kegele amo moloyobafe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">Aulugulu, nini degefia afa dedalema.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Waini efolo amone sabu sealemo, Yesu amo E</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea sulu saabia selesia, “Nene Na-mo, <char style="w">waini</char> efolo amone sabu sealemo, Na lolu. Waini efolo amone gelu bisomo, Ne Nao E labe. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:10">Mad 3.10</ref></char></note>Odo sunia sebe helelesiale Nafea kulifia alebaibu amo, Naohe ili amo Nafeafia sogaba dafalilo. Auluso, odo sunia nafea kulifia ligia, sebeda helelefe ili amo, sebe wedinale nafulusia helelemesi, Naohe odo amo nafuluba momoloba ofolo. Momoloba ofelesiamo, Ehe odo amone kau wedinomo safe balu dilosi, gogoleba dafalilo. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Gili sunia, odo momoloba ufulu amone alebaibu. Enebamo, sulu Na gilifea saaba melu amo alefasia, gili momoloba ufulu. Aulune, gili ama galagololu alebaibu. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Gili koleba Nafea kulifia alebaimale. Ausi, Nada gilifea kulifia miliyo. Odohe, waini efolone sabufea kulifia adesalenaga, amo elebisu ligia, sebe heleyobafale. Aubasu, gilihe Nafea kulifia alebaisalenaga, amo gilida sebe heleleyobafale.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Nene Na waini efolone sabu labi, gili Ne odo alebaibu. Inolohe Nafea kulifia adesi, Nada efea kulifia adesenaga, amo efea sebe wedinale heleleyobafe. Gili Na afelesenaga, amo gilibisu ligia, sebe ulenoda heleleyodoluale miliyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mad 7.19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:42">13.42</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, inolo uleno Nafea kulifia adesalenaga, amo e bausoyobafe. Odo sogaba dafalesi bausologuba, e bausoyobafe. Aufia, ilihe odo bausolu amo gagaiyofia, de saidafogosia gameyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Gili Nafea kulifia adesi, ne sulu gine libo usu ufia adesenaga, amo gine hamefeguba haalisi, kegele gili haalife amo, sunia meyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:16">Mad 5.16</ref></char></note>Gili koleba sebe wedinale helelesia, Ne <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> alebaisi, Ne Naohe wi bule elalelu diyobafe.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Naohe Na bule koleba hamesebuguba, Nahe gilida aubasu hamesebu. Hilia sunia gili ne hameselo usu ami melale. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:15">Yon 14.15</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 2:5">1Yon 2.5</ref></char></note>Nahe Naone molomalu sulu nafuluba kuliba daafia ligia, Na Ene hameselo usu lolu. Aubasu, gilida Ne molomalu sulu nafuluba kuliba aasenaga, gili Ne hameselo usu ami miliyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Ne henelo gine libo usu labi, gine henelo wasigaaba samodofia melesi, Na sulu ewe gilifea selesu.<verse eid="JHN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yon 13.34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Na molomaba solu sulumo, ewe, Na gili hamesebugubasu, gilida gine geleba aubasu hamesemale. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:11">Yon 10.11</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:16">1Yon 3.16</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, inolo ulenohe ene damene hamesesia, ili sagoba waalesia, ene miliyolu weasesenaga, ene hameselo mana amohe, hameselo mana noolo sunia wasolu dobu. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:50">Mad 12.50</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, gilihe Na molomaba soluguba molosenaga, amo gili ne damene alebaibu. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" /><char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">Balu dabalu mololo faibehe</char>, kegele ene yasilo moloyo daiyafemo, eloba bolale. Aulugulu, Nahe gili balu dabalu mololo faibeba saabia no saeyale. Aubale. Gili aga ne damene koleba alebaibugulu, Nahe sulu sunia, Na Naofea dubulu amo, gilifea saaba melu.<verse eid="JHN 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Gilihe Na molobebeleluale. Aubale. Nahe gili molobebelelu. Nahe gili iminilumo, gili dedalefia, sebe helelemesine gadefalu. Sebe gilifea heleleyobafe amo, adabia daabasu labi, gilihe Ne wifea alefasia kegele uleno haalifemo, Ne Naohe gilifea meyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yon 13.34</ref></char></note>Na molomaba solu sulumo ewe, ‘Gili gine geleba hamesemale.’ ” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helefealu idele inolohe walelu faibili ilifea gisa alebaiyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea saabia selesia, “Helefealu sigidubuluale idele inolohe gilifea gogoloba besenaga, amo gilihe eweguba asigimale. Ilihe Nafeadale gogoloba abulu. Auba asigimale. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:14">Yon 17.14</ref></char></note>Gili helefealu idele inolo alolubiaga, amo helefealu idele inolo ilihe, gili ili waagulubusia, gili auba hamesebaiyo. Auluso, gili helefealu ewene alebaibuale. Aubale. Gilihe helefealu mana ewefea hamaba samesisia, nahe gili molobebelelu. Ausi, gili ine manafea hamaba selefemone, helefealu idele inolohe gilifea gogoloba bolo. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yon 13.16</ref></char></note>Sulu Na gilifea walelumo hiliseba obegemale. ‘<char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibehe</char> ene yasilo waseba sunialale.’ Aulugulu, helefealu idele inolohe Nafea wolu mololunaga, gilifeada aubasu wolu moloyobafe. Auluso, ilihe Ne sulu kuliba dedalelunaga, gine suluda aubasu kuliba dedaleyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Nada hilibailumo dawalobale alebailu ilihe, Ne wi gilifea labemo alefasia, gilifeada woba moloyobafe.<verse eid="JHN 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Na iwi milifasia, ilifea sulu saaba melualebiaga, amo ine heleba daalu uleno ilifea alebaiyale. Auluso, agamo ili Ne sulu dubulu amone, ili elaloba sulu saeyo male. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:16">Lug 10.16</ref></char></note>Inolo Na-da gogoloba besabemo, ili amohe Ne Naoda gogoloba besabe. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Na ili aleba ligia, inolo uleno mololaleguba mololualebiaga, amo ine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> amone heleba daalu uleno ilifea alebaiyale. Auluso, aga momolelu kegele Na mololu amone baafia, ilihe aso Nada, Ne Naoda, gogoloba besabe. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Sng 35.19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69.4</ref></char></note>Holobagafe ewemo, Godene bugo selelu dobu amone wakaliba hugamesi aufe. Sulu amo eweguba. <char style="qt">‘Ilihe mauda male, Na gogoloba abulu.’</char><verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 14:26">Yon 14.26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sagoba Ofolo inigiamo, Ehe Na saaba ulufaba saaba dafelagoyobafe. Nahe Naofeafia E gili labea milesi hilibaiyobasu. Seale Sodone Asubane amo E-mo, Naofeafia miyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Aufia, gili maugaiya amifia adabia inigia, agada Nadai alebaibune, gilida Na saaba ulufaba saaba dafelagomale.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Gine asigi ule ufulu hodobaimesialene, Na sulu ewe gilifea saaba mesu. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:9">Mad 24.9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:22">Lug 6.22</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:22">Yon 9.22</ref></char></note>Gili ilidai guluguluyo milabiyosia, ilihe elo ofelesia, gili gine mosomu baea melaeyobafe. Aufia dufia, ilihe gili dufiyobafe hiliamo holobagaeyobafe. Ilihe Godene dabalu nafulu molosusia, gili dufa daneyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:21">Yon 15.21</ref></char></note>Ili Ne Nao dawalobale ligia, Nada dawalobualene, ilihe auba moloyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Fogo amo holobagasimo, gilihe sulu Na gilifea auba haguguba solu amomo, hiliseba obegemesine, Nahe gilifea ewe aga saaba mesu. Samini Na gilidai alolumone, Na gilifea sulu ewe aso saaba meluale.”<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Asubane Noekene dabalu mololo amone seleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Yesu Ene walelu faibilifea saabia selesia, “Aga Namo, Nada hilibailu labea aasu. Auluso, gili ulenohe Nafea ‘Ga wagi aaseba’ doba besabeale. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Sulu ewe Na gilifea saaba melumohe, aga gine libo higiniba yaabu. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:16">Yon 14.16</ref></char></note>Auluso, Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, Na gili sagoba ufiyosia, gili gadefia aasu. Na gili gadefia aasalenaga, Sagoba Ofolo gili labea miyobafale. Auluso, Na aasenaga, Nahe E gili labea hilibaiyo. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />E inigiamo, helefealu idele inolofea eweguba fadaba asigimesi ulufaba waleyobafe. Ehe ilifea <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolune</char> mauda, mana isolu galagololune mauda, osolaeyone mauda, waleyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Wolune maumo ewe. Ili Nafea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufuluale</char>. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Mana isolu galagololune maumo ewe. Na Nao labea aasi, gili Na saabia no babiyobafale. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:31">Yon 12.31</ref></char></note>Osolaeyone maumo ewe. Sedene, helefealu eweda yasilomo, osolaba dafulu dobu. Asubane milifasia, Ehe mau osoloa amone fadaba asigimesine ulufaba waleyobafe.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 3:1-2">1Kld 3.1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nahe sulu wedinale gilifea saeyo hamefe. Auluso, gili aga sulu amo diba diyodoluale alebaibu. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Auluso, seale koleba sodone Asubane saabimo, Ehe gine asigi luba dibia aasimo, gilihe seale sulu sodo amo sunia fadaba asigiyobafe. Ehe Ene asigifeguba sulu saeyobafale. Aubale. Sulu E dobelefe amonesu saeyobafe. Aufia, Ehe kegele sunia dufia aso holobagaeyobafe amone gilifea saaba meyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Ehe Ne kegelemone difasia, gili asigimesine saaba meyobafe. Mana ewe alefasia, Ehe Nafea wi bule wabialelo meyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Kegele sunia Naone dobu amo Ne. Aulune, Na selesia, Asubanehe Ne kegele amone difasia, gilifea saaba meyobafe.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Higinilu walelu faibili difemo, henelohe fogo amo alibiayobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 14:19">Yon 14.19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea saabia selesia, “Fogo wedino alefasia, gilihe Na saabia no babiyobafale. Aufia dufia, fogo bilaledeno no alefasia, gilihe Na haiba babiyobafe.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Yesuhe auba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ili aleba ami, noolohe ine geleba nenesia, eweguba seleso. “E selesia, fogo wedino alefasia, ‘Gilihe Na babiyobafaleba’ selefe. Aufia, E selesia, ‘Dufia, fogo bilale no alefasia, gilihe Na babiyobafeba’ selefe. Aufia, E selesia, ‘Na Nao labea aasuba’ selefe. E auba selefemo, mau enebane selefe?” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Ili auba doba beabasu ligia, selesia, “‘Fogo wedino alefasiaba’ selefemo, E mau enebane selefe? Ninihe sulu E selefe amone maumo hilisebuale.” Walelu faibili ili aleba ami auba neneso.<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Ausi, sulu amone ilihe Efea doba babaiyefe baafia, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Gilihe gine geleba nenesia, sulu Na solu amone mau isasia selesela? Na selesia, ‘Fogo wedino alefasia, gilihe Na babiyobafaleba’ solu. Aufia, ‘Dufia, fogo bilaledeno no alefasia, gilihe Na babiyobafeba’ solu. Na auba solumone, mau isasela? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, gili bule yeesia, yagunagaba yegilisia waalesimo, helefealu idele inolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Helefealu idele inolo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, sigidubuluale idele inolo ili amone selefe.</char></note> ilimo heneyobafe. Gine libo higiniba yaeyobafe. Auluso, gine libo higiniba yaafe ogo, dufia nolosia, henelo holobagaeyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Idohe faibe haseyone fogo adesimo, e nagalo. Ausi, e libo higinilo. Auluso, e faibe hasefia ligiamo, e ene nagalomo saabia no asigilale. Aubale. Ehe faibe helefealu iwi seba dulu amone henelo. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Amogubasu, gine libo higiniba yaeyomo, fogo aga adefe. Auluso, Nahe gili haiba saabia babiyobasu. Ausimo, gine libo saabia heneba yaeyobafe. Ausi, inolo ulenohe gine henelo amo diba dafiyobafale. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:7">Mad 7.7</ref></char></note>Ausi, fogo ami, gilihe kegele uleno Nafea doba babiyobafale. Na seale koleba gilifea selesu. Gilihe Ne wifea alefasia, kegele uleno Naofea haalisenaga, amo Ehe gilifea meyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Samini gilihe Ne wifea alefasia, kegele uleno diyone aso haaliluale. Auluso, aga gili haalisi, gili diyobafe. Ausi, henelo gine libo wasigaaba dafiyobafe.” Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe helefealu ewene kiwigagalu wasolu labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Nahe gilifea besi sulu solu. Dufia, besi sulu saabia no saeyalene fogo holobagaeyobafe. Fogo ami, Na besi sulu saabale, Ne Nao amone saaba sulu gilifea ulufaba sawaba saeyobasu. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Fogo amohe, gine gilihe Ne wifea alefasia, Godefea haaliyobafe. Nao gili sagoba homesi, Nene Nahe Efea haaliyone dabalu olofa Nafea fogo ami, saabia no moloyo male. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:21">Yon 14.21</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 14:23">23</ref></char></note>Aubale. Nao Ene alefasia, gili hamesebu. Maumo, gilihe Na hamesefia, Na Godefea alefasia mulu labeba <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule waalelu</char> dobu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Na Naodai alefasia inigia, helefealu iwi huga mulu. Agamo Na helefealu afasia, Na Nao labea obegeyobasu.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Ausi, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> Efea selesia, “Eee, aga Ga fadaba selefe. Aga Ga besi sulu selefale. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Aga nini hilisebu. Inolo ulenohe Gafea aso doba abuluale labi, kegele e hilisebumo, Ga asigibu. Ga kegele sunia hilisebu. Aulugulu, ninihe Ga Godefea alefasia muluba asigi ule waalesu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Ili auba selesi, Yesuhe ine sulu obegeba selesia, “Sedalele yaagi, gili asigi ule ofelesela? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:31">Mad 26.31</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:56">56</ref></char></note>Doma. Gili gine moloa moloaba budiba dedalemesi moloyobafe fogomo holobagaeyobafe. Eee, fogo amo aga holobagabu. Gili auba budiba dedalesiamo, Na nelebi melesi gadefia dedaleyobafe. Auluso, Na nelebi hafiniba miliyale. Mau enebamo, Ne Nao Nadai labe.<verse eid="JHN 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 14:27">Yon 14.27</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 5:1">Lom 5.1</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 5:4">1Yon 5.4</ref></char>
    </note>Gili Nafea kulifia ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> melesine, Na sulu ewe gilifea solu. Fogo aga gili helefealu iwi ligia, higinilu noolo gili labea holobagaeyobafe. Auluso, gine libo kiwigaafia melale. Nahe helefealu ewene kiwigagalumo dufa dafogofia, kaamo lolu.” Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe ene meleba hilisesia Godedai sulu seleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea sulu auba saaba samodofia, E <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefealo</char> baaba lagofia, Enaodai sulu eweguba seleso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 17:1" />
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 17:1">“Nao, halosi fogomo goalu dobu. Ge Faibehe Gafea wi bule wabialelomo memesi, aga Ga koleba ge Faibefea wi bule wabialelo mema. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Mau enebamo, E idele inolo sunia yasimesine, Gahe Efea wi solu kiwida meso. Ehe idele inolo Ga Efea melu amofea <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> memesi, Ga Efea wida solu kiwida auba meso. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:20">1Yon 5.20</ref></char></note>Miliyolu miliyoba selefemo ewe. Idele inolo ilihe Gadai, Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char> Edai, fadaba asigibu, amone selefe. Ga uluse koleba, seale Gode labe. Aufia, Yesu Keliso, Ga hilibailu amo E.<verse eid="JHN 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:34">Yon 4.34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Na alefasia, dabalu Gahe Nafea molomesi melu amo, moloba samodosiamo, helefealu iwi Gafea wi bule wabialelo melu. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:1">Yon 1.1</ref></char></note>Nao, helefealu aso holobagabale labi, Na Gadai ligia, wi bule <char style="w">elalelu</char> alolu. Aga, Na Gadai saabia miliyobafemo, Ga wi bule elalelu amo saabia Nafea mema.” Yesuhe Ene Enaodai auba sulu seleso.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Ene walelu faibili hilisesia, Godedai sulu seleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Aufia, Yesu Ene Enaodai sulu selesiamo, eweguba gegoaba seleso.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 17:6" />
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 17:6">“Helefealu aleba iwi, idele inolo Ga iminifia, Nafea melu ili amofea, Nahe Ga amobuba bamesi ulufaba walelu. Ili Ge alebaibi, Gahe ilimo Nafea meso. Aufia, ilihe Ge sulumo nafuluba kuliba dedaleso. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Kegele sunia Ga alefasia Nafea melumo, agamo ili hilisesia, Gafea alefasiasu muluba hilisebu. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Sulu sunia Ga Nafea saamesi melumo, Nahe ilifea saaba melu. Aufia, ili sulu amo sigiba dofasia, ili sealeba hilisesia, Na Gafea alefasia muluba hiliseba yaabu. Aufia, ilihe Ga Na hilibailu amofea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule waalebu</char>.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Gahe ili sagoba homesi, Na Gadai sulu selesu. Gahe helefealu idele inolo sunia sagoba homesi, Na Gadai sulu selesuale. Aubale. Nahe Gadai sulu selesumo, idele inolo Ga Nafea melu amone selesu. Enebamo, ili amo Ge koleba alebaibu. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Kegele sunia Na sebumo, amo Ge koleba. Idele inolo Ne alebaibumo, Ge koleba alebaibu. Aufia, kegele sunia Ga sebumo, amo Ne koleba. Ge idele inolo ili amoda, Ne koleba. Idele inolo ili amofea alefasia, Na wi bule elalelu dulu lolu.<verse eid="JHN 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Agamo, Na Ga labea solu. Aufia, Na helefealu iwi saabia no miliyale. Auluso, ilimo helefealu iwi adabasu miliyobafe. Aulugulu, Nao, Ga <char style="w">Noekene</char> koleba. Ge wi Nafea melu amone kiwigagalu amofea alefasia, Ga koleba ili amo hagugufia mela. Ani ule loluguba, ilida aubasu ule koleba melesisia, ili haguguba mela. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:39">Yon 6.39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:18">13.18</ref></char></note>Na ili galiba ligiamo, wi Ga nafea melu amofea alefasia, Nahe ili nafuluba melesi hagugufia alolu. Ausi, ili aleba uleno woba dafulualeso, inolo woba dafiyobafeba solu amo, e-su woba dafulu. Ge bugo selelu dobumo wakaliba hugamesi aulu.<verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Aga Na Ga labea solu. Auluso, Na aso helefealu iwi ligia, Na sulu ewe selesiamo, Ne henelo ine libofea wasiga saumesisia selaba lolu. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Ge sulumo Na ilifea melu. Ausi, helefealu idele inolohe ili gogoloba bolo. Mau ene, Na helefealu eweneale loluguba, ilida aubasu helefealu eweneale alebaibu. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:13">Mad 6.13</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 3:3">2Des 3.3</ref></char></note>Gahe ili helefealu iwi alebaibu amone diba dafalimesi, Na Gafea doba bosoluale. Aubale. Auluso, <char style="w">henane</char> ehe ili woba dafolosi, Gahe ili haguguba melaba selesu. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Na helefealu eweneale loluguba, ilida aubasu helefealu eweneale alebaibu.<verse eid="JHN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Ge sulu amo, seale sodo sulu koleba. Ge sulu seale sodo amohe, ine libo usu dabalu molosi, ili Gadai <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu melesi moloba ofolo">muuba kalilu noekene adaaba yaamesi moloba homa</char>. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:21">Yon 20.21</ref></char></note>Gahe Na helefealu iwi hilibaisoguba, Nada ili amogubasu helefealu iwi hilibaisasu. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Aufia, Na Gadai muuba kalilu noekene ligia, ili sagoba ufiyofia, Ne miliyolu sunia Gafea mesu. Ilida seale koleba Gadai muuba kalilu noekene melesisia, ausu.” Yesuhe Ene Enaodai sulu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe sigidubulu idele inolo sunia hilisesia Godedai sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Yesuhe Ene Enaodai sulu aso selaba ligia, E saabia selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 17:20" />
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 17:20">“Auluso, Na Ne walelu faibili iwi labe amosu hilisesia, Gadai sulu selesuale. Aubale. Ilihe dufia awalu sulu waleba yaasi, idele inolo noolo dobelesia, Nafea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufiyobafe</char>, ili amoda hilisesia, Gadai sulu selesu. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Nao, Ga Nafea labi, Na Gafea lolu. Na hamefemo, ili sunia aubasu ule alebaimesi hamefe. Aufia, ili Anifeada kulifia alebaimesi hamefe. Auba ule alebaisia, kulifia adesimo, helefealu idele inolohe Ga Na hilibailu amofea asigi ule waaleyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:32">HD 4.32</ref></char></note>Wi bule <char style="w">elalelu</char> Ga Nafea melumo, Na ilifea melu. Ausimo, Ani ule loluguba, ilida aubasu ule alebaiyobafe. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Ili auba ule alebaibi, Na ilifea labi, Ga Nafea labe. Aufia, mana amo alefasia, ili hilise ule koleba helegeba alebaimesi hamefe. Ili auba hilise ule alebaisimo, helefealu idele inolohe Ga Na hilibailuba eloba babiyobafe. Ga Na hamesebuguba, Ga Ne mosomu idele inolo aubasu hamesebuba, helefealu idele inolo ilida auba asigiba yaeyobafe.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Nao, idele inolo Gahe Nafea melumo, ili Nada labea ami, Na galiba alebaimesi hamefe. Ausiamo, ili Ne wi bule elalelu bamesi hamefe. Helefealu aso holobagabale labi, Gahe Na hameselune, Gahe wi bule elalelu amo Nafea melu.<verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Nao, <char style="w">Isolu Galagololu</char>, Ga. Helefealu sigidubuluale idele inolohe Ga dawalobale alebaibu. Auluso, Nahe Ga dawalofia lolu. Aufia, Ne mosomu ili ewehe Ga Na hilibailubamo asigifia alebaibu. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Nahe Ga amobuba ilifea ulufaba walelu. Aufia, Nahe saabia Ga amobuba ulufaba walebasu miliyobasu. Ausimo, hameselo Ga Nafea mefeguba, ilifeada miliyobafe. Aufia, Nene Nada ilifea kulifia miliyo.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 17:26" />
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 17:26">Yesuhe Ene Enaodai sulu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yudasahe Yesu holonoba mesi, ilihe E seba sugaso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Madiyu 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maga 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lugu 22.47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu E Enaodai sulu saaba samodofia, Eda, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilida</char>, ilida aloiya amo afasia, dedalesia, hano Kidolono segefia dedaleso. Hano amo segeba nolobalo ami, olifi gelu ule ami dobiyo. Aufia, Yesuda, Ene walelu faibilida, ili gelu amone yala usu suga dedaleso.<verse eid="JHN 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasamo</char>, Yesuda holonoyo, e hilisesia, Yesuda ili geiya ami dedaleyobafebuba asigilu. Maumo, samini Yesudai, Ene walelu faibilidai, ili geiya ami fogo wedinale gagaiyoba adobiyo. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Ausi, Yudasa inigia, geiya ami sugasia, ehe yobolo mosomuda, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo @">soba melone ibolo selu inoloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Falisi">Falisine</char> dabalu mololo nooloda, ili amo ami luba sefia milibaiso. Milibaisiamo, ilihe naafada, geleda, belagulo kegeleda, sesaifia milibaiso.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Ausi, Yesuhe kegele sunia Efea moloba dafelagoyobafemo asigifia ligia, E ine olegialo saminiba abia, ilifea doba bisigia selesia, “Gili abe isase?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Ili obegeba selesia, “Nasaledene Yesu isasu.” Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Amo Nene Na lolu.” Fogo ami, Yudasa, Eda holonoyomo, ili galiba yoba adeso. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yesuhe amo Nene Na loluba selesi, ili sunia faisaloba hele saabia gelebaisaso.<verse eid="JHN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea saabia doba bisigia selesia, “Gili abe isase?” Ausi, ili selesia, “Nasaledene Yesu isasu.” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Ausi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Amo Nene Na loluba, gilifea ama solu. Aufia, gilihe Na isasenaga, amo Ne walelu faibili ewe waagi dedaleba yaamama.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:12">Yon 17.12</ref></char></note>Mana amomo, sulu E samini solu amone, wakaliba sugaso. Sulu amo ewe. <char style="qt">“Ili Ga nafea melu aleba ami, Nahe uleno daba dafuluale.”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char> <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> helebesi uleno selu sigiba lagofia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolone</char> <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo faibe</char> dufa anogosia, amone koneni inaloalo geleba dafogoso. Dabalu mololo faibe amone wimo, Malakusu. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mad 26.39</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe molomabusia, Fidafea selesia, “Helebesi ogo molo seba obegema! Ga hilisesia, Naohe gaabu Nafea mefe amo, Na namenesialeba hilisesela? Aubale. Naga ewe Na diyobasu.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesu Anase labea lubia aaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Ausi, yobolo mosomuda, ine yasiloda, <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> ibolo seluda, ilihe Yesu seba sugafia, efolohe ene sone dofalu. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Aufia, ilihe E Anase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Anase </char><char style="ft" closed="false">e samini soba melone guni inolo alolumone, e aso Yudane galisolo inolo aleba ami wida solu alolu.</char></note> labea amidale lubia daalu. Anase e Kaiafasene enamolobiyo. Kaiafase e-mo, hamu aga ewene <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> alolubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:49-51">Yon 11.49-51</ref></char></note>Kaiafase amo ehe, samini Yudane guni inolofea asigilo mesia, selesia, “Inolo ulenohe idele inolo alibiasia olasenaga, amo nafuluba” solu amo, e-biyo.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fidahe Yesu waaselaba bisigia, E bolaleba agele maugaba seleso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Madiyu 26.69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maga 14.66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Lugu 22.55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Ilihe Yesu sone dofafia, lubia dedalesi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char> <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidadai</char>, <char style="w">walelu faibe</char> nodai, aalu Yesu sefia dedalefeguba kuliba aaso. Walelu faibe nomo, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> amohe e bolobiyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Walelu faibe nomo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">, Fidadai aafe amomo, e Yone. Bugo eweda selelu amo, e. Ehe ene wi fadaba seleba ufiyo hamebualebuba besabe. Aulune, ehe ene e iminisia, muguba ofelesia, “walelu faibe nomoba” selelu.</char></note> Aulugulu, Yesuda lubia dedalefe ili soba melone guni inolone molo bulene yala usu saabi, e ilidai waagi sugaso. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Auluso, Fidamo, ilihe yala faisa eno aniba yoba melaso. Ausi, walelu faibe no, soba melone guni inoloda bolo amo, e suga daafia, obegeba inigia, ido enoda yasibu amofea, Fida eda waagi suga milesi doba bafasia, ehe Fida lubia sugaso.<verse eid="JHN 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Ido eno saliba yasiba adeso amohe, Fidafea doba bisigia selesia, “Yesune walelu faibe ulenomo, ga dagulo?” Ausi, Fida selesia, “Naale.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Badisi, dabalu mololoda, ibolo seluda, ilihe de gamelu dobia ami ligia, halomesi de ninaba alebaiso. Ausi, amimo Fida eda ilidai de ninaba adeso.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Soba melone guni inolohe Yesufea waneso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Madiyu 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maga 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Lugu 22.66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Fogo hamagi, molo usu ami, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolohe</char> Yesufea wanesia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> amoneda, e waleba ado amoneda, Efea fadaba dobeleso. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Ausi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Na idele inolofea walesiamo, ine <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo moloada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudada</char> gagaiyola <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usu amida, waleba alolu. Na muguba ligia, sulu uleno soluale. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Aulugulu, mau eneyone ga Nafea wanese? Na selesi dubulu ilifea wanema. Sulu Na solumo ili hilisebu.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Yesu auba selesi, ibolo selu uleno ami yoba alolu amohe, Yesu olegia fadaba dowesia, selesia, “Gahe soba melone guni inolo baaba sagilibale, efea auba obegeba selesela?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Ausi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Nahe sulu woba solunaga, amo gahe sulu Na solu amone ulufaba saaba dafelagoma. Auluso, Na sulu eleda solunaga, amo gahe Na dowelumo, enesi ause?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Ausi, Yesu aso dofafia labi, Anase ehe E soba melone guni inolo Kaiafase labea lubia malaso.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fidahe Yesu waaselaba bisigia, E bolaleba aganeboda osoloda saabia seleso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Madiyu 26.71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maga 14.69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Lugu 22.58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char> <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> e kalugaafia, de ninaba alolubiyo. E auba labi, ilihe efea doba bisigia, selesia, “Ga wagada Ene <char style="w">walelu faibe</char> nomo, ga-la?” Ausi, e selesia, “Aa, naale.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melo yasilo</char> amone <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo</char>, Fidahe koneni gelelu amone damene uleno, selesia, “Yesudai olifi geiya ami labi na abulu amo, ga-bile?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:38">Yon 13.38</ref></char></note>Ausi, Fidahe saabia selesia, “Amo naale.” Auba selesi, fogo hamagi haga gogono galaso.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Guni inolo ilihe Yesu Filadusu labea lubia dedaleso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Madiyu 27.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maga 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Lugu 23.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Ausi, Yudane guni inolo ilihe, Yesu sefia luba difasia, Kaiafasene molo afasia, dedalesia, Lomene gafena amone molo bule ami lubia dedaleso. Fogo amomo, keafale kolebabiyo. Ili hilia amone geide <char style="w" lemma="Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilone</char> naiyo naiyo hilisesia, aga Godene si saabia nugumalu baalosifia, ine ili gafenane moloa sugasale.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.28-29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gafena Filadusuda, ene mosomuda, ili Lome inolo. Aulugulu, ili Yudane mana Godene si saabiamo galagololu miliyo amone kuliba anale. Yuda ili hilisesia, yau mosomu no anogodai gegoasi, Godene si saabia nuguma baaloba hiliselo. Aulugulu, ili ine moloa sugalale.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Ili baea yoba alebaibi, <char style="w">Filadusu</char> e molo afasia, ili labea milifasia, ilifea doba bisigia selesia, “Gilihe inolo ogo mau enesi fadaasia, egedidiba godose?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Auba selesi, Yudane guni inolo ili obegeba selesia, “E wolu mololo inoloalebiaga, amo ninihe E ge sone saabia ofaiyale.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:6-7">Yon 19.6-7</ref></char></note>Ausi, Filadusuhe ilifea selesia, “Gilihe E lubia daafia, gine <char style="w">muguli</char> mana E godomaleba” seleso. Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> guni inolo ili obegeba selesia, “Gili Lomene gamanehe, ninifea inolo dufa olamabiyoba elo ufulubiyoba” seleso. <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Saminimo, Yesu Ehe saaba ofelesia, Na eweguba olaeyoba solubiyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu saaba ofelesia, “Na hele amifia digiba lagosi, olaeyobasuba” solu. (Yone 3.14; 12.32-33 ami bamale.) Auba selefemo, E imolane olaeyobafeba saaba ufulu. Lome gamane ili amosu inolo imolane dufa olalo.</char></note> Sulu E auba saaba ufulumo wakaliba hugasia, ililiba ufiyone, ewe amone holobagaso.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Ausi, Filadusu e gamanene molo usu obegeba suga daafia, ehe Yesu e labea milaba wefia, Efea wanesia, selesia, “Ga Yudane kinila?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Filadusu auba selesi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Gene ga hilisebu, amone selesela, me inolo noolohe Namone saaba sulu gafea solu, amone selesela?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:11">Yon 1.11</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Filadusu obegeba selesia, “Eneba labe? Na Yuda inolo lolububa, Ga auba hilisefe dagulo? Ge mosomuda, Ge <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, ilihe Ga ne sone saabia ofeleso. Wolu Ga mololumo, amene koleba?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Ausi, Yesuhe obegeba selesia, “Na Kini Ligia Yasifia Luba Ada amo, helefealu eweneale. Aubale. Na Kini Ligia Yasifia Luba Ada amo, helefealu ewenebiaga, Ne dabalu mololo ilihe Na sagoba ofa belaguba yaabaiye. Seale, ausiabiaga, amo inolo ulenohe Na Yudane sone saabia homesialesia, ili belagubaiye. Auluso, Na Kini Ligia Yasifia Luba Adamo helefealu eweneale. Aubale. No labe.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Auba selesi, Filadusuhe efea dobelesia, “Aulugulu, Ga kini sealela?” Ausi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Ga kiniba selefe ogo, gene selefe. Na seba dulumo, dabalu ewe moloyone aulu. Na helefealu iwi mulumo, sulu seale sodo amone ulufaba saaba dafelagoyone mulu. Ausi, inolo sunia sulu seale sodofealo labemo, ilihe Ne sulu dobolo.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Yesu auba selesi, Filadusuhe Efea doba bisigia, “Sulu seale sodo ogo, amene?” Filadusuhe Yesufea auba doba besabeo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Filadusuhe Yesu imolane uluba homaso</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Madiyu 27.15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maga 15.6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lugu 23.13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">
    <char style="w" lemma="Filadusu">Filadusuhe</char> sulu auba safasia, e <char style="w">Yuda</char> ili labea baea aaso. Aufia, ehe ilifea selesia, “Nahe Efea heleba mololu uleno bosoluale. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Auluso, na gine mana kuliba abia, eweguba mololomo, gili hilisebu. Hamu sunia, <char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> hilia ami, nahe dibolo dafogolu inolo uleno sububa dafogosia malalo. Aulugulu, aga nahe Yudane kini ewe ginefea sububa dafogomesi hamesela?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Filadusu auba selesi, ili wuaaba selesia, “Ogoale! Ga koleba Balabasa sububa dafogoma!” Balabasa e-mo, belagulo inolo alolubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Ausi, Filadusuhe ene yobolo inolofea, Yesu luba difasia, fegomaso. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:11">Lug 23.11</ref></char></note>Yobolo inolo ilihe E fegofasia, efolo aiiye gagalu mabufia, Ene gunia kinine habugagulu, saligaba ofasia, ilihe fagulo genelu uleno Efea kaaba ofeleso. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Aufia, ili E aniba milibaiba ligia, Efea baaba galiba selesia, “Yudane kini, Ga! Nini ga wabialesu.” Auba selesiamo, ilihe Ene bolobolo doweba daleba adeso.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Aufia, Filadusu e saabia baea daafia, idele inolofea eweguba seleso. “Bama. Nahe Efea heleba mololu uleno bosoluale. Gili auba asigimesine, nahe E gilifea baea lubia miyo.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Auba selesi, efolo aiiye gagaluda mabulu habugamo saligaba ufia ligia, fagulo genelumo kaaba ufia ligia, Yesu e baea saabeo. Ausi, Filadusuhe ilifea selesia, “Bama. Inolo amo ewe.”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, ine ibolo selu inoloda, ilihe E bisigia, wuaaba selesia, “Ogo <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba homa-aaa! Ogo imolane uluba homa-aaa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Ili auba wuaaba selesi, Filadusuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Gine gilihe E luba difasia, imolane uluba homa. Nahe Efea heleba mololu uleno bosoluale.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Filadusu auba selesi, Yuda ilihe obegeba selesia, “Ninihe <char style="w">muguli</char> ule dobu. E Godene faibe loluba solu amohe, muguli amo gelesi, muguli amo alefasia, E olaeyo dobu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Filadusuhe sulu amo dofasia, e saabia bule koleba sagiliso. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:12">Mad 27.12</ref></char></note>Aufia, e saabia gamanene molo bule sugafia, Yesufea doba bisigia, “Ga wagifia mulu?” Auluso, Yesuhe sulu uleno efea obegeba selesale. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Ausi, Filadusuhe Efea selesia, “Eneba labe? Ga nafea sulu ulenoda obegeba saeyalebula? Ga sububa dafogoyomoda, Ga imolane uluba ufiyomoda, na wida solu kiwida lolu. Gahe amo fadaba asigibualela?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 10:18">Yon 10.18</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:23">HD 2.23</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:1">Lom 13.1</ref></char>
    </note>Filadusu auba selesi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Auba moloyone wida solu kiwigagalu amo, gafea ana lagifia melualebiaga, Nada yasiyone kiwigagalu amoda, gafea male koleba alebaiye. Aulune, inolo Nada ga sone saabia ufulu ogone <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> amohe, ge woluda bule koleba wasolu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 23:2">Lug 23.2</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:7">HD 17.7</ref></char>
    </note>Filadusuhe Yesu auba selefe dofasia, E sububa dafogoyone eno isaso. Auluso, Yuda ili eweguba wuaaba selesia, “Gahe inolo ogo sububa dafogosenaga, amo ga <char style="w" lemma="Sisa">Sisane</char> dameneale. Inolohe ene meleba e kiniba selesenaga, amo e Sisane gisa labe. Aulugulu, ga Efealo adesia, gada Sisadai gisa miliyobafe.” Yudane guni inolo ilihe Filadusufea auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Filadusu sulu amo dofasia, ehe Yesu ulubia baea aaso. Aufia, e osolalone ailalu saabia yoba aseleso. Ailalu amo, Abane Balele Ufuluba soda ami ufulu dobiyo. <char style="w">Hibulu</char> sulubamo, amo <char style="sls">Gabada</char>ba sodo. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Fogo Filadusu e osolalone ailalu saabia yoba asulumo, Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo amone Madeneyo Hilia amone halo dogo adeso. Filadusuhe Yesumo Yuda ine olegia kalugaamesi ifoba ofasia, ilifea selesia, “Gine kini ewe bama.”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Ausi, ili wuaaba selesia, “Diba dama! Diba dama! Ogo imolane uluba homa-aaa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Ausi, Filadusu ilifea dobelesia, “Nahe gine kini ewe imolane uluba homesi hamesela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Ausi, soba melone guni inolo ili obegeba selesia, “Sisa e nine kini ule e-su labe. Nine kini no male koleba.” <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Ili auba selesi, Filadusuhe Yesumo imolane uluba homesi, ine sone saabia ofeleso.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesumo imolane uluba ofeleso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Madiyu 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maga 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lugu 23.26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Ausi, yobolo inolo ilihe Yesu lubia aaso. Ausi, Yesu E <char style="w">imolane</char> Eda uliyomo Ene digifia, hele Guni Kiwiba soda ami uluba sefia aaso. <char style="w">Hibulu</char> sulubamo, ilihe hele amo <char style="sls">Gologoda</char>ba sodo. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Ami goafia, ilihe E <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba ofeleso. Aufia, ilihe inolo aidamo, no nolobalo, nomo nolobaloba, uluba ofeleso. Ausi, Yesu E dogolea uluba ufiya adeso.<verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Filadusu">Filadusuhe</char> sulu uleno seleba ofasia, Yesune guni saabia imolane baaba homaso. Sulu amo eweguba, <char style="sc">Nasaledene Yesu, <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> Kini.</char><verse eid="JHN 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Sulu ewe Hibulu sulubada, Lome sulubada, Giligi sulubada, seleba ufulu baaso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sulu ewe Hibulu sulubada, Lome sulubada, Giligi sulubada, seleba ufulumone </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mau ewe. Inolo hele wedinalefia Yelusalame ami milibaifasia alebailu. Ilihe sulu osoloa amone selaba ado.</char></note> Hele Yesuda imolane uluba ufuluiyamo, sidi hagoaleba ami ufulune, Yuda wedinale ami milibaiba ligia, sulu selelu baaba ufulu amo alegaso. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Ausi, Yudane <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ilihe Filadusufea selesia, “Gahe <char style="it">Yudane kini</char>ba seleba ufulumo, nafuluale. Ga eweguba selefia alibiasenaga, amo nafulu. <char style="it">Inolo ewe selesia, ‘Na Yudane kiniba’ seleso</char>.” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Ili auba selesi, Filadusu obegeba selesia, “Hama. Na selelumo dobu hamaga.” <figure style="fig" alt="Inscription, King of the Jews" file="43_Jn_19_08_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="19.19-22">Nasaledene Yesu, Yudane Kini</figure><verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Ausi, yobolo ilihe Yesu imolane uluba ofasia, ilihe Ene fagulo huba ufulumo difasia, binibaba osolafia, ilihe ule uleba diso. Auba ililiba osolaba disi, Yesune saligalo selale amo aso afeleso. Saligalo selale amo haisi haisiba asogolualene, asulu ule ufulubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Sng 22.18</ref></char></note>Auba ufulu baafia, yobolo inolo ilihe ine geleba selesia, “Ninihe amo bidiyobale. Aubale. Ninihe amo abe difelaba babiyone, sadu daiyoba.” Auba mololu amohe, Godene bugo selelu dobumo wakaliba sugamesi auso. Sulu amo eweguba,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 19:24" />
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“<char style="qt">Ilihe Ne fagulo osolafia dulu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, ilihe Ne saligalo abe difelaba babiyone, sadu dailu.</char>”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 19:24" />
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Ewe saaba ufulu dobuguba, yobolo inolo ilihe auba moloso.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:55-56">Mad 27.55-56</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesune imolane aniba amimo, Yesune enaeda, enaene inaloda, aufia Kolofasane eamono <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[2]], Magadala ido">Maliada</char>, aufia Magadala Maliada, ili yoba alebaibiyo. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:23">Yon 13.23</ref></char></note>Yesuhe Ene enae ami labi bisigia, <char style="w">walelu faibe</char> Ene hameselumoda, e aniba yoba labi besabeo. Aufia, Ehe Ene enaefea selesia, “Nae, bama, ge faibemo, aga ogo labe.” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Aufia, Ehe walelu faibe amofea selesia, “Bama, ogo aga ge gae.” Fogo amifia, walelu faibe ewe ehe, Yesune enae ene moloa ulubia daafia, e luba adeso.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu olaso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Madiyu 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maga 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lugu 23.44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:15">Sng 22.15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufasia, Yesu hilisesia, aga Ene dabalu sunia moloba elofeba hiliseso. Aufia, Godene bugo selelu dobu amone wakaliba sugamesi, E selesia, “Ne dogaeyo falafe.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Sng 69.21</ref></char></note>Gofo uleno waini hano besegililuda wasulu aniba ami ufulubiyo. Ausi, ilihe igilo uleno difasia, waini hanofea kaiamesi gefia, hisobo aago dofafia, i aafo uleno dofafasia, Yesune mofeyofea geba lagoso. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Ausi, waini hano amo nafasia, Yesu E selesia, “Aga moloba elofe!” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aga moloba elofe</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba” selefe amo, Giligi sulubamo, kiwi sisa dobumo, no dobu. Amo ewe: dano ili ufulumo sabe duguba samodolu. Eweguba hilisema. Dano nini Godedai ufulu amo, Yesuhe Ene olalu amofea alefasia, E nini alibiasia, sabe duguba samodolu labe.</char></note> Ausi, E gifogolo segeba sugasia, Ene Asubane Godefea meba lagoso.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yobolo inolo ulenohe Yesune afafa gogedolu buba gaaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 21:22-23">Lo 21.22-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aga Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo amone madeneyo hilia labi, adigi no <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> bule miliyo alolubiyo. <char style="w">Yuda</char> ilihe domala amo Sabada hiliahe <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba waalefiasu melesi hamesale. Ausi, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Filadusu">Filadusufea</char> selesia, “Inolo imolane udaba yaalumo, ili alebale olamesi, gahe yobolo inolofea ine emo kiwi waagi gogolemama.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Emo</char><char style="fq" closed="false">gogolema</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba solumo mau ewe: inolo imolane uluba ufulumo, ene hame heeyone, fogo disia, ene emo isosia, elawagalo felaeyo hugaeyoba ado. Ausi, alebale olamesi, ilihe inolo amone emo kiwi gogolelo. </char></note> Aufia, ili olafia labi, ine domala dibia hugamama.” Ilihe Filadusufea auba seleso. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Ausi, yobolo inolo ili abia, inolo Yesu aniba imolane uluba ufulu agelemo, ene emo kiwi gogolefia, inolo aganebomo ene emo kiwida gogoleso. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Auluso, ili Yesu uluba ufuluiya goasia, bosolufalumo, E ama olalu besabeo. Aulune, ilihe Ene emo kiwi gogolesale. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Auluso, yobolo inolo ulenohe Yesune afafa gogedolu buba gaasi, ibidai hanodai alebale sagaso.<verse eid="JHN 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 21:24">Yon 21.24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo eweda abulu amohe, ewene ulufaba saaba dafelagofe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Inolo eweda abulu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, Yone ene meleba selefe.</char></note> Sulu e ulufaba saaba dafelagofe, amo seale koleba. Aufia, ene ehe seale selefeba asigibu. Aulune, gilida <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule homesine</char>, ehe molosi abulu amone ulufaba saaba dafelagofe. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:20">Sng 34.20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:46">Kis 12.46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Nam 9.12</ref></char></note>Kegele ewe mololumo, Godene bugo selelu dobu amone wakaliba sugamesine auso. Saaba ofa sulu amo eweguba, <char style="qt">“Ene kiwida uleno gogoleyobafale.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Sek 12.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">MUU 1.7</ref></char></note>Aufia, Godene bugohe saaba ofa solu sulu no selelu dobumo, eweguba, <char style="qt">“Ine gogedolu buba gelu inolo amo, ilihe sidafia alebaiyobafe.”</char><verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesune domala abane dana hili nageleiya ami diba ofeleso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Madiyu 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maga 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lugu 23.50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Aufia, dufia Alimadia inolo <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[4]], Alimadia dauno inolo alolu ">Yosebehe</char> <char style="w">Filadusu</char> labea daafia, Yesune domala e waagi dibia maiyobileba doba besabeo. Yosebe ewe, Yesune <char style="w">walelu faibe</char> uleno e aloluso, e guni inolo ili sagilisia, ene asigi ule ufulu muguba ufulubiyo. Filadusuhe efea sulu eeba selesi, Yosebe e abia, Yesune domala sububa dibia huga saabeo. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1-2">Yon 3.1-2</ref></char></note>Aufia, Nikodimase, samini nigili uleno Yesu labea sobele mulu inolo amo, eda e galiba saabeo. E inigia, olalu domala heeyone, kasineda kegele nafulu dia saabeo. Kasineda kegele amone higinilumo, kilo daabuluba osoloa amogulubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Yosebedai, Nikodimasedai, aaluhe kasineda kegele amo fagulo sosalu saabia waalefasia, amodaiba Yesune domaladai homogoso. Yuda ilihe olalune domalafea molologuba moloso. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Yesuda <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba ufuluiya aniba amimo, olifi gelu uleno ufulubiyo. Geiya amimo, olaluda aso diba ofolale dana hili uleno ufulubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Yudane Sigilo Madeneyo Hilia alolune, halo hugafe baafia, aaluhe Yesune domalamo dia abia, dana hili amone usu diba ofeleso. Enebamo, dana amo hagoale ufulune auso.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Dana balu dobi besabeo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Madiyu 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maga 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lugu 24.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Sabada hilia amone faisa, hilia agele adesi, keafale koleba, aso nigiligagalu dobi, Magadala <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[2]], Magadala ido">Malia</char> abia, e Yesune domala diba ufuluiya dana ami goasia, bosolufalumo, abane, dana eno salibada kaalumo, diba dafulu dobi abulu. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Aufia e-mo, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char> <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidada</char>, <char style="w">walelu faibe</char> nomo Yesune hameselu amo eda, aalu labea naguba abia, goafia, ehe aalufea selesia, “Ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> domalamo dana amifia dia daalubu. Ilihe E wagi ufulubi, nini asigibuale.” Auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Ausi, Fidada, walelu faibe no amoda, aalu Yesune domala dana ufuluiya ami maiyo aaso. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Aalifaba naguba daaluso, walelu faibe no amohe, Fida waseba suniaba abia, edale dana ufuluiya ami goaso. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />E waaba ilogofia, dana baaba ilogosufalumo, ehe fagulo sosalu diba dobi besabeo. Auluso, e dana usu sugasale. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Aufia, Saimono Fida e faisa inigia, ami goaso. Aufia, e dana usu sugafia, eda fagulo sosalu amo dobi besabeo. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />Aufia, ehe Yesune gunida dofalu fagulo amo, elebi nolobalo dobi besabeo. Fagulo amo, fagulo sosaludai ua diba ufulualebiyo. Aubale. Amo elebi amaleba ufia alolubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Ausi, walelu faibe nomo, edale Yesune dana ufuluiya goafia alolu amo, eda dana usu sugaso. Aufia, ehe auba ufia labi baafia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofeleso</char>. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:24-32">HD 2.24-32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:4">1Kld 15.4</ref></char></note>Enebamo, fogo ewemo ilihe Godene bugo alegasia, Yesu olaiyafia haiba degeyobafeba saaba ofa sulu solu amo, aso asigiba duluale alolubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Ausi, walelu faibe aida amo, aine aloiya ami obegeba aaso.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Magadala Malia ehe Yesu abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Madiyu 28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maga 16.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[2]], Magadala ido">Malia</char> e Yesune domala ufuluiya dana aniba yoba ligia, yeeba alolu. E yeeba ligia, waaba ilogofia, dana usu baaba ilogolu. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Ausia, ehe <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char>, fagulo hoolu saligalu, aida ami yoba saabi abulu. Aalu amo Yesune domala samini diba ufuluiya ami yoba asulu. Ulenomo gunifealo, ulenomo emofealoba yoba asulu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Ausi, aaluhe Maliafea doba bisigia, selesia, “Ido, ga enesi yeeba ele?” Ausi, ehe aalufea obegeba selesia, “Ilihe ne Saminilo dibia daalu ewe, ili wagi ufulubi, na asigibuale.”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 24:16">Lug 24.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 21:4">Yon 21.4</ref></char>
    </note>E auba saafia, nolosia, bosolufalumo, Yesu ami yoba labi abuluso, ehe amo Yesu labeba eloba abuluale. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Ido, ga enesi yeese? Ga abe isase?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Malia ehe inolo amo gelu biso labebuba hilisesia, ehe Efea selesia, “Inolo, ga koleba E dia daalunaga, ga E ami ufuluba, nafea saama. Na E dia maiyoba.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Ausi, Yesu selesia, “Malia.” Ausi, Malia nolosia, Efea <char style="w">Hibulu</char> suluba selesia, <char style="sls">“Labuni!”</char> Sulu amone sisamo ewe, “ne walelo”.<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 8:29">Lom 8.29</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:11-12">Hib 2.11-12</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Ga Nafea semabu. Maumo, Na Nao labea lago aso fela daaluale. Auluso, ga daafia, Ne nelewodalifea eweguba saamale. Na felaeyobasumo, Ne Naoda, gine Gaoda, Ne Godeda, gine Godeda, labea felaeyobasuba selesoba saamale.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Yesu auba selesi, Magadala Malia ehe, <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ili labea daafia, selesia, “Na Saminilo abulume!” Aufia, Yesuhe efea saaba melumo, ehe ilifea awaso.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walelu faibili ilihe Yesu besabeo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Madiyu 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maga 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lugu 24.36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Sogo alegalu amone hilia maugaba ageleba alolu hamagane geide, <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> <char style="w">Yuda</char> baaba sagilisia, eno kakafia, gagaiyoba kakainabi, bosolufalumo, Yesu E ili aleba hamagi holobagafia kalugaaso. Aufia, Ehe ilifea selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">Aealo</char> gilidai miliyobafe.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:22">Yon 16.22</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 1:1">1Yon 1.1</ref></char></note>E auba saafia, Ene soneda, Ene afafada ilifea waleso. Walelu faibili ilihe Saminilo baaba golesia, ili henelu bule koleba adeso.<verse eid="JHN 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Ausi, saabia Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Gine libo ogo aeaba mela. Naohe Na hilibaisi, Na mulu. Aubasu, Na gili malesi hilibaisu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ehe auba saafia, Ene hame hoo ilifea fuuba dafalibagosia selesia, “Gili <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> dima. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mad 16.19</ref></char></note>Gilihe inolo none <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galisenaga</char>, amo inolo amone wolu heesia galilu labe. Aufia, gilihe inolo none wolu seba fedofia labenaga, amo ene wolumo seba fedofiasu labe.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Domase ehe Yesu abulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Yesu E Ene walelu faibili ili labea holobagalu fogo ami, walelu faibe huguluba amone uleno ili galiba alolualebiyo. Amo <char style="w" lemma="Domase">Domase</char>. Ene wi nomo, Didimusu. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Ausi, dufia, <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> noolo ilihe efea selesia, “Ninihe Saminilo abulume.” Auluso, Domasehe ilifea selesia, “Nahe mili Ene sone ululu imini amoda babale, aufia ne sone mili sugalu amone iminida gebale, aufia Ene afafa ololumoda ne sone gebale, na <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufiale</char> koleba.” Domase auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Sogo alegalu ule daafia, walelu faibili ili saabia molosu ami kakainafia labi, Domase eda ili galiba asulubiyo. Ili eno sunia kakaba yaaluso, Yesu E holobagafia, ili aleba kalugaaso. Aufia, E selesia, “Gine libo ogo <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> melaba” seleso. <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Aufia, Ehe Domasefea selesia, “Ga inigia, ge sone binibo ogo iwi geyo mila. Aufia, ga Ne sone bama. Aufia, ge sone ogo Ne afafa koleba geyo mila. Ga asigi aidaba dabagalaba melabiyo. Ga asigi ule homale.”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Yesu auba selesi, Domasehe Efea obegeba selesia, “Ga ne Saminilo. Ga ne Gode.” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:8">1Fid 1.8</ref></char></note>Domase auba selesi, Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, “Ga Na baafia, asigi ule ufulu. Idele inolo ili Na babale, asigi ule waalefemo, ine henelo wasigafia labe.” Yesu auba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yonehe bugo ewe selelumone mau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesuhe <char style="w" lemma="Momolelu kegele">eloba bamesine momolelu kegele</char> wedinale nooloda <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ine si saabia mololuso, amo bugo ewe seleba ufuluale. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:15">Yon 3.15</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:17">Lom 1.17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 5:13">1Yon 5.13</ref></char></note>Auluso, sulu na selelumo, gilihe Yesu E <char style="w">Keliso</char> ligia, Godene Faibe labeba asigimesi, bugo ewe seleba ufulu. Ausiane, gili Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesi</char>, gili miliyolu miliyomo Ene wifea alefasia diyobafe.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Walelu faibili domobahe Yesu besabeo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Dufia, Yesu E saabia Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> alebaibia holobagasiamo, E Daibeliase waiyo galulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Daibeliase waiyo galulu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo, wi nomo, Galili waiyo galulu.</char></note> aniba ami holobagaso. Holobagasiamo, eweguba moloso. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" /><char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char> <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Domase">Domase</char>, ene wi no Didimusuda, Galiline mosomu Kana inolo, Nadaniele eda, aufia Sebedine faibe aidada, aufia walelu faibe aida noda, ili ua alolubiyo. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:4-7">Lug 5.4-7</ref></char></note>Ausi, Saimono Fidahe ilifea selesia, “Na hani selege dafogoyo aasume.” Auba selesi, ilihe efea selesia, “Ninida, ga galiba solu.” Aufia, ili dedalefia, hano kasu aleba lagofia, aaso. Auluso, nigiliba amoyamo, ilihe hani ulenoda sigisale.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Keafa hiliasi, Yesu E saii saabia yoba adeso. Auluso, walelu faibili ilihe amo Yesuba eloba besabeale. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea wuaaba selesia, “Faibili! Gili hani noolo dobula?” Ausi, ili obegeba selesia, “Male.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Ausi, E selesia, “Gine selege ogo, hano kasu inaloalofealo dafa ilogoma. Ausi, gili hani sigiyobafe.” Ausi, ili auba molosi, hani saludiale wadesi, ilihe alu selege sigiyo babeaso.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:23">Yon 13.23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 14:29">Mad 14.29</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesune hameselu walelu faibe amo, ehe Fidafea selesia, “Ewe <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilobu</char>.” Saimono Fidahe dabalu molosia, ene saligalo huba ufulubiyo. Aga Saminilobuba selefemo dofasia, ehe ene saligalomo saabia saligafia, hano suba alefasia, Yesu labea saii saabia aaso. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Ausi, walelu faibili noolo hano kasu asefasia, saiifealo inigia, hani selege wadaba yaalu amodai sigiba dibia saabeo. Ili saii dobia inigiamo, hagoaleba saabeo. 100 mida amogulubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Ili saii saabia sugaba adaaba yaasia, bosolufalumo, de gamelu golaba sagalu dobi besabeo. Aufia, hanida <char style="w" lemma="Boledi">boledida</char> de iso saabia soba dobi besabeo. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Hani gili aga sigiba molalu ogo, noolo iwi dia mila.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:6">Lug 5.6</ref></char></note>Ausi, Saimono Fida e hano kasu aleba lagofia, alu selege sigiba dibia inigia, saiifealo saabeo. Hani sodolo alu selege walolumo, 153-falu walolubiyo. Hani wedinale walolu amogulu selege bidibaiyoso, bidilualebu. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Gili naiyo naiyo mila.” Auba selesi, walelu faibili ili sunia momolesia, “Ga abeba” doba babiyone kiwida male alebailu. Ilihe E Saminilo labeba asigiso. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Ausi, Yesu Ehe boledi difasia, ilifea mefia, hanida aubasu meso. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:19">Yon 20.19</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 20:26">26</ref></char></note>Yesu E olaiyafia degefasia ligia, Ene walelu faibili labea holobagalumone fogomo, aga fogo osolobiyo.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ehe Fida momoloba ofeleso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Yesudai, Ene walelu faibilidai, ili naiyo naba samodofia, Yesuhe <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char> <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidafea</char> doba bisigia, selesia, “Yonene faibe, Saimono, gahe Na bule hamesebula? Ga Na hamesesiamo, ili iwi alebaibugo, wasolu elela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Ausi, Fida selesia, “Ee, Saminilo, nahe Ga hamesebumo, Ga hilisebu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Ga koleba, Ne <char style="w" lemma="Dofene sibi edo">dofene sibi edofea</char> naiyo meba melale.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:28">HD 20.28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesuhe efea saabia aganebo doba bisigia, “Yonene faibe, Saimono, gahe Na bule hamesebula?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Ausi, Fida selesia, “Ee, Saminilo, nahe Ga hamesebumo, Ga hilisebu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Ga koleba, Ne <char style="w">dofene sibi</char> nafuluba uluba melale.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Ausi, Yesuhe saabia osolo doba bisigia, selesia, “Yonene faibe, Saimono, gahe Na hamesebula?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesuhe osoloaba doba bisigia, gahe Na hamesebulaba selesi, Fida e libo nagaso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu aso olabale labi, Fidahe Yesu bolaleba osoloaba solu amone obegeba asigisia, e kudumaneba alolu. Aulune, Yesuhe iwi efea osoloaba doba besabe amohe, e libo nagafe. Auluso, Yesuhe osoloaba doba besabe amofea alefasia, Ehe Fidamo momoloba ofelefe. Enebamo, Ehe Fida Efea eweguba obegeba waagi saamesi fogo mefe. Fida Efea osoloaba obegeba selesia, Saminilo, na Ga hamesebuba selefe sulu amohe, na Ga bolaleba solu sulu amo alibiafe. </char></note> Ausi, ehe Yesufea selesia, “Saminilo, Ga kegele sunia hilisebu. Nahe Ga hamesebumo, Ga hilisebu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Ga koleba, Ne dofene sibifea naiyo meba melale.<verse eid="JHN 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Na gafea seale koleba selesu, ga aso faibe ligia, digiasalomo gene ga kaafia, hele ga maiyo hamelufealomo, gene ano. Auluso, ga asidalu adesimo, inolo nohe ge sone digiba lagomafia, ge digiasalo kaaba ofelesia, hele ga maiyo hameyobafale fealomo, ga luba dibia maiyobafe.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:24-25">Mad 16.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 1:14">2Fid 1.14</ref></char></note>Yesuhe sulu auba saaba ofa solumo, Fida e Godefea wi bule elalelu mesia, halaguba olaeyobafe amone iminisia seleso. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus Asks Peter if" file="IB04178.tif" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="21.15-19">Yesu Ehe Fida momoloba ofelefe.</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:19">Auba saafia, Ehe Fidafea selesia, “Ga Na kuliba milibasu mela.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:23-25">Yon 13.23-25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu auba selesi, Fida e nolofasia, Yesune hameselu <char style="w">walelu faibe</char> amo aalu kuliba miliba labi besabeo. Ili samini naiyo naba ligia, Yesune hamesa anifia doba bisigia selesia, Saminilo, abehe ga holonoyobafeba solumo, inolo amo, e-biyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yesune hamesa anifia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">auba doba abulu inolo amo, Yone amo e iminife. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Fidahe e kuliba saabe bisigia, Yesufea selesia, “Saminilo, inolo ogofea amene holobagaeyobafe?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Fida auba selesi, Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, “Nada obegeba saabeyamo, inolo ogo aso helefealu iwi bebea miliyobafeba, Na auba hamesenaga, amo ge kegelela? Aa! Amo ge-ale. Ge kegelemo, amo ewe. Ga koleba, Na kuliba mila.” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Yesu auba solu amone, sulu gi elewodali ine geleba eweguba saaba sigiso. “Walelu faibe ewe olaeyobafale.” Auluso, Yesuhe inolo amo olaeyobafaleba solualebiyo. Aubale. E selesia, “Nada obegeba saabeyamo, inolo ogo aso bebea miliyobafeba, Na auba hamesenaga, amo ge kegelela?” E sulu amosu solubiyo.<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 19:35">Yon 19.35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Walelu faibe ewe, e-su aga sulu kegele noolo ewe ulufaba saaba dafelagosia, bugo ewe seleba ofeleso. Aulugulu, nini eweguba asigibu. Ehe bugo ewe seleba ofelesia, ehe Yesu saaba ulufaba saaba dafelagoba sulu solumo, e sulu seale koleba seleso.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 20:30">Yon 20.30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesuhe kegele nooloda wedinale moloba yaaso. Auluso, kegele Yesu mololu amo sunia seleba samodosiabiaga, na hilisesia, selelu bugo amone ufiyomo, helefealu iwi sunia fogo male ofaiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:25">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="End of Book OnobasuluNarrativeGreen.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="21.25" /><verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>